window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2301,"title":"Chapter 2301 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Song Yichen rubbed his nose and wanted to slip away.","But Feng Qi had an eye on him.","“You!” She pointed at Song Yichen. “I saw you mumbling with Feng Wu earlier! She’s your friend, isn’t she? Where did she go? Tell me!”","Song Yichen shrugged. “Hey, be reasonable.”","Feng Qi smirked. “I don’t care what your relationship is. If Feng Wu doesn’t show up today, I’ll beat you up instead! It’s just not your lucky day!”","Hey!","Song Yichen was furious.","That didn’t make any sense at all!","Seeing Gu Xingcheng and Gu Xingyun, Gu Xingmeng frowned and walked up to them. “What happened?”","“It was Feng Wu!” Gu Xingcheng’s condition had improved, so he gritted his teeth and said, “It was all because of Feng Wu! She injured Feng Qi and our aunt and destroyed their home! And now, she injured me and Xingyun! Brother Xingmeng, you have to teach her a lesson!”","On their way here, Feng Qi had said a lot of bad things about Feng Wu, so Gu Xingmeng had already formed his own opinion. He asked, “Where is she?”","“She’s gone!” Gu Xingcheng smirked. “But she won’t get away! Let’s go to the Feng clan. If they refuse to give her up, we’ll take their houses apart!”","Seeing his injured brothers and the humiliation they had suffered, Gu Xingmeng nodded. “Let’s go!”","“Where are you going?”","Gu Xingmeng turned around to see a stunning girl standing in front of him.","She wore a red dress and looked furious.","“Feng Wu?!”","Gu Xingmeng didn’t know who she was, but everyone else was looking at her in astonishment.","“Didn’t you run off? Why are you back?” Song Yichen was concerned.","Now that Gu Xingmeng was here, Gu Xingyuan would follow. Feng Wu would die!","Feng Yi ignored Song Yichen. She asked Gu Xingmeng, “Are you Gu Xingyuan?”","Gu Xingmeng shook his head. “I’m Gu Xingmeng, their fourth brother.”","Feng Wu frowned. “I don’t want to beat you up. Get Gu Xingyuan here.”","Everyone sucked in their breaths.","What did she mean by not wanting to beat him up?","She sounded as if she could beat up whoever she wanted.","Song Yichen buried his face in his hands. He also thought that Feng Wu was bluffing.","The Gu brothers were shocked at first, but they soon realized what she had said.","Gu Xingyun had passed out. Gu Xingcheng snorted and gave Feng Wu a contemptuous look.","As for Gu Xingmeng...","He sneered at Feng Wu. “Brother Xingyuan is in Year 4, and you’re only a Year 2 student. You must be dreaming if you want to challenge him.”","Because of what had happened to Qiuling, Feng Wu was furious with the whole Gu family. She said, “Then, I’ll beat you up first!”","She charged at him.","She was using the Fire Dragon Rod, and anyone hit by the rod would find it impossible to get away.","Word soon got out that Feng Wu was fighting Gu Xingmeng.","In Chief Qiao’s office in Year 2.","Someone had already gone there to deliver the news.","That person was none other than Qiao Er, Chief Qiao’s second daughter."]},{"number":2302,"title":"Chapter 2302 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Dad! Dad! Feng Wu is fighting again!”","Chief Qiao had never liked Feng Wu. Since Chief Lu, who liked Feng Wu, had gone traveling, there was nothing Chief Qiao needed to worry about.","He sipped his tea and glanced at Qiao Er. “Feng Wu? Do you mean the one who’s eighth on the billboard? There are seven students ranked above her, aren’t there? Let them discipline her.”","“Dad! Feng Wu is fighting the Gu brothers!” Qiao Er said excitedly.","Chief Qiao asked, “Which Gu brothers?”","Qiao Er said, “Which other Gu brothers can they be? The six geniuses, of course!”","Chief Qiao said, “I’m asking because the youngest of the Gu brothers is already the top student in Year 2, and Feng Wu is only eighth. How can she possibly fight him? You should say that Feng Wu is getting beaten up by the brothers, not fighting them.”","Qiao Er said, “It’s not like that, Dad! Feng Wu has already defeated Gu Xingcheng and Gu Xingyun! She’s fighting Gu Xingmeng now!”","“What?!” Chief Qiao only came to his senses then. “What do you mean she defeated Gu Xingyun and Gu Xingcheng?”","Qiao Er said, “What else can I mean? Gu Xingcheng and Gu Xingyun have been beaten up!”","“That’s impossible!” Qiao Yi came into the room at the moment, and she shook her head when she heard what Qiao Er said. “Feng Wu is only eighth on the billboard. Sister, don’t make up stories!”","Qiao Er snapped. “Do you think I want to sing her praises? I want Feng Wu to stay at that level too! I want her to be a Level 7 Spiritual Elder forever! However, she’s made huge progress in the few months that she was gone! There’s nothing I can do!”","Qiao Yi frowned. “Did Feng Wu make huge progress? I thought that was Duan Chaoge.”","Qiao Er said, “Yes, Duan Chaoge is much more capable now, but for some reason, so is Feng Wu!”","Qiao Yi said, “But Feng Wu’s already broken through once. It can’t be happening again! What level is she now? A Level 9 Spiritual Elder?”","Qiao Er said reluctantly, “Gu Xingcheng is the top student in Year 2, and he’s a Level 8 Spiritual Elder.”","Chief Qiao and Qiao Yi nodded in unison.","Qiao Er said, “But Feng Wu severely injured Gu Xingcheng.”","Qiao Yi said, “That is to say, Feng Wu is a Level 9 Spiritual Elder, right?”","Qiao Er glanced at her.","She seemed to see herself in her sister. Qiao Er also wished that Feng Wu was much less capable, but in fact...","“Gu Xingyun came to back his brother up, but Feng Wu almost killed him,” Qiao Er said reluctantly.","“Gu Xingyun is one of the top students in Year 3, and he’s...” Qiao Yi looked at her father.","Chief Qiao rubbed his chin. “He’s a Level 1 Spiritual Lord.”","Qiao Yi sucked in a breath. “That is to say, Feng Wu is a Level 1 Spiritual Lord now...”","Qiao Er looked at her silently.","Qiao Yi had to raise her estimation a little. “A Level 2 Spiritual Lord?”","Qiao Er said, “Gu Xingmeng is fighting Feng Wu now. Let’s go have a look!”","If Gu Xingmeng could defeat Feng Wu, her cultivation level was still within expectations. Otherwise... Qiao Yi’s stomach lurched.","How did Feng Wu do it?","The students who had entered Imperial College at the same time as Feng Wu were still in Year 1, but she could already fight a Year 3 student..."]},{"number":2303,"title":"Chapter 2303 - Untitled","paragraphs":["When Chief Qiao arrived —","Feng Wu was pointing the Fire Dragon Rod at Gu Xingmeng’s head. “You’re not so arrogant now, are you?”","Everyone around them had fallen silent.","No one dared to utter a word.","Gu Xingmeng was a Level 2 Spiritual Lord, but he hadn’t stood a chance in front of Feng Wu. She had struck his head with the rod repeatedly until his face was swollen. Everyone felt chills run down their spines.","“Stop!”","Chief Qiao frowned.","The Gu family was very influential, and all the six brothers were elite students. Naturally, he would take their side.","Feng Wu heard him, but when she remembered Qiuling’s injury, she ignored him. She didn’t stop hitting all three brothers, as well as Feng Qi.","Feng Qi was the source of all the trouble. Of course, Feng Wu needed to teach her a lesson.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Feng Qi’s face was covered in bruises as well.","Chief Qiao was furious when Feng Wu ignored him. He shouted, “Stop it now!”","He reached out and wanted to grab Feng Wu from behind.","That strike would severely injure Feng Wu.","“Watch out!” Chaoge cried out.","Feng Wu sensed the formidable energy, so she shifted to the side to dodge the strike. She smirked and gave Chief Qiao a cold glance. “Chief Qiao, are you going to take their side now? If so, bring it on!”","Chief Qiao couldn’t control his rage.","He was about to charge at Feng Wu, when he heard a tiny voice in his ear. The tone was very commanding.","“Any Spiritual King who dares to attack Feng Wu will be killed instantly!”","Chief Qiao felt a cold breeze on his neck, and he shuddered.","Who was it?","Chief Qiao looked around, but all he could see were the Year 2 students. However, that warning had to have come from a very capable cultivator.","Was he dreaming?","Of course not!","Because he couldn’t even move a finger, as if he had been tied up with an invisible rope.","How terrifying...","Who could it be?","Frightened, Chief Qiao didn’t dare to make any reckless moves.","But Qiao Yi didn’t know that her dad had just been warned, and she bellowed at Feng Wu, “Feng Wu, who the hell do you think you are? You’re talking to Chief Qiao now! Do you want to get kicked out of Initial?”","Feng Wu grinned. “Who the hell do I think I am? Is that how a teacher of Imperial College is supposed to talk? Are you trying to get yourself fired?”","“I...” Qiao Yi didn’t know what to say. She tugged at Chief Qiao. “Dad...”","Because of Feng Wu, Qiao Yi had almost been fired once. Luckily, her father made the whole thing go away, but she just wouldn’t learn.","Chief Qiao took a deep breath and stared at Feng Wu. “What level are you now?”","He realized that he couldn’t tell how advanced Feng Wu was, which put him in a difficult spot.","Feng Wu grinned. “I’m the top student in Year 2 now. What do you think?”","Chief Qiao closed his eyes.","What an impressive girl.","He realized that when he exerted the power of a Level 1 Spiritual King, the girl wasn’t frightened. Moreover, there was also that capable person with that warning...","He wondered what happened to Feng Wu in the past few months."]},{"number":2304,"title":"Chapter 2304 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Chief Qiao looked from Feng Wu to the three Gu brothers and shook his head. He couldn’t decide who would win in the end.","Qiao Yi wanted to shout at Feng Wu again, but Chief Qiao yanked her back.","“Shut up!” Chief Qiao gave her a stern look.","Qiao Yi was perplexed.","Her father had always doted on her and had never spoken to her in such a strict manner.","Chief Qiao realized in astonishment that Feng Wu was too capable for Year 2 now, and that unknown powerful man also frightened him.","Everyone had thought that Chief Qiao would force Feng Wu to conform as was his usual style...","The Gu brothers were so pleased...","But Chief Qiao did something that puzzled them all.","Chief Qiao walked up to Feng Wu and forced a smile. He asked respectfully, “So, how do you want to proceed?”","The others couldn’t believe their ears and eyes.","Why would Chief Qiao use that tone? Why would he even ask Feng Wu? Qiao Yi was astonished.","“Dad!” As soon as she protested, Chief Qiao scolded her.","“Shut up! One more word, and you’ll be fired!” Chief Qiao warned Qiao Yi.","Qiao Yi burst into tears. Her father had never treated her like this, so she ran away, feeling utterly wronged.","However, the others didn’t pay much attention to her.","Their eyes were all on Feng Wu.","The Gu brothers gritted their teeth.","“Why is everyone here?” someone chuckled and asked. With that, a woman in a purple dress landed in the square.","“Chief Zixuan!” Gu Xingyun and Gu Xingmeng looked at each other.","She was the head of Year 3. Since she loved the color purple, she always wore purple dresses.","She was proud, stubborn, and always biased toward her favorite students.","Gu Xingmeng was one of the students she had high hopes for.","Seeing that Gu Xingmeng was covered in blood, Chief Zixuan opened her eyes wide. “Gu Xingmeng, what are you doing here in Year 2?!”","After the warning, Chief Qiao decided to support Feng Wu.","He smirked. “Chief Zixuan, don’t you know that they all came here to start a fight?”","Chief Zixuan asked, “What fight?”","Chief Qiao pointed at Feng Wu. “They’re all here to attack this girl, but they underestimated her, and she ended up beating them up.”","Chief Zixuan frowned. “Nonsense! How can a Year 2 student possibly beat up a Year 3 student?!”","Chief Qiao found that claim a compliment. If a Year 2 student defeated a Year 3 student, that meant that he was the better teacher. At that thought, he was elated.","He said, “Zixuan, your students need to work harder. They can’t even defeat the eighth student in my year.”","“The eighth?!” Chief Zixuan frowned, and someone next to her pointed at the billboard, where Feng Wu’s name was eighth on the list.","“Feng Wu?” Chief Zixuan frowned. She had never heard that name before.","But she had to get revenge for her student. Moreover, she didn’t believe that Feng Wu was better than Gu Xingmeng."]},{"number":2305,"title":"Chapter 2305 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Mu Xuan!” Chief Zixuan pointed at a Year 3 student who had followed Gu Xingmeng here. “Fight her.”","She needed to prove to Year 2 that the Year 3 students were very capable!","Had it been any other day, Mu Xuan would have followed the order, but he hesitated now.","He had watched how Feng Wu struck the Gu brothers on the head with the Fire Dragon Rod. Gu Xingmeng hadn’t stood a chance, and it looked so painful.","“Chief Zixuan, I don’t think I can do it.” Mu Xuan smiled bitterly.","Chief Zixuan’s eyes widened. Mu Xuan was ranked around 90th in Year 3, but he admitted that he wasn’t Feng Wu’s match.","Chief Qiao burst into laughter. “Chief Zixuan, just accept it. Feng Wu is too good for Year 2 and probably even Year 3.”","Chief Zixuan stared at Chief Qiao and asked, “What do you mean?”","Chief Qiao said, “I think she’s capable enough to enter Year 4 directly.”","He sounded very proud.","But was he really helping Feng Wu?","Not necessarily.","Chief Qiao feared the force behind Feng Wu and didn’t dare to do anything to her, but that didn’t mean that he was going to help her. Instead, he wanted to set her up.","To do that, he would raise Feng Wu’s status first.","Once she was famous enough, he would ruin her reputation.","That was Chief Qiao’s plan.","After all, Chief Gao of Year 5 and Chief Zixuan clashed severely with each other.","Therefore, Chief Qiao said deliberately, “Someone please tell Chief Gao to come here. We have a genius here who can skip Year 3 and enter Year 4!”","Chief Zixuan looked at Chief Qiao in resignation, but before she could say anything, Feng Wu was already headed for the front gate.","“Feng Wu, where are you going?!” Chief Qiao asked anxiously.","“Year 3!”","“Why Year 3?” Chief Qiao asked after glancing at Chief Zixuan.","Feng Wu snorted. “Someone needs to pay his debt.”","Gu Xingyuan had cut off Qiuling’s hand, and Feng Wu was going to make him pay for what he did!","Chief Zixuan glared at Feng Wu and found her the most arrogant girl.","“Do you think you can go to Year 3 just like that?” Chief Zixuan’s impression of Feng Wu was very bad from the very beginning.","Being a stubborn and arrogant person herself, she couldn’t stand it when she thought someone else was being arrogant.","Feng Wu paused to glance at Chief Zixuan, and there was no respect in her eyes.","Chief Zixuan was used to being revered, and she was furious.","“How do I get to Kanan?” Feng Wu remembered that was where Year 3 was.","Chief Zixuan smirked. “Only Year 3 students are allowed to go there. You haven’t graduated from Year 2 yet. How can you possibly go to Year 3?”","Feng Wu looked at Chief Qiao. Although she didn’t say anything, Chief Qiao took the hint immediately.","Chief Qiao smiled and said, “Gu Xingcheng is more than qualified to graduate from Year 2. Since you’ve defeated him, you must be good enough to move on from Year 2 as well. In the end, however, you still have to pass the billboard test.","“So, why don’t you place your hand on the board? That way, the system can automatically recognize your capability. If you really are the top student on the billboard, you can graduate from Initial. If you’re lucky enough, the system will also put you on the Year 3 billboard. That way, you won’t even need to take the entrance exam for Year 3.”"]},{"number":2306,"title":"Chapter 2306 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Wu walked up to the billboard without saying another word.","The billboard was a 10-meter-wide square board with all the names of the Year 2 students on it.","There was an imprint of a right hand in the lower right corner.","Feng Wu put her hand on it.","Everyone watched the names.","Feng Wu was now eighth.","Would she really rise to the top?","To their disappointment, nothing happened.","What was going on?","Was Feng Wu’s cultivation level a lie?","Everyone was perplexed.","Even Chief Qiao looked confused.","Chief Zixuan smirked. “I was wondering what kind of genius she was. Now I see that you were bluffing, Chief Qiao.”","Chief Qiao was speechless.","Chief Zixuan told the Year 3 students, “Let’s go. Just think about it. How amazing can a Year 2 student be? She’s not worth the attention.”","Something happened at that moment.","“Look! Feng Wu’s ranking is changing!”","“She’s seventh now!”","“OMG!”","“She’s sixth!”","“Fifth!”","“Third!”","“Second!”","“She’s surpassed Gu Xingcheng! Feng Wu is the top student in Year 2 now!”","Gu Xingcheng looked utterly embarrassed.","Hearing that, Chief Zixuan looked up at Feng Wu and narrowed her eyes. Although Feng Wu was talented, Chief Zixuan still didn’t like her.","She preferred teenage boys to teenage girls.","As the head of Year 3, Chief Zixuan decided to show Feng Wu what challenges she was about to face.","Chief Zixuan had made up her mind, but —","Something unexpected happened.","Someone cried out, “Why is Gu Xingcheng first again? Where did Feng Wu’s name go?”","Everyone panicked a little.","They all looked at the billboard.","Feng Wu’s name had been first on the billboard a moment ago, but it was gone now, and Gu Xingcheng was first again.","Realizing that Feng Wu had given him back the spot, Gu Xingcheng flushed with embarrassment.","He wanted to wipe his name off the board.","Chief Qiao looked at Chief Zixuan and said, “There’s only one possibility now.”","“That’s impossible!” Chief Zixuan cut him off. “Only a real genius would be selected by the system! That girl is far from that yet!”","Chief Qiao said, “Then how do you explain the fact that her name has disappeared?”","Chief Zixuan was speechless.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu headed out with the Fire Dragon Rod.","Chief Qiao asked, “Feng Wu, where are you going?”","Feng Wu didn’t even look back. “I’m going to Kanan.”","Mu Xuan snorted. “Does she think she can go in just like that? She has to pass the test first!”","But he didn’t see the strange look on Chief Zixuan’s face."]},{"number":2307,"title":"Chapter 2307 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Let’s go have a look. If she really can get in, it means that she entered Year 3 without needing to take the exam,” said Song Yichen loudly.","Whoosh —","They all followed Feng Wu.","Chief Qiao smiled at Chief Zixuan. “I remember that Kanan’s billboard is outside the front gate, right?”","That was to say, everyone who walked past Kanan could see it.","Chief Zixuan smirked. “So what? Do you really think that she’ll be on it?”","Chief Qiao said, “I didn’t believe it at first, but I do now. Not only will her name be on it, it’ll be quite high up as well.”","Chief Zixuan smirked.","How naive!","But she was astonished when she saw the billboard.","That was because —","“Feng Wu’s name really is there! She’s 1000th, the last place!”","“How strange... I thought she defeated Gu Xingmeng. Why is she only 1000th?”","“Is it because she used magical instruments and inscriptions? The system will automatically filter those.”","“That is to say, only her magical instruments and inscriptions are powerful, not the person herself...”","...","What they didn’t know was that Feng Wu had only used 10% of her true power when she put her hand on the billboard.","While the others were still talking, Feng Wu slammed the Fire Dragon Rod down on the ground and opened her mouth.","“Gu Xingyuan, come out right now!”","Her voice wasn’t very loud, but as it rang out, it felt like a thunderclap in the air.","It stirred up all of Kanan.","The people outside the gate didn’t feel much, because Feng Wu had made sure that only the people inside could hear the shout.","Whoosh —","Almost all the students in Kanan were shocked. With all the boring classes and cultivation practice, of course they would find the incident exciting.","They all rushed out the front gate, where they found all the Year 2 students.","Were they here to challenge Year 3? How interesting.","“Gu Xingyuan, someone’s calling your name.”","Gu Xingyuan was the top student in Year 3, which gave him the right to live in the villa area where the spiritual essence was more dense. He was cultivating when he was disturbed.","“Gu Xingyuan, come out! Right now!”","It was impossible for him to ignore that voice.","He couldn’t believe that someone dared to challenge him here in Kanan. He grabbed Cold Wind, his sword, and charged out.","Half of the students in Kanan had gone out traveling, and nearly all the remaining 500 had come out.","“Make way. Gu Xingyuan is here.”","People saw him coming.","The crowd parted so that Gu Xingyuan could pass.","In the center of the crowd was a circle about 10 meters in diameter.","Feng Wu kept her gaze on the ground, and there was no warmth in her eyes."]},{"number":2308,"title":"Chapter 2308 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Brother Xingyuan, you’re finally here!” Seeing Gu Xingyuan, Feng Qi burst into tears. “Help Brothers Xingyun, Xingcheng, and Xingmeng! Feng Wu beat them up so badly! Brother Xingyun almost died!”","WHAT?!","Gu Xingyuan stared at Feng Qi. “Are you talking about the Feng Wu who destroyed your house?”","Feng Qi nodded. “Yes, that’s her. Now she’s injured them!”","“Interesting.” Gu Xingyuan pushed Feng Qi out of his way and walked up to Feng Wu. “I don’t care if Feng Qi is telling the truth. You only have one chance.”","He pointed at the meadow and said, “Kneel now and kowtow 100 times. That way, I’ll spare your life. Otherwise...”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. “Otherwise, I’ll end up like Qiuling. Is that it?”","“So, you already know that I cut off your maid’s hand.” Gu Xingyuan chuckled. “That girl is quite talented. I asked her to be my personal maid, but she said no, so I cut off her hand as a punishment. What’s wrong with that?”","Feng Wu suddenly changed the subject. “Are you the top student in Year 3?”","Gu Xingyuan asked, “Do you have a problem with that? You’re at the bottom of Year 3 now.”","Feng Wu said, “So, you care about that a lot.”","Gu Xingyuan said, “No matter how I feel, there’s nothing you can do.”","Feng Wu chuckled. She pointed at Gu Xingyuan and said, “I’ll give you two options. You can cut off one of your arms, or I’ll cut both of them off.”","“Hahaha —”","Hearing that, everyone burst into laughter.","The Year 3 students were the loudest, and the Year 2 students wanted to deny that they ever knew Feng Wu.","“Gosh, that’s hilarious... I’ve never met anyone so shameless!”","“Did Feng Wu just threaten Gu Xingyuan?”","“The last student on the billboard is threatening the top student! That’s a first!”","“I can’t wait to see her humiliate herself!”","Chief Zixuan couldn’t stand it anymore. She shook her head and wanted to leave.","Chief Qiao stopped her. “Chief Zixuan, don’t go. The best part is yet to come.”","Chief Zixuan looked at him in resignation. “You hate Feng Wu, don’t you?”","Chief Qiao smiled. “Of course not. Feng Wu is the most talented student in Initial. As the head of Initial, I adore her.”","Chief Zixuan said, “If you really care about her, shouldn’t you try to talk her out of it?”","Chief Qiao glanced at her. “Do you also think that Feng Wu isn’t Gu Xingyuan’s match?”","Chief Zixuan shook her head. “The two of them aren’t comparable at all.”","Chief Qiao raised his chin. “That’s right. Gu Xingyuan doesn’t stand a chance at all.”","Chief Zixuan rolled her eyes at him."]},{"number":2309,"title":"Chapter 2309 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Just when Feng Wu and Gu Xingyuan were about to start fighting —","“Wait!” A girl blocked Feng Wu’s way.","She was a pretty girl.","“Chu Junying?” The Year 3 students saw that it was the prettiest girl in their year.","“Do you think you can challenge Xingyuan just like that? If everyone does that, he won’t have any time to cultivate!” Chu Junying rolled her eyes at Feng Wu.","Because Gu Xingyuan had been the top student for years, he was well-respected.","Hearing that, the other students nodded as well. “That’s right. You don’t get to challenge our top student just because you want to!”","“You don’t deserve the opportunity!”","“We have our own rules. You can only challenge someone within 10 places of your ranking. Otherwise, the top students will never have time for their cultivation.”","Everyone shouted at Feng Wu at the same time.","“Young lady, Chu Junying is right. If you want to challenge someone, challenge the students who are fewer than 10 places ahead of you,” said Miss Wang of Year 3.","The look on her face was serious, and it was obvious that she wasn’t pleased with Feng Wu.","Chu Junying chuckled. “You’re last on the billboard, so the best you can do is challenge the 990th place.”","She glanced at the billboard and smirked. “Where is Zhao Ran, the 995th?”","As the prettiest girl in Kanan, Chu Junying was very well-liked among the boys. No one could say no to her.","Zhao Ran immediately stepped out. “Here. I’m Zhao Ran.”","Chu Junying glanced at Feng Wu before turning to Zhao Ran. “Are you willing to take up Miss Feng Wu’s challenge?”","She believed that Year 3 was her territory, and as an outsider, Feng Wu stood no chance.","She thought that Feng Wu had to slowly make her way up the billboard.","Seeing that Chu Junying was looking at him, Zhao Ran nodded. “Yes, of course.”","Many Year 2 students felt Chu Junying’s animosity toward Feng Wu. Since they would be entering Year 3 one day as well, naturally, they took Feng Wu’s side.","Thus, they empathized with her.","Because of that, they disliked Chu Junying.","Chu Junying could sense their attitude, but she couldn’t care less how the Year 2 students felt about her.","“Feng Wu, you’ll be challenging Zhao Ran now,” Chu Junying said with a smile. She then turned to the others and said, “I think Feng Wu will be very busy for a while. Why don’t you go back to what you were doing?”","Chu Junying was a well-respected figure, so the crowd was about to scatter as she asked.","Chaoge stepped forward, but before she could say anything, Feng Wu shook her head.","She then walked up to the billboard.","There was also a palm print in the lower right corner.","Feng Wu put her hand on it, and? thump!","The billboard blacked out.","What?!","The crowd looked at it in disbelief.","How did that happen?"]},{"number":2310,"title":"Chapter 2310 - Untitled","paragraphs":["That was so terrifying!","Chief Zixuan and Chief Qiao looked at each other, and they both had a bad feeling.","Chief Qiao cleared his throat. “Is there a glitch in the system?”","Chief Zixuan glanced at him but didn’t answer.","According to the first headmaster of Imperial College, even if the school was destroyed, the system would never fail.","Sizzle —","Sizzle —","Everyone stared at the screen and waited for it to light up again.","And when it did, they were all shocked.","They couldn’t believe it.","“Where is Feng Wu’s name?”","“It’s not 1000th anymore.”","“I can’t find her in the 900s.”","“Nor is she in the 800s.”","...","They looked from the bottom to the top, when someone cried out.","“Gosh! Look! Gu Xingyuan is in second place now!”","What?","Gu Xingyuan had been there for years. Who had replaced him?","When they saw the name above Gu Xingyuan...","Someone fainted.","“Impossible!”","“This can’t be happening!”","“There has to be a glitch in the system!”","The Year 2 students were so shocked that they all fell silent.","The Year 3 students were the ones that couldn’t stop talking.","They never thought that something like this could happen.","“How did Feng Wu become the top student?”","“Didn’t she just enter Year 3?”","“She was last on the billboard just a moment ago!”","...","Everyone looked at Gu Xingyuan, hoping that he could give them an explanation.","Chief Zixuan and Chief Qiao weren’t with the crowd. They stood on higher ground.","Chief Qiao looked shocked.","So did Chief Zixuan.","“She...” Chief Zixuan hesitated. “What level is she?”","Chief Qiao couldn’t answer that question.","Yes, he had been praising Feng Wu, but he had made those things up. He didn’t know that Feng Wu was so capable!","He didn’t want it to be true, but there was nothing he could do.","He forced a smile and said, “I told you. Feng Wu made some huge progress during her trip. I told you that she could enter Year 4 directly, but you wouldn’t believe me.”","He shrugged.","Chief Zixuan frowned. “There must be something behind this.”","Everyone else thought the same.","“I don’t believe it,” said Chu Junying. “How can the bottom student rise to the top in an instant? Feng Wu, I’ll challenge you!”","Chaoge laughed. “Didn’t you say that you can only challenge someone 10 places higher than you? Chu Junying, you can only challenge the 90th on the billboard. Hang Wei, she wants to challenge you!”","Chu Junying’s face went scarlet.","“I’ll challenge you!” Gu Xingyuan pointed at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded. “What happens if I kill you?”","Everyone went silent.","“No! You can’t kill anyone here in the college!” Chu Junying said anxiously.","The others all looked at her.","Why did she look so anxious? Did she think that Gu Xingyuan would lose?"]},{"number":2311,"title":"Chapter 2311 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Gu Xingyuan threw a dirty look at Chu Junying.","Chu Junying whimpered a little.","Gu Xingyuan stared at Feng Wu. “Don’t worry. I’ll make you wish that you were dead!”","Feng Wu said, “I can say the same thing to you.”","The fight started as soon as they said those words.","With Feng Wu’s real capability, Gu Xingyuan, who was only a Level 3 Spiritual Lord, wasn’t her match at all. She could split him in half with one strike.","Feng Wu was well aware of that.","But —","The moment she made her first move, she felt a pair of eyes on her.","It made her feel rather uncomfortable.","She suddenly realized that she couldn’t show the others her full strength, especially now that she was surrounded by enemies.","Hence, she withheld some of her strength.","She dodged Gu Xingyuan’s first strike.","“Look! Feng Wu is evading Gu Xingyuan!”","“She wouldn’t do that if she’s more capable than Gu Xingyuan!”","“So, Feng Wu isn’t really the top student, is she?”","“Look, they both stumbled back after the second strike.”","“Gu Xingyuan has parried Feng Wu’s Fire Dragon Rod.”","“Gu Xingyuan is winning now!”","“Oh no, Feng Wu hit Gu Xingyuan on the head.”","“Look, she’s hitting him again.”","“Gosh, how many times has she hit him on the head? Doesn’t that hurt?”","By then, it was obvious who was going to win.","Feng Wu had gained the upper hand!","Thump! Thump! Thump!","With her Fire Dragon Rod, Feng Wu made sure that Gu Xingyuan couldn’t go far as she hit him on the head.","She could kill Gu Xingyuan with one strike, but she wouldn’t do that. She wanted everyone to watch.","Gu Xingyuan grew up as a golden boy, and he had never experienced something like this.","“Ahhh!!!”","Feeling so humiliated and unable to get away, Gu Xingyuan fainted.","“You —”","Chu Junying shouted at Feng Wu, “How could you do that?!”","Feng Wu shrugged. “Why can’t I?”","Chu Junying was speechless.","She ignored Feng Wu and went to check on Gu Xingyuan.","She made up her mind. Although Feng Wu was first, after she came to Kanan, Chu Junying would get all of Year 3 to join hands and boycott Feng Wu.","She would make sure that Feng Wu became an outcast.","“She didn’t exert her full power.” Chief Zixuan wasn’t fooled. She knew that Feng Wu was hiding her true capability.","Chief Qiao felt conflicted. “That means that she can do even better.”","Chief Zixuan said, “You were right. She’s too good for Year 3.”","Chief Qiao said, “Are you saying that she’ll skip Year 3?”","Chief Zixuan said, “Year 1 to Year 3 is only the first stage of Imperial College, and Year 4 is a different story. The gap is huge.","“If Feng Wu is so capable, she should go to Year 4 as soon as possible.” Chief Zixuan grinned. “In Year 4, one is expected to defend the empire.”","Chief Qiao smiled as well when he recalled how mysterious Year 4 was."]},{"number":2312,"title":"Chapter 2312 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“That’s right. She’ll have responsibilities once she enters Year 4. We’ll have to wish her good luck.”","Chief Zixuan glanced at Chief Qiao. “I see that you’re not on Feng Wu’s side after all.”","Chief Qiao said, “I don’t know what you’re talking about. I wish her all the best.”","Chief Zixuan didn’t believe him. She narrowed her eyes and looked at Feng Wu.","“If you want to go to Year 4, you can also come to me to take the test,” said Chief Zixuan.","Feng Wu frowned a little. Somehow, she felt that things weren’t so simple.","“No one is allowed to tell any outsider what happened here today! If you do, you can stop coming to school!” Chief Zixuan left after those words.","Feng Wu watched suspiciously as Chief Zixuan walked away.","“Not a word to outsiders? Why?” Chaoge wouldn’t have it. “Xiao Wu was so amazing, and everyone should know about it! Why can’t we spread the news?!”","Feng Wu didn’t understand it either.","Seeing that Gu Xingyuan had passed out, she didn’t feel so angry anymore.","She was about to move closer, when Chu Junying stopped her and said nervously, “What do you want to do to him?”","Feng Wu had wanted to cut off his hands, but he was unconscious, and it didn’t seem fair.","“Fine. You can keep your hands for a few more days.” Feng Wu left after saying that.","“Xiao Wu, are we going back home?” Chaoge asked when she saw the direction Feng Wu was headed in.","Feng Wu then realized that she had forgotten something very important.","She was here to ask about Grand Secretary Fang.","She then took Chaoge to see Mr. Lu.","Grand Secretary Fang was the acting headmaster of Imperial College when Mr. Lu went into seclusion. Now that Mr. Lu had come out of seclusion, Grand Secretary Fang was gone. Was there something behind it?","When Feng Wu arrived, she was greeted by Mr. Lu’s personal servant.","His name was Songzi, and Feng Wu had met him before. Songzi let her in and said, “Mr. Lu is seeing someone now. Please wait a moment.”","Feng Wu nodded and waited in the living room.","Before long, she heard footsteps, and the door opened.","Mr. Lu walked out with the guest.","Feng Wu was perplexed when she saw the person, because she had seen her earlier today.","It was Chief Zixuan of Kanan.","Chief Zixuan was surprised as well.","She had asked around just now and only then learned who Feng Wu was. Hearing that Feng Wu was quite close to Grand Secretary Fang, she was glad that Grand Secretary Fang was away.","She believed that Mr. Lu and Grand Secretary Fang weren’t on friendly terms and decided that Feng Wu would be in a lot of trouble if she behaved in the same arrogant way.","She was here to report to Mr. Lu about the incident with Feng Wu today.","Because of her biased opinion of Feng Wu, she slandered Feng Wu in front of Mr. Lu. However, as soon as she walked out, she saw Feng Wu sipping tea outside.","“Songzi, you can’t let just anybody in! Don’t you know how busy Mr. Lu is? If he agrees to meet every student that comes here to see him, he won’t have time for anything else!” Chief Zixuan scolded Songzi.","Songzi looked at Chief Zixuan in surprise."]},{"number":2313,"title":"Chapter 2313 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing those words, Mr. Lu laughed. “Zixuan, this girl isn’t just some random visitor. She’s my young friend! Aren’t you, Xiao Wu?”","Chief Zixuan was astonished.","Now that Grand Secretary Fang was away, Mr. Lu had announced that Feng Wu was his young friend! Why?!","She didn’t want to say another word, and promptly left.","“Come in and sit down.” Mr. Lu welcomed Feng Wu into his office.","Feng Wu didn’t beat around the bush. “Why did Grand Secretary Fang leave in such a hurry? Couldn’t he wait for me to come back?”","Mr. Lu looked at Feng Wu and went silent.","Feng Wu frowned. “Is there something I should know?”","Mr. Lu sighed. “You were only a Spiritual Master when you came to Imperial College, but not a year has passed, and you’ve already become so amazing. You really are a genius.”","He was filled with emotions when he recalled his first meeting with Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was amazed as well.","She had only started cultivating again less than a year ago, but she had risen from a Spiritual Master to a Spiritual Lord.","“You’re a Level 9 Spiritual Lord now. That’s so unbelievable.” Mr. Lu tapped Feng Wu on the forehead. “How can you be so talented?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “I can’t help it.”","Mr. Lu, who had always been so serious, burst into laughter. “You mischievous girl. But you’re right. You really can’t help it. It’s your destiny.”","Seeing her innocent face and bright eyes, Mr. Lu couldn’t bring himself to tell her what hardships people with such a destiny would go through.","But Feng Wu saw it on his face.","“Mr. Lu, do you want to tell me something?”","Mr. Lu only said, “Stay in Year 3 for a bit longer. You don’t need to rush into Year 4.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","She didn’t like her fellow classmates in Year 3.","Mr. Lu said, “His Royal Highness can tell you the answer.”","But Feng Wu didn’t want to go anywhere near the crown prince.","Worried that the smart girl would guess the answer if he said too much, he wanted to send her away.","“Wait.” Feng Wu remembered why she was there, and she asked Mr. Lu, “Are you sure everything’s fine? Xiaoqi went with Grand Secretary Fang, and I’m worried about him.”","Mr. Lu said, “Don’t worry. Traveling with Grand Secretary Fang can only benefit Xiaoqi.”","He then looked at Feng Wu. “You’re making fast progress now, but in a few years, Xiaoqi will become more efficient than you. You can’t take cultivation too lightly, okay?”","Seeing that Mr. Lu wouldn’t tell her more, Feng Wu left his office.","But his words had reassured her.","The Feng clan.","As soon as Feng Wu went back to the Feng manor, she felt that something was off.","The servants were bustling around, but they kept giving her hesitant looks.","“Xiao Wu, has something happened?”","Even Chaoge noticed it.","Feng Wu frowned and hurried back to Fallen Star Yard.."]},{"number":2314,"title":"Chapter 2314 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Chapter 2314: Untitled","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, when she reached a covered corridor, a masked figure suddenly charged at her.","“Xiao Wu, watch out!” Chaoge cried out.","However, when Feng Wu turned around, Chaoge was nowhere to be found.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","Shit!","Who dared to snatch a person in the Feng clan?!","Feng Wu saw the figure turn a corner, and Chaoge was hanging over the person’s shoulder.","Without thinking, Feng Wu ran after them.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","She ran as fast as her legs would carry her.","Sensing her speed, the person picked up speed as well.","Feng Wu then ran even faster.","Because of the mask the person was wearing, Feng Wu couldn’t tell who it was, but someone, she found the person rather familiar!","The person then rushed into the manor’s restricted area.","Feng Wu had been here once to test her cultivation ability. Feng Yanfeng then told her that she could come here to cultivate with the elders when she turned 10 years old.","But she lost her ability before that and never got that chance.","A rock stood outside the area, warning all uninvited visitors that their actions would be punishable by death.","Since Chaoge was inside, Feng Wu couldn’t care less about the warning. She immediately ran inside.","As soon as she stepped into the area, she felt the sand move under her feet.","A formation!","Alarmed, Feng Wu immediately rolled over the ground.","She was a Level 7 formation master, and not many formations could stop her. However, the one in this area was also Level 7.","Although the Feng clan had declined, they used to be one of the ten major clans, so they still had some tricks up their sleeves.","Feng Wu calmly solved the formation as she walked into the area.","At the same time.","There was a small courtyard at the center of the formation.","There was a well in the courtyard.","Three old men sat around the well, but they weren’t cultivating. They were all watching the well with serious looks on their faces.","The image in the well was none other than of Feng Wu.","They were watching Feng Wu pass through the formation.","“Did you downgrade the formation?” one of the elders asked with a frown.","The Feng clan had three surviving elders. They were Elder Breeze, Elder Jing, and Elder Grain.","They were ranked by seniority as well as capability.","The three of them had been living in seclusion in this area for years, doing nothing but cultivating. They were the Feng clan’s last resort, and every single one of them was very capable.","Earlier today, Feng Yanfeng had come here to discuss with them the matter of kicking Feng Wu out of the clan.","Feng Yanfeng gave several reasons.","First of all, Feng Wu was so arrogant that she had made many enemies. That would endanger the entire clan.","Secondly, Feng Wu had no love for her family. She had killed Feng Liu and cut off her aunt’s hand, which was unacceptable.","Thirdly, Feng Wu had injured four sons of the Gu family, and they had given an ultimatum that the Feng family had to hand Feng Wu over. Otherwise, the Gu family would join hands with the other families to boycott the Feng family.","Last but not least, Feng Qi had more potential than Feng Wu and was the best candidate as the future head of the clan.."]},{"number":2315,"title":"Chapter 2315 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Therefore, he made a request to kick Feng Wu out of the Feng clan.","In fact, it was a matter of formality.","The three elders had indeed considered Feng Wu as their future successor, but they gave up on her after she lost her ability.","They had been living here for so long that they knew nothing of the outside world or of Feng Wu’s real talent. Feng Yanfeng was confident that they would believe everything he said.","He could make the decision to disown Feng Wu all by himself, but to disown the entire second branch, he would need the three elders’ approval.","The reason he gave to disown the second branch was the beautiful lady. He claimed that her beauty would bring disaster to the whole clan.","It was such a major issue in the Feng clan that Feng Yanfeng didn’t have the authority to make the decision on his own.","Of the three elders, Elder Breeze was neutral, Elder Jing was against the idea, and Elder Grain didn’t mind disowning Feng Wu and her family.","Usually, they wouldn’t bother to discuss such a thing and would have said yes without hesitation.","But Elder Jing wouldn’t have it this time because he was the one who had tested Feng Wu’s talent back then.","He said, “Other things aside, I don’t believe that Feng Qi is more talented than Feng Wu.”","Elder Grain said, “Feng Wu has lost her ability, so just forget about her.”","Since neither Elder Breeze nor Elder Grain would give in, Elder Breeze made the call. “In that case, just let Feng Qi compete with Feng Wu, and we’ll have the answer.”","To lure Feng Wu to the restricted area, they used Chaoge as bait.","While they watched the image in the well, Chaoge sulked on the side.","Elder Jing was pleasantly surprised. He pointed at the well and said, “Look! Feng Wu is doing great! She was only surprised at first. After that, she’s been perfectly calm.”","Elder Breeze nodded.","“This is a Level 7 formation, and even Feng Yanfeng can’t get in. However, Feng Wu has been solving the formation as she walks. None of the traps have been a problem for her.”","Elder Grain didn’t like Feng Wu. Hearing that, he frowned and asked, “How can it be possible that she knows how to solve the formation on her own? Jing, you didn’t tell her how to do it, did you?”","Elder Jing threw a dirty look at Elder Grain. “You were the one who snatched the girl. I’ve never had any contact with Feng Wu. If someone told her how to solve it, it would be you.”","That shut Elder Grain up. There was no way that he could have told Feng Wu that information.","“But how did she do it? Even if she started cultivating when she was in her mother’s belly, she still can’t have reached Level 7. Is she even human?” Elder Grain was perplexed.","Chaoge was lying on the ground as she listened to them. She didn’t like Elder Grain’s tone.","“Hey, old man, watch it!” Chaoge was restrained, but though she couldn’t move, she could still talk. “What do you mean by that? Of course Xiao Wu is human! She’s just amazing like that! Are you jealous?”","Elder Grain didn’t expect to see her wake up so soon and was taken aback. He was infuriated when he heard what Chaoge said.."]},{"number":2316,"title":"Chapter 2316 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","No one could intimidate Chaoge, even if the person was an elder of the Feng clan.","She snorted. “Xiao Wu is a Level 7 formation master and a Level 7 inscription master. She can go through your formation with her eyes closed!”","“You —” Elder Grain couldn’t stand it when other people talked back.","He wanted to smack Chaoge, but Elder Jing stopped him.","“Grain, calm down. Even if you want to get back at her, wait until she’s done talking.” Elder Jing then turned to Chaoge and said, “Kiddo, you’re bluffing, aren’t you?”","“Of course not! You people have been stuck here for so long that you know nothing about what’s going on outside,” Chaoge said grumpily. “Not only is Xiao Wu a Level 7 inscription master and a Level 7 formation master, she’s also a Supreme Level medicine refiner as well! Surprised?”","Elder Grain didn’t believe a word. “Kiddo, that’s just ridiculous.”","Chaoge was displeased.","She didn’t mind them questioning her ability, but she wouldn’t let anyone say such things about Feng Wu.","“Why should I lie about it? It’s not a secret. Ask around, and you’ll know. By the sound of it, you’re all elders of the Feng clan. Why does it sound like you don’t know anything?”","Elder Breeze was speechless.","So was Elder Jing.","And Elder Grain.","Chaoge glared at them. “Since you don’t even know Xiao Wu’s additional abilities, I assume that you don’t know her cultivation level either. Right?”","Elder Grain frowned. “Isn’t she a Level 7 Spiritual Elder?”","Chaoge said, “Oh my god!”","She couldn’t believe her ears. “You really don’t know anything at all. That was six months ago!”","Elder Grain said, “How much better can she be after six months? She’ll be a Level 8 Spiritual Elder at most.”","Chaoge gave him a “you idiot” look.","Because Feng Wu often gave other people that look, Chaoge had learned it from her. It really made other people feel that they were stupid.","That look gave Elder Grain the creeps. “What are you looking at?”","Chaoge looked at the three old men and asked, “Do you really think that Feng Wu is still a Level 7 Spiritual Elder?!”","Elder Grain snapped. “What is she, then?”","Of course, Chaoge knew that Feng Wu was a Level 9 Spiritual Lord, but Feng Wu had been making other people believe that she was a Level 7 Spiritual Lord.","That would be enough to scare these three old men.","Chaoge decided to tell them that.","“A Level 7 Spiritual Lord?!” Elder Grain wouldn’t believe it. “You must be kidding! That’s impossible!”","Rising to a Level 7 Spiritual Lord from a Level 7 Spiritual Elder was indeed a scary leap.","The restraint on Chaoge expired at that moment, and she could move freely again.."]},{"number":2317,"title":"Chapter 2317 - Untitled","paragraphs":["She rose to her feet and glared at Elder Grain. “Has your brain gone rusty after living here in seclusion for so long? Why are you arguing with me? Give her a test, and you’ll see.”","Elder Jing said, “That’s right. We’ll know after we test her.”","He rose to his feet.","“Wait.” Elder Grain threw a dirty look at Chaoge and stopped Elder Jing. “I should be the one to test her. What if you go easy on her?”","Elder Jing snapped, “Who do you think I am? Why would I do such a thing? Even if I wanted to do that, wouldn’t you see through my tricks right away?”","Elder Grain said grumpily, “I don’t care. It has to be me.”","Elder Jing said, “Go ahead, but you’ll have to answer to me if you injure her on purpose!”","Elder Grain grunted and left the courtyard.","Feng Wu was still solving the formation. There was a desert, followed by fog and then a maze. It was incredible.","She found them very messy. There was no reasonable order at all.","In the courtyard.","Elder Jing asked Chaoge, “Why has she stopped in the maze? She’s frowning. Does she know how to get in?”","After the maze was the core area of the formation, which was also where this courtyard was. Elder Jing was worried that Feng Wu would be stopped at the last step.","Chaoge wasn’t worried at all.","“There’s no need to panic.” Chaoge wasn’t intimidated by the elders. She said confidently, “Xiao Wu is amazing. I’ve never seen a formation that she can’t solve.”","Elder Jing asked, “Then why has she stopped?”","Chaoge said, “I think she’s calculating.”","Elder Jing didn’t mind the way Chaoge spoke to him. The two of them sat next to the well and watched eagerly.","He asked, “Calculating?”","Chaoge said matter-of-factly, “That’s right. Xiao Wu is the smartest person I know. She never forgets anything and has great deductive abilities. She’s definitely deducing the formation in the maze now. Once she’s done, she’ll walk through it like she’s taking a stroll in her back garden.”","Elder Jing was shocked. “Can she deduce it before even going in?”","Chaoge said, “That’s right. Isn’t that what other formation masters do?”","Feng Wu was the only formation master Chaoge had met so far, and she thought that all formation masters were like her.","Elder Jing said, “Of course not! Grain is a formation master as well, and that formation is his great work. He has never deduced a formation setup before entering it. He always does it as he walks around.","“Not only him, but all other formation masters are like that as well.”","Chaoge said, “I see! That means that Xiao Wu is the best!”","Elder Jing said, “If she really can do that, she’s got an amazing brain. Becoming a Level 8 formation master won’t be a problem for her.”","Chaoge said, “Xiao Wu is going to become a Sacred formation master one day! Level 8 is nothing to her!”"]},{"number":2318,"title":"Chapter 2318 - Untitled","paragraphs":["After Level 8 was Level 9, and only after that could one reach the sacred stage. The Junwu Empire didn’t have a Sacred formation master at the moment.","“You’re dreaming,” said Elder Jing grumpily.","Chaoge clenched her fists in frustration. “You’ll see! Xiao Wu is the best!”","“Look!” Elder Jing pointed at the well. “Grain is there! Gosh, what’s he doing? Why is he trying to sneak up on her? That’s just so low!”","Elder Jing and Chaoge could clearly see what was going on.","Elder Breeze had been cultivating, and he was speechless when he opened his eyes. Elder Jing was behaving like a little boy.","He seemed to have forgotten that he was an elder.","Chaoge and Elder Jing got along surprisingly well. The two of them chatted like a pair of kids.","Seeing that Elder Grain had hidden in the shadows, Chaoge clenched her fists as well, but she had confidence in Feng Wu. “Don’t worry! He won’t be Xiao Wu’s match!”","Chaoge laughed inwardly. Luckily, she had told Elder Grain that Feng Wu was a Level 7 Spiritual Lord. Because of that, he could only exert the power of a Level 7 Spiritual Lord.","Being a Level 9 Spiritual Lord, Feng Wu would have no problem defeating him.","Meanwhile, in the maze.","After her deduction, Feng Wu figured out the way in and out of the maze. She then walked inside as if she was strolling through a garden.","Suddenly, she noticed something.","There was a dark shadow behind a statue to her left.","Was there an assassin?","She blamed herself for being too careless.","Looking around, she smiled. She decided to trap the assassin in the maze.","She quickly hid in the shadows as well.","Elder Grain had wanted to take Feng Wu by surprise, but he didn’t expect her to react so quickly. He convinced himself that she had only hidden behind the statue out of sheer luck.","He decided that he would stay hidden and wait for the girl to come out.","What he didn’t know was that Feng Wu had turned things to her advantage.","“What’s she doing?” Elder Jing saw that Feng Wu had gotten busy.","Not only was she carrying stones around, she was also quickly writing things on them.","Chaoge indeed knew Feng Wu well. She could guess what Feng Wu was doing.","“If I’m right, Xiao Wu is modifying the formation settings now,” said Chaoge.","“What?!” Elder Jing was astonished.","Although formations weren’t his forte, he had heard enough from Elder Grain to know how they worked.","He said, “It’s much harder to alter someone else’s formation than to create one. Are you sure about that? Is the girl really a better formation master than Grain?”","Chaoge was very confident. “I’m sure of it. Xiao Wu is the best. Your friend isn’t her match..”"]},{"number":2319,"title":"Chapter 2319 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Elder Breeze looked up at the sky.","He was amazed by how talented the youngsters were nowadays.","Elder Jing had lived here since he was little and knew nothing about complicated human relationships. Therefore, he didn’t find Chaoge’s tone offensive at all.","He only asked, “Are you sure?”","Chaoge said, “Didn’t you say that Elder Grain was the one who set up this formation?”","Elder Jing said, “That’s right.”","Chaoge said, “Well, today is his unlucky day. His work is going to backfire on him.”","Elder Jing didn’t believe her. Feng Wu was only a teenager, but Elder Grain was so experienced. Hence, he shook his head.","But he was soon proved wrong.","After Feng Wu finished writing the inscriptions, she smiled and went to the statue where Elder Grain was hiding.","The old man had no idea that Feng Wu was behind him.","After altering the formation, the maze was under Feng Wu’s control. Therefore, she could see Elder Grain, but he couldn’t see her.","“What are you looking at?” She patted him on the shoulder.","“Gosh!”","Elder Grain jumped in fright. He turned around and looked at the girl in disbelief.","Because he was dressed in black from head to toe, Feng Wu punched him in the face without hesitation.","Thump!","It almost broke his nose.","“You...”","Before he could react, Feng Wu shouted, “How dare you take Chaoge away?!”","“It’s not like that...” Elder Grain wanted to explain.","Feng Wu was ready for battle. “Ground Control!","“Fallen Star Swordplay!","“Freeze!","“Feng Tutu, Little Phoenix, come out!”","She was attacking the old man with every stance she knew.","Elder Grain didn’t take her seriously at first, and even Elder Jing only thought that the girl had reacted unbelievably fast.","However, when Feng Wu started attacking Elder Grain...","“Ouch!”","Despite being a Spiritual King, Elder Grain was caught off guard.","Elder Jing watched in disbelief.","“Are you sure that she’s only a Level 7 Spiritual Lord?!” He looked at Chaoge in disbelief.","Chaoge scratched her head. “Maybe she’s outperforming herself.”","Elder Jing said, “Don’t you try to fool me! That wouldn’t enable her to exert the power of a Spiritual King!”","Chaoge’s eyes twinkled. “What did you say? A Spiritual King?”","OMG!","Elder Jing said grumpily, “A Level 1 Spiritual King at most. Why are you so excited?”","Chaoge said, “She’s the future of your clan! She’s not 14 yet, and she can already fight like a Level 1 Spiritual King!”","She gave Elder Jing a nudge.","Hearing that, Elder Jing looked stunned.","Even Elder Breeze, who had looked quite indifferent, seemed shocked as well.."]},{"number":2320,"title":"Chapter 2320 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Elder Jing looked at Elder Breeze.","Elder Breeze looked back at him.","The future of the Feng clan...","The strange silence scared Chaoge. She looked at them and didn’t dare say a word.","“Ahhh!!!”","Elder Jing suddenly cried out. Before Chaoge realized it, he had dashed off.","“Ahhh —”","The wind he kicked up almost blew Chaoge away. She had to struggle very hard to steady herself.","“Why is he so excited?” Chaoge asked Elder Breeze.","Elder Breeze smiled so brightly that he looked ten years younger. The look he gave Chaoge was also much kinder.","“The Feng clan is going to rise again,” he looked up at the sky and murmured.","Chaoge rolled her eyes at him; it was only because these people didn’t know that Feng Wu had always been this amazing.","Meanwhile, in the maze.","Feng Wu’s bombardment had taken Elder Grain by surprise.","He was perplexed at first, but he was much more capable than Feng Wu, so he was infuriated after he realized what had happened.","He had forgotten what he had promised Elder Jing.","No Level 7 Spiritual Elder could fight like this!","Seeing that the man in black was furious, Feng Wu immediately started running.","She knew that she wasn’t his match. Luckily, after her modification, she could use some of the functions of the maze. It would delay the man a little, and she could use the time to get away.","Feng Wu ran, and Elder Grain ran after her.","“Stop right there!”","He then stepped on something slippery and almost lost his footing. A bucket of water then poured down on him at that moment. He was soaking wet.","He shouted in frustration, “Damn you! Stop running!”","Of course Feng Wu wouldn’t do that.","Soon, she was out of sight.","Elder Grain fumed.","He wanted to control the maze, but it no longer followed his orders. Not only wouldn’t it help him, it was also getting in his way all the time.","However, he was far more capable than Feng Wu, and he caught up to her in no time.","He was determined to catch her, even if he would be injured in the process.","But something happened the moment before he caught her.","“Grain! Stop it!” Jing showed up and blocked his way.","“It’s none of your business, Jing. Get out of my way!”","“Grain, I have great news!”","“What great news?”","“Let’s go back to the courtyard. We can talk there,” said Elder Jing.","Elder Jing was ranked higher than Elder Grain and was able to stop him.","He then turned to look at Feng Wu, his eyes so bright that it gave Feng Wu the creeps.","“Are you looking for a girl of your age?” He grinned at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu met him before when she was little, and she recognized his face.. She nodded and asked, “Are you Elder Jing?”"]},{"number":2321,"title":"Chapter 2321 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu had only been three or four when she was tested, and children of that age usually couldn’t remember much. Elder Jing was thrilled when he saw that Feng Wu still remembered him.","He nodded in excitement. “That’s right! I didn’t expect you to remember me! You have an excellent memory!”","He led Feng Wu and Elder Grain toward the courtyard as he spoke.","Elder Grain threw off his hand grumpily.","Elder Jing didn’t have time for Elder Grain. He only cared about Feng Wu now. There were tears of excitement in his eyes.","Feng Wu looked at Chaoge in confusion, but Chaoge only shrugged.","Elder Jing introduced the other two elders to Feng Wu. “This is Elder Breeze, our leader. I’m the second in seniority, and this is Elder Grain. He’s kind of mean, so just ignore him.”","Elder Grain didn’t like the sound of that.","Why should he be ignored?","And why did Jing care about Feng Wu so much?!","Elder Grain said, “Hey, Jing, what’s the matter with you?! This girl is so vile! Didn’t they say that they want to kick her out of the clan? I agree!”","Feng Wu frowned. They? Was that Feng Yanfeng’s idea?","Elder Jing snapped, “No, we’re not doing that! Why would we? Have you lost your mind?!”","Elder Grain flared up. “Jing, what’s the matter with you? Didn’t we agree? She’s wounded me! Of course we’re kicking her out!”","Elder Jing bellowed, “You idiot! Have you ever met such a talented girl?”","Elder Grain felt wronged. “But she wounded me. That’s against the rules!”","Elder Jing said, “What does that mean? It means that she’s talented! Although she broke some rules, she exerted the power of a Level 1 Spiritual King! And she’s not even 14 yet!”","“But...” Elder Grain wanted to say something, but what Elder Grain said surprised him. He said, “Her true capability is only a Level 9 Spiritual Lord. She’s cheating!”","Elder Jing glared at him. “Even if that’s the case, she’s still amazing. She’s not 14 yet.”","Elder Grain was speechless.","Elder Jing said, “And she solved and modified your formation. Grain, isn’t that amazing?”","Elder Grain growled, “Shut up!”","Elder Jing said, “You’re an older man, and she’s barely 14.”","The mention of Feng Wu’s age was like a spell. Elder Grain almost felt dizzy.","He tried to refute it, but failed.","She wasn’t 14 yet, but she could fight like a Level 1 Spiritual King. Plus, she was a Level 7 formation master.","“She knows inscriptions as well. She can draw them much faster than you can. It takes you forever to finish one,” Elder Jing complained.."]},{"number":2322,"title":"Chapter 2322 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Elder Grain’s face turned scarlet red. “Shut up and show me some respect!”","Seeing the two of them bicker like little kids, Feng Wu and Chaoge exchanged looks. How childish.","Elder Jing knew that his old friend was genuinely frustrated, so he decided to leave him alone. Instead, he turned to Feng Wu and started showering her with compliments.","Elder Grain didn’t like the sound of it at all.","Because no matter what Elder Jing said, he would compare Feng Wu with Elder Grain.","“So what if she’s talented and capable? If she’s a bad person, nothing counts!” Elder Grain grunted. “A vile, ill-behaved girl like her doesn’t deserve to inherit the Feng clan! I won’t have it!”","He then turned to leave.","“Wait.” Feng Wu frowned. “I’m fine with you not liking me, but please tell me why are you saying those things about me?”","Technically speaking, Elder Jing and Elder Grain were brought up by Elder Breeze and had spent their whole lives in this restricted area. They were as naive as kids and would always speak their minds.","Elder Grain glared at Feng Wu. “Because that’s what you are.”","Feng Wu asked, “Give me some examples, then.”","Elder Jing and Chaoge wanted to help Feng Wu, but she stopped them.","She had never lost an argument before.","She sat down in front of Elder Grain and calmly looked at him.","Elder Grain immediately felt that he was already losing ground.","He wasn’t going to give up like this.","He also grabbed a chair and sat down opposite Feng Wu.","“Fine, if you want to humiliate yourself, I’ll give you that chance.” Elder Grain snorted. “First of all, we’re told that your arrogance has brought you many enemies, and it’ll bring danger to the Feng clan. Isn’t that true?”","Feng Wu asked, “For example, what enemy?”","Elder Grain looked at the list Feng Yanfeng had given them and said, “The Zuo family.”","Feng Wu smirked. “Then do you know that the Zuo family was the one who destroyed my cultivation ability back then?”","Those words shocked all the elders. They stared at Feng Wu in disbelief and said, “How can that be?”","Feng Wu had just happened to record Zuo Qingxian’s speech with the Spiritual Fossil Stone.","He had talked about how they had destroyed Feng Wu’s cultivation ability.","Feng Wu had yet to find a chance to show it to anyone, and now, the three elders would be her witnesses.","When they watched it, time seemed to freeze.","Elder Jing was the first to react. He punched Elder Grain and said, “I knew it. I told you that there was something strange about the incident, but you stopped me from looking into it!”","Elder Grain looked rather guilty. “I...”","Elder Breeze’s face remained expressionless, and no one knew what he was thinking.","Feng Wu looked at Elder Grain.. “So, what’s next?”"]},{"number":2323,"title":"Chapter 2323 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Elder Grain looked at Elder Jing and hesitated.","Elder Jing snorted. “If you have doubts, ask her!”","He had to make sure that Elder Grain accepted Feng Wu wholeheartedly. Otherwise, there would still be more trouble in the future.","“Next question.” Elder Grain looked at Feng Wu. “You don’t care about your family members at all. You killed your cousin Feng Liu and cut off your aunt’s hand. That’s unacceptable. What do you have to say to that?”","Feng Wu smiled.","Elder Grain glared at her. “How can you be smiling?”","Feng Wu said, “You’ll know the answer after I tell you what happened.”","Feng Wu described what Feng Liu did in the tombs and smirked. “After how she provoked me over and over again, I think I was very lenient with her.”","She shrugged.","Feng Liu had thought that as her cousin, Feng Wu would forgive her, but she had forgotten that she had never shown Feng Wu any sisterly kindness.","The three elders fell silent again.","They never thought that Feng Wu would have gone through so much hardship.","From Feng Wu’s description, they realized that Feng Liu only had herself to blame.","“But what if you’re lying to us?” Elder Grain stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu chuckled, “If I really did kill Feng Liu for no reason, why isn’t Feng Yanfeng trying to kill me now?”","Elder Grain didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu said, “Over ten people were watching, and they all saw how Feng Liu died. I won’t admit to things I didn’t do!”","Elder Jing nodded. “You’re right. You had many witnesses. Don’t worry. I’m on your side.”","“Go away.” Elder Grain glared at Elder Jing. Feng Wu’s answers to the first two questions were acceptable, so he moved on to the next question. “You injured four sons of the Gu family, and they’ve given us an ultimatum. If we don’t hand you over, they’ll join hands with other families to boycott us. What explanation do you have for that?”","Feng Wu frowned. “An ultimatum?”","Elder Grain showed her the letter. “Look. It says so here.”","Feng Wu smiled. “In that case, I’ll have to tell you about what my aunt, Lady Gu, did.”","Hence, she told them about how Lady Gu had tried to marry the beautiful lady off to become a concubine. Naturally, she explained why she cut off Lady Gu’s hand and destroyed her home.","Even Elder Breeze was surprised by how capable she was.","Elder Jing and Elder Grain’s eyes sparkled as they looked at Feng Wu.","Especially Elder Grain.","He was short-tempered and would never wait to take his revenge.","Therefore, he found the way Feng Wu got back at her enemies so satisfying.","He was patting Feng Wu’s shoulder when he suddenly realized that he was still supposed to be questioning her. They weren’t friends yet.","Ahem!","Elder Grain cleared his throat and stared at Feng Wu again.."]},{"number":2324,"title":"Chapter 2324 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","“Then what about the sons of the Gu family?” Elder Grain asked.","“I know the answer to that question! I was there the whole time!” Chaoge finally had a chance to speak.","“Where do I begin? Well, let’s start with Gu Xingcheng.”","Chaoge was a great storyteller, and she made everything sound so interesting.","Elder Jing and Elder Grain listened in amazement.","“That’s great! They’re mere Level 1 and Level 3 Spiritual Lords; how dare they act arrogantly in front of Xiao Wu? She’s a Level 9 Spiritual Lord!” Elder Jing said loudly.","Elder Grain nodded as well.","That was so true. A Level 1 Spiritual Lord was nowhere close enough to being called a genius.","Feng Wu was barely 14, and she was almost a Level 1 Spiritual King! Deep down, Elder Grain was so proud.","Chaoge said, “The Gu family is such a bully! They started it first, and they’re putting pressure on you now just because they’re not Xiao Wu’s match. They’re unbelievable!”","Elder Jing smacked his thigh. “I would beat them up as well if I were Xiao Wu! She did nothing wrong!”","Elder Grain nodded as well. “That’s right!”","The two of them then looked at Elder Breeze in unison.","Elder Breeze shrugged. “The Gu family has a very capable elder, and I’m not his match.”","Elder Jing said, “Then what are we going to do? We can’t let them take Xiao Wu away!”","Elder Grain wasn’t completely convinced yet, and he mumbled, “There’s still Feng Qi... Isn’t she supposed to be as talented as Feng Wu?”","Elder Jing rolled his eyes at him. “Are you sure about that?”","Elder Grain said, “We don’t know for sure.”","The two of them then started a staring contest.","In the end, Elder Jing gave in. “I see that you won’t give up unless you see it with your own eyes. Bring Feng Qi here and let her go through the maze. You’ll see what her capability is like.”","Elder Jing had completely switched to Feng Wu’s side, but Elder Grain didn’t feel the same way.","Although he was impressed by Feng Wu, the letter said that Feng Qi was quite talented as well. What if she was also a genius?","However...","Elder Grain was utterly disappointed when he dressed up as the masked man and led Feng Qi into the formation.","Feng Qi was a mess.","She hadn’t reached the maze yet, but she was already crying for her mom.","And they could see that she was only a Spiritual Elder.","Elder Jing rolled his eyes at Elder Grain. “What did you say? What if she’s a genius as well? Can you hear her crying now?”","“Hm —”","Elder Grain lowered his head and couldn’t say a word.","Normally, if Elder Jing scolded him like this, he would jump to his feet and start exchanging blows with Elder Jing, but now, he only listened without uttering a word.","He couldn’t say anything to refute Elder Jing.","“What do you think we are? A blessed family that has one genius after another? We should feel so lucky to have Xiao Wu.. You have to be delusional to wish for a second genius!”"]},{"number":2325,"title":"Chapter 2325 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“How can Feng Qi call herself a genius? She only reached her level because they filled her with cultivation potions. Her foundation is anything but solid! That Feng Yanfeng has to be shameless to say that Feng Qi is more talented than Xiao Wu. Is he blind?”","“No, he’s just mean.” Chaoge snorted. “They didn’t want to see Xiao Wu rise, so they tried to destroy her.”","Elder Jing pointed at Chaoge and glared at Elder Grain. “Did you hear that? Are you still on their side now?","“If Feng Yanfeng lied about Feng Qi, we can deduce that everything he said about Xiao Wu was a lie, too!”","Elder Jing was furious. “He’ll have to pay for that!”","Elder Grain clenched his fists. He had been told off because of Feng Yanfeng, and he decided to teach that man a lesson as well.","He was about to go get Feng Yanfeng and beat him up.","But Feng Wu made a proposal that puzzled them all.","“You want to handle Feng Yanfeng yourself?” Elder Grain was perplexed. “Why won’t you let us help you?”","By then, Feng Wu had figured out what Elder Grain was like, so she chuckled. “I just want to expose him when the time is right, and that’s not now. So, please don’t let Feng Yanfeng hear about our meeting. Is that alright?”","Elder Jing agreed before Elder Grain could say anything.","Elder Jing liked Feng Wu very much, and he was looking forward to seeing what Feng Wu would do.","“Achoo —”","Feng Yanfeng sneezed in his study. He rubbed his nose and felt a little strange.","“What’s wrong? Did you catch a cold? Shall I fetch the doctor?” Lady Wang walked in with some dessert.","Feng Yanfeng shook his head. “Somebody’s probably talking behind my back. Don’t worry.”","Lady Wang whispered, “What about Feng Wu?”","Feng Yanfeng was very confident. “I’ve given them a full report, and the elders know what happened.","“They’ve stayed in the backyard for so long and have hardly met anyone. They’ll believe whatever I tell them.”","Lady Wang was excited. “Are you saying that we’ll soon be rid of Feng Wu?!”","Feng Yanfeng said, “Elder Grain supports us.”","Lady Wang smiled brightly.","But she wasn’t so happy the next day.","“What’s going on?”","She walked into the study to find Feng Yanfeng sitting there with a long face.","He handed her a piece of paper.","Lady Wang read it and frowned.","Because the elders were informing them that their request had been refused.","Lady Wang couldn’t believe her eyes. She rubbed her eyes and read the paper again.","The reply seemed to be laughing at the couple.","“Why is this happening? Weren’t you so confident yesterday? Why did they turn us down?!” Her first reaction was to question Feng Yanfeng.."]},{"number":2326,"title":"Chapter 2326 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Yanfeng was frustrated as well. “How am I supposed to know? Elder Grain really did agree to my request yesterday!”","What he didn’t say was that when he went to see the elders again, Elder Grain’s attitude had completely turned around. He looked at Feng Yanfeng as if he was looking at a villain... Feng Yanfeng rubbed his forehead in frustration.","Somehow, he couldn’t get Elder Grain’s meaningful look out of his mind. It made him feel that something was about to happen.","Lady Wang cringed when Feng Yanfeng shouted at her. She didn’t dare voice any more complaints, but she was already beginning to hatch a new plan.","She had always had a plan B.","The elders had been plan A. Things would be a lot easier if they agreed to kick Feng Wu out of the clan.","The Gu family was her other way out.","After she left the study, she went to see Lady Gu.","“You want the Gu family to force the Feng clan’s hand?” Lady Gu smiled bitterly and shook her head. “That won’t happen.”","“Why?!” Lady Wang was confused. “Didn’t Feng Wu injure you and four of their sons? How can the Gu family stand it?!”","Lady Gu gave her a strange look.","It gave Lady Wang the creeps. “Why are you looking at me like that?”","Lady Gu said, “Do you really not know?”","Lady Wang shook her head.","Lady Gu said, “I went to beg my brother, but he turned me down, so I went to ask my parents for help. My mom told me a secret.”","Lady Wang asked, “What is it?”","Lady Gu took a deep breath and said, “All Spiritual Kings are forbidden to take part in this matter. Breaking the rule is punishable by death!”","Lady Wang put a hand on her chest. “Where did that come from? Why didn’t I hear anything?”","Lady Gu shook her head. “My mom doesn’t know either. She said that my brother told her. I think my brother knows where that order came from.”","Lady Wang asked, “Could it have come from your brother?”","Lady Gu frowned. “I don’t think so. That wouldn’t make sense.”","Lady Wang said, “That is to say, as long as we don’t use force, we can do whatever we want, like trying a woman’s way.”","Lady Gu’s eyes lit up. “Do you have any suggestions?”","Lady Wang had been thinking these days, and she had actually come up with a plan. However, it would need Feng Wu’s participation to work.","“That’s it! My mother will be celebrating her 80th birthday in a few days!” Lady Gu cried out. “That’s a great opportunity!","“In the next few days, we can befriend Feng Wu. Only then will she go with us.” There was a sinister look in Lady Gu’s eyes.","Lady Wang asked curiously, “Can you befriend Feng Wu now?”","Lady Gu narrowed her eyes. “As long as we can defeat her in the end, I don’t mind putting up with her for a little longer.”","Her tone gave Lady Wang the creeps.","Feng Wu didn’t go to the restricted area in the next few days, because she knew that it wasn’t the right time yet, and she didn’t want Feng Yanfeng to notice her relationship with the elders.","“Xiao Wu, I’ve been a little nervous lately. It’s like I’m waiting for a sword hanging above my head to fall, but it just won’t fall,” Chaoge complained to Feng Wu.."]},{"number":2327,"title":"Chapter 2327 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu felt the same way.","She had even more things on her plate.","She hadn’t finished the tenth trial yet, and the eleventh had yet to be announced.","Feng Yanfeng, Lady Gu, and Lady Wang were giving her trouble. She also had to handle what was going on between her mother and the Gu family.","She also hadn’t figured out what was so mysterious about Year 4 yet.","...","However...","She then remembered the intelligence department.","The head was Qin Mo, and there were three divisions: military intelligence, espionage department, and the secret guards.","Military intelligence gathered military information, the espionage department was in charge of spies, and the secret guards kept an eye on all the officials.","And Lord Gu was a government official...","At that thought, Feng Wu took out the token.","It came from Emperor Wu himself, and she was the deputy head of the intelligence department in name; that gave her access to the information she needed.","She went to the intelligence department with the token.","If she had asked around before, she wouldn’t have been able to find the place.","And she wouldn’t get anywhere without the token.","Luckily, she had it.","Everyone in the intelligence department looked extremely serious.","To her surprise, she saw a familiar face.","“Xiao Wu!”","Feng Xun was excited to see her.","No one even looked at them when Feng Xun cried out her name.","“Xiao Wu, I’m so glad that you’re here. I was going to see you.” Feng Xun rubbed his eyes.","Seeing how exhausted he looked, Feng Wu couldn’t help asking, “What happened?”","To other people, Feng Xun was only a young lord, but he was in fact a member of the intelligence department, and his main task was to keep an eye on the department for Jun Linyuan.","Feng Xun yawned, which brought tears to his eyes. He looked frustrated when he said, “Xiao Wu, I can’t do anything without you.”","He then tried to hug her.","Feng Wu said, “Hey, be civil. Tell me what this is about, or I’m leaving.”","“Fine, I’ll tell you.” Feng Xun pressed her down in a chair before taking a seat himself. He then said seriously, “It’s about the revival list.”","“Really?” Feng Wu was intrigued.","Feng Xun said solemnly, “With the list you gave us, we should have been able to catch them all, but in the end, three of them got away.”","Feng Wu knew that because she could see it in her log. Until they caught those three people, Feng Wu couldn’t finish the tenth trial.","And if she didn’t finish that trial, she wouldn’t be able to get the second broken star piece to wake up her beautiful master. It frustrated Feng Wu to think of that possibility.","That was why she had come here today.","“The three that got away are captains.” Feng Xun gritted his teeth. “They’re all Spiritual Kings and very hard to catch. I don’t know what to do. Xiao Wu, do you have any ideas?”","Feng Xun was at his wit’s end. “His Majesty is furious and has given me an ultimatum: If I can’t catch them in three days, I won’t have this job anymore.”","Feng Wu said, “Tell me everything you’ve done so far..”"]},{"number":2328,"title":"Chapter 2328 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hence, Feng Xun told her everything in detail.","“What do you think? Any clues?” Feng Xun asked nervously.","Feng Wu rubbed her chin and thought for a moment.","“Have you checked everywhere?” she asked.","Feng Xun said, “Yes. We left no stone unturned, but we found nothing.”","Feng Wu suddenly had an idea. “Did you say that all three captains were injured?”","Feng Xun said, “Yes. It was a fierce battle, and one of them was definitely severely injured. The other two have minor injuries. Plus, we’ve closed down the city now, and no one is allowed to leave. They have to be in the imperial capital.”","Feng Wu rubbed her chin and was deep in thought.","Feng Xun looked at her expectantly. He knew that with Feng Wu here, all his problems would be solved.","“Have a look at this.” Feng Wu handed him a piece of paper.","Feng Xun read it. It was the message Gu Xingyuan had left next to Qiuling.","Feng Xun was furious. “Did he do something to you?!”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry, I taught him a lesson. Have a sniff. Do you notice anything?”","Feng Xun shook his head. “I can’t smell anything.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Try again.”","Feng Xun smacked his head.","“Gosh! I see!” He jumped to his feet.","“Wait.” Feng Wu stopped him. “There’s no rush. We need a plan so that we don’t alarm them.”","Feng Xun was very excited. “Xiao Wu, I knew you could help me! You’re the smartest! By the way, why have you stopped visiting Boss Jun...”","Feng Wu was avoiding Jun Linyuan now, so she changed the subject. “Are you familiar with the secret guards?”","Feng Xun said, “Of course I am. So are you.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Do you mean Xuan Yi?”","Feng Xun had wanted to keep her guessing, but Feng Wu had already figured it out.","“Both Xuan Yi and I were promoted after we got back. I’m still in the espionage department, but Xuan Yi went to work for the secret guards.”","Feng Wu nodded and went to find Xuan Yi.","Fallen Star Yard.","Feng Wu was cultivating in the yard when she heard footsteps outside.","“Is Sister Xiao Wu in?”","Feng Wu frowned when she heard the voice.","Granny Zhao turned the person down. “Miss Wu is cultivating now. Miss Qi, please go back.”","It was Feng Qi.","Feng Qi bit her lip and put on a sad face. “Sister Xiao Wu still won’t see me, right? I...”","Granny Zhao said, “Miss Qi, please leave.”","Feng Qi stomped her foot and left reluctantly.","As soon as they were far away enough, Qiaojia, Feng Qi’s maid, started complaining. “Miss Qi, we don’t have to do this every day. This is so humiliating.”","Feng Qi didn’t say anything.","Qiaojia went on. “Miss, why are we doing this? After what she did to us...”","Feng Qi stopped and said coldly, “She won’t be around for much longer. As her cousin, shouldn’t I bid her farewell?”","Qiaojia was confused.."]},{"number":2329,"title":"Chapter 2329 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Inside Fallen Star Yard.","Granny Zhao closed the door and said grumpily, “What’s the matter with Miss Qi these days? She’s been coming here all the time, bringing gifts and apologizing. If she keeps doing this, I’ll start changing my opinion of her.”","Feng Wu said, “Next time she’s here, let her in.”","Granny Zhao was surprised. “Miss Wu, are you going to forgive her and start talking to her family again?","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right.”","Granny Zhao was confused.","Feng Wu chuckled. “Granny Zhao, don’t worry. I just need to put an end to this thing.”","Granny Zhao looked perplexed. She had no idea what Feng Wu was talking about.","As expected, Feng Qi came again that afternoon.","Granny Zhao sighed.","Feng Wu smiled at her.","Granny Zhao had no choice but to open the door and let Feng Qi in.","“Sister Xiao Wu, you finally let me in!” As soon as Feng Qi got in, she held Feng Wu’s arm and wouldn’t let go.","Chaoge was shocked.","Was this person really Feng Qi?","If she didn’t know better, she would think that Feng Qi and Feng Wu were loving sisters.","Feng Wu brushed off Feng Qi’s hands and picked up her cup. “Why do you want to see me?”","Feng Qi’s eyes twinkled. “Sister Xiao Wu, could you do me a little favor?”","Feng Wu asked, “What favor?”","Feng Qi said, “Tomorrow is my grandmother’s 80th birthday. Sister Xiao Wu, will you go with me?”","Chaoge couldn’t stand it anymore. “Feng Qi, have you lost your mind? Feng Wu beat up four of their sons. Going there will only get her killed! So, this is why you’ve been playing nice these days. You’re so evil!”","Feng Qi had always been easily provoked. Hearing what Chaoge said, she almost lost her temper. However, she remembered what her mother told her, so she took a deep breath and fought back her anger.","She took Feng Wu’s arm again. “Sister Xiao Wu, although my four cousins all lost the battle, they really admire your talent and want to befriend you. They just don’t know how to take the first step. After all, they’re boys.","“Will you go with me? My grandmother has been worried about me, fearing that we won’t get along. If she sees how friendly we are, she’ll be very happy.”","Seeing that Feng Wu was listening, Feng Qi went on. “Plus, don’t you want to cancel that marriage contract for your mother?”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","Feng Qi whispered, “My uncle says that you have to go and get the letter yourself.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is that true?”","Feng Qi said, “Of course. My uncle said so himself.”","Seeing that Feng Wu was considering the offer, Chaoge held her hand. “Xiao Wu, don’t listen to her. The Gu family is so dangerous. Who knows what they’ll do to you there?”","Feng Qi said, “My uncle says that if Feng Wu doesn’t have the courage to go, how can she make further achievements in her cultivation?”"]},{"number":2330,"title":"Chapter 2330 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“If you don’t have the courage, there’s no reason for him to feel threatened by you. In that case, there’s no reason for him to call off the marriage.”","That was an outright threat.","“You!” Chaoge bellowed. “You’re threatening Xiao Wu!”","Feng Qi shrugged. “Of course not. I’m just stating the facts.”","Chaoge held Feng Wu’s hand. “Xiao Wu, don’t listen to her. We have many ways to cancel that marriage. You can always go to His Royal Highness for help.”","“I’ll go,” said Feng Wu.","Feng Qi immediately looked relieved. “Sister Xiao Wu, you have to keep your promise, then. I’ll pick you up tomorrow afternoon, and we’ll go together.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Feng Qi happily left with her maid.","As soon as Feng Qi left, Chaoge’s face darkened. “Xiao Wu, how could you say yes? You know perfectly well how dangerous it is!”","Feng Wu beamed at her.","She asked, “What do you think of Fallen Star Yard?”","Chaoge said, “It’s great! Also, it’s so well-guarded that no one can get in.”","Feng Wu looked up at the sky and asked, “Do you know what the best defense is?”","Chaoge shook her head.","“Attack.” Feng Wu smiled at her.","Chaoge’s eyes lit up. “Are you saying that you know how dangerous it is, but you’re still going because you want to initiate an attack?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Chaoge was concerned. “You’ve come up with a thorough plan, right? Please don’t put yourself in danger.”","Feng Wu nodded, just to appease her.","In reality, every plan could go wrong, and nothing was absolutely safe.","Feng Wu didn’t know what tricks the Gu family would play. She would just go with the flow.","The next day, Feng Qi arrived early in the afternoon.","Chaoge answered the door.","She glared at Feng Qi. “I’m going, too!”","Feng Qi smirked inwardly.","“Of course. Come with us,” she said without hesitation.","At an angle the others couldn’t see, Feng Qi had a sinister smile on her face.","They soon left.","Lady Gu and Lady Wang shared a carriage.","Feng Qi, Feng Wu, Feng Sang, and Chaoge were in another.","The maids all sat in a third carriage.","Qiuling’s hand was almost healed, and she insisted on going with Feng Wu, so Feng Wu let her go as well.","Lady Gu and Feng Qi were astonished when they saw Qiuling.","Gu Xingyuan had told them that he had cut off Qiuling’s hand in revenge, but now...","Lady Gu and Feng Qi looked at each other.","Qiuling still had both hands!","Lady Gu asked Qiuling excitedly, “What’s going on with your hand? I thought you were severely injured!”","Qiuling said indifferently, “Do you want to ask why I still have this hand?”","Lady Gu gritted her teeth and nodded.","Qiuling smiled. “It’s thanks to Miss Wu’s great medical skills.. She can reattach severed hands.”"]},{"number":2331,"title":"Chapter 2331 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Lady Gu was shocked.","Feng Wu smiled at her and said, “That’s why I don’t understand: Why didn’t you come to me to reattach your hand?”","Lady Gu asked, “Can you really do that?”","Feng Wu said, “Qiuling is the perfect example, isn’t she?”","Lady Gu was tempted.","However, after so many days, her wound had almost closed. Even if Feng Wu helped her, her hand couldn’t be reattached.","“Will you reattach my hand after we come back?” she asked Feng Wu.","“Aunt, don’t you know?” Feng Wu gave her a strange look.","“What?”","Feng Wu said, “After 24 hours, the success rate goes down to 10%, not to mention that your wound has almost closed up... Where’s the severed hand? Do you still have it?”","Lady Gu said, “We buried it...”","Feng Wu shrugged. “In that case, it’ll be rotten by now. How am I supposed to reattach it? Aunt, that hope is long gone. As for the hand...”","Feng Wu smirked. “It’ll be a reminder to you, to tell you that you shouldn’t stick your hand where it doesn’t belong.”","Lady Gu glared at Feng Wu.","If Feng Wu kept provoking her like that, she wouldn’t be able to play nice for much longer.","Soon, they arrived at the Gu family.","They were welcomed into the house after they got off the carriages.","Even the doorman knew that Feng Wu wasn’t on friendly terms with the Gu family, so he couldn’t help but give her a few more looks.","Chaoge stopped Feng Wu and gave her a warning look.","“I told you. There’s going to be trouble.” Chaoge glanced around them and looked alarmed. “We’re on a battlefield now. It’s not too late to leave yet.”","“No, it is.” Feng Wu held Chaoge’s hand. “If we’re in danger, protect yourself first. Got it?”","Chaoge pouted.","Feng Wu smiled. “Don’t worry. I cherish my life more than you think.”","Although it was going to be dangerous, it would be worth it.","Feng Qi took Feng Wu’s hand and led her inside. “Sister Wu, come with me. The garden is right over there, and that’s where all the young people are. We have many guests today. Let me introduce them to you.”","Seeing that Feng Qi was dragging Feng Wu away, Chaoge and Qiuling quickly followed them.","There were indeed many people in the garden.","At this time of the year, snow covered the ground, giving the garden a serene feel.","All the colorful lights looked even more stunning in the snow.","When Feng Wu arrived, the garden was already packed.","There were three barbecue stands in the garden, and fresh venison was gradually turning golden. The meat sizzled and gave off a great aroma.","Seeing Feng Qi, someone cried out, “Who do we have here? Isn’t it the famous Feng Wu?”","Whoosh!","Immediately, all eyes were on her.","A few people wanted to stab her body with their gazes.","The four Gu brothers whom she had defeated were all there.","Shu Yunruo was there.","So was Gongsun Qing.","As well as Dugu Mengxi and Dugu Yamo.","Behind the Gu brothers were a few teenagers whom Feng Wu didn’t know.."]},{"number":2332,"title":"Chapter 2332 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing Feng Wu, Gu Xingcheng almost jumped to his feet. He asked Feng Qi, “What’s she doing here? Why did you bring her here?!”","Feng Qi still had a plan to carry out, so she had to make sure that Feng Wu remained here.","“Brother Xingcheng, it was only a misunderstanding before. You’ve fought, but I’m sure you can make up over some wine.” Feng Qi smiled. “Sister Wu and I also had a misunderstanding before, but we’ve reconciled as well.”","Gu Xingcheng wanted to scold her, but Feng Qi cut him off. “Brother Xingcheng, if you consider me as your sister, then Sister Wu should be your sister as well. If she upset you before, I’ll apologize to you on her behalf. I know you’re a magnanimous person.”","Gu Xingcheng was shocked.","He had wanted to get even for Feng Qi, but it seemed that Feng Qi and Feng Wu had already forgiven each other.","Someone slowly clapped.","Everyone turned in that direction.","“Your Royal Highness!” The Gu brothers forgot about their questions for Feng Qi, and all of them stood up to greet Jun Linshen, the second prince.","Jun Linshen smiled at Feng Qi. “I didn’t know that Miss Qi was such a kind and generous young lady. How wonderful.”","Feng Qi lowered her head shyly and bowed. “Thank you, Your Royal Highness.”","Jun Linshen then looked at Feng Wu. He had to admit that she was stunning. Even just standing there, she was still the center of all attention.","“It’s been a while.” He walked up to her and lifted her chin. “How have you been? It seems you’ve lost some weight.”","He was touching her!","Feng Wu was about to smack his hand away, but Jun Linshen anticipated it and drew back his hand before Feng Wu could do anything.","Feng Wu glared at Jun Linshen.","But other people didn’t see it that way.","Many people were confused.","Wasn’t Feng Wu supposed to be close to the crown prince? By the looks of it, she and the second prince were also...","Feng Sang frowned and glared at Feng Wu. “Behave yourself! You’re a disgrace to our clan!”","Chaoge didn’t like the sound of that. “Shut your mouth! What did Xiao Wu do?”","Feng Sang smirked. “You should ask her!”","Chaoge said, “No, I won’t! Everything Xiao Wu does is aboveboard! I want to hear your story!”","Feng Sang snorted. “Fine. Doesn’t she go to see the crown prince in the middle of the night all the time? Why is she so familiar with the second prince now? I’d like to know which prince she’s after, the crown prince or the second prince.”","What...","What was that? Feng Wu used to go to the crown prince’s residence all the time in the middle of the night?","Immediately, people began to give Feng Wu strange looks.","That was very bold...","Feng Sang sneered. “Too bad for her, despite all her efforts, the crown prince has never agreed to marry her. Feng Wu, you must be panicking now. So, you’re looking for another way out..”"]},{"number":2333,"title":"Chapter 2333 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Wow —","More people were staring at Feng Wu now.","Instead of explaining his behavior, Jun Linshen just stood there and looked at Feng Wu with a smile.","Feng Sang’s words immediately turned Feng Wu into a public enemy.","The air felt stifling.","Suddenly, Jun Linshen chuckled.","Everyone looked at him in confusion.","Jun Linshen put his hands behind his back and smiled at Feng Wu. “If the crown prince won’t marry you, I can give you a chance. Just think about it.”","At an angle that other people couldn’t see, Feng Wu stomped on his toes and twisted her foot. “Jun Linshen, you’re very talkative today.”","Ssss —","Jun Linshen sucked in his breath.","That was painful.","He felt that she had crushed his bones.","From afar, Feng Wu and Jun Linshen did look quite familiar with each other.","She was about to push Jun Linshen away, when something happened.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Someone was running toward them.","“So, you’re the woman who’s trying to seduce my prince!” a woman shouted.","Then, there was the sound of a whip lashing through the air.","Her shriek made many people jump.","“Look. That’s Miss Tao of the Tao family!”","“As in one of the ten major clans? General Southwest is from that family, right? She’s so fierce!”","“You don’t say! I heard that she’s ferocious!”","“Shush! She’s coming!”","...","Miss Tao aimed her silver whip at Feng Wu.","Seeing Miss Tao running toward them, Jun Linshen involuntarily pushed Feng Wu away.","Poor Feng Wu. She had barely said a word before everyone started slandering her.","“Who are you? How dare you seduce Prince Jun Linshen?!” Miss Tao pointed at Feng Wu with her whip.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","Feng Qi immediately said, “Sister Tao, she’s Feng Wu, my cousin. This is a misunderstanding. There’s nothing between her and the prince. They were just chatting.”","“Just chatting? What kind of woman stands so close when she’s chatting to a man?” Miss Tao rolled her eyes at Feng Qi. “Xiao Qi, you’re a kind girl, but there are many evil people in this world.”","With that, she pushed Feng Qi out of the way and glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu knew that she would be facing some trouble here tonight, but she didn’t expect it to start so soon.","Chaoge wanted to say something, but Feng Wu shook her head.","“Aren’t you the crown prince’s maid? Have you been abandoned? Is that why you’re after Prince Jun Linshen now? You’re such a —”","Smack!","Feng Wu slapped Miss Tao. “Watch what you say.”","Everyone fell silent.","They had been hoping for some bickering, but they didn’t expect Feng Wu to turn physical.","“How dare you hit me?!”"]},{"number":2334,"title":"Chapter 2334 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Miss Tao was the daughter of a great general and was used to getting things her way. She had never been humiliated like this before.","Infuriated, she raised her whip and lashed out at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu grabbed the whip.","Miss Tao wanted to pull the whip back, but no matter how hard she tried, she couldn’t make Feng Wu loosen her grip.","She burst into tears and ran away.","The crowd was speechless.","Someone asked in a low voice, “Is there something going on between Miss Tao and Prince Jun Linshen?”","“You don’t know? His Majesty made a marriage announcement in relation to Prince Jun Linshen the other day. He’s to marry Miss Tao.”","“So, Miss Tao is going to be the future wife of the prince? No wonder she was so angry.”","“As a girl, Feng Wu should be more discreet. Why is she so familiar with the prince? If I were Miss Tao, I would be mad, too.”","...","Most of the guests here were friends of the Gu family, so barely anyone liked Feng Wu.","Jun Linshen looked at Feng Wu and sighed. “Xiao Wu, you didn’t have to...”","He rubbed Feng Wu’s head, and before she could react, he dashed off as fast as his legs could carry him.","“Tao Qingqing, wait —”","Feng Wu was furious.","Why did that man do that?!","He lifted her chin and rubbed her head when she wasn’t looking!","That was so suggestive!","He deliberately made other people think that they were close! Feng Wu already could imagine how furious Jun Linyuan would be when he heard about it.","The crowd all gave her strange looks, and Gu Xingcheng smirked. “If there’s nothing going on between them, why would Prince Jun Linshen rub her head?”","Gu Xingyun said, “The prince lifted her chin as well! That was so intimate!”","“He was obviously flirting with her!”","All the men laughed.","Feng Qi was satisfied. Feeling that her job was done, she ignored Feng Wu after that.","The teenagers all went to hang out with the Gu brothers.","Feng Wu and Chaoge were left alone.","Chaoge wasn’t happy at all.","She didn’t understand why Feng Wu wanted to come here.","“Are you alright?” Someone patted Feng Wu on the back.","Feng Wu turned around and saw that it was Gongsun Qing.","Gongsun Qing was amazed to see Feng Wu again.","Six months ago, she and Feng Wu took the entrance exam together. Feng Wu received the highest marks, and Gongsun Qing had her doubts then.","But now...","“I heard that you skipped Year 2 and went to Year 3.” The Gongsun family was also very well-informed.","“Sort of.” Feng Wu didn’t tell her that she could enter Year 4 at any moment.","“Shall we chat over there?” Gongsun Qing liked Feng Wu and was displeased when she saw how the others treated her.. She pointed at a pavilion a short distance away."]},{"number":2335,"title":"Chapter 2335 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Wu nodded and went with Gongsun Qing.","The two of them sat in the pavilion and chatted happily.","However, Feng Wu never let her guard down.","Because she knew that the Gu family would try to set her up with even more tricks.","“You’re doing great. You’re in Year 3 now, so you must be a Spiritual Elder now,” said Gongsun Qing enviously.","Feng Wu didn’t want to reveal her real ability, but Chaoge answered for her.","Chaoge said, “Spiritual Elder? Xiao Wu has been a Spiritual Lord for a very long time! She even defeated Gu Xingyuan, the Level 3 Spiritual Lord!”","The Gongsun family didn’t want to upset Gongsun Qing and had only told her that Feng Wu had entered Year 3, without telling her what Feng Wu’s cultivation level was.","Gongsun Qing’s face went pale for a brief moment.","No one would be happy to hear that they had been surpassed by people who used to be their equal.","Seeing Gongsun Qing’s pale face, Feng Wu looked at Chaoge in resignation.","Chaoge looked innocently at her and didn’t realize what she had done.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Chaoge was probably the only one who wouldn’t feel upset no matter how fast Feng Wu’s progress was.","Just then, they heard someone talking loudly nearby.","Smack!","There was the sound of someone being slapped, followed by a voice. “You idiot! Do it again, and you won’t get away so easily!”","Gongsun Qing had been trying to find a way out of this embarrassing situation. Hearing the voice, she tugged at Feng Wu. “Let’s go have a look.”","Feng Wu didn’t object.","When they got there, they saw a girl squatting in the bushes and crying as another girl scolded her in a condescending manner.","“Gu Shuyi, she’s your younger sister. Why did you hit her?”","Gongsun Qing seemed to know the Gu family well. She glared at Gu Shuyi and defended the crying girl.","Gu Shuyi was the eighth child of the Gu family, whereas that girl was only the daughter of a concubine. She was known as “Twelve.”","Seeing Gongsun Qing and Feng Wu, Gu Shuyi snorted and grumbled, “It’s my unlucky day!”","Twelve only dared to cry out loud when Gu Shuyi was gone.","Gongsun Qing felt sorry for her and told Feng Wu, “Twelve isn’t the daughter of Lord Gu’s wife. She’s quite timid and is bullied all the time. Look at her clothes. She’s a young lady of the house, but the fabric has all balled up.”","Feng Wu saw that the girl was only eight or nine. On such a cold day, she was only wearing a thin robe. Her hands were red from the cold.","Gongsun Qing told Feng Wu, “They didn’t treat her like this in the beginning. When she was little, a test showed that she was a genius, and she made rapid progress. Everyone said that her future was so promising. In the past few years, however, her cultivation stagnated and her level declined. Right now, she barely has any spiritual essence left, so the Gu family has been ignoring her. Even her maids pick on her. Poor girl.”","“Xiao Wu, that sounds like what you went through!” Chaoge cried out.. “You lost your cultivation ability once and started again, didn’t you?”"]},{"number":2336,"title":"Chapter 2336 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing that, Gongsun Qing’s eyes lit up. “That’s right. How could I forget such an important thing! Xiao Wu, tell Twelve how you got your ability back!”","She then said to Twelve, “Come here and talk to Sister Wu. Maybe she’ll help you get your ability back!”","In this world which valued martial prowess above everything else, if a person didn’t have cultivation ability, no one would care about them.","Twelve looked up at Feng Wu with big, limpid eyes.","“Xiao Wu...”","The look in her eyes was so pitiful that no one could turn her down.","Chaoge couldn’t bear to see the girl like this. She took Feng Wu’s hand and said, “Xiao Wu, I feel sorry for her...”","Feng Wu stood up and smiled at Gongsun Qing. “It’s getting cold. I think it’s going to snow. The old lady’s birthday banquet is about to start. Let’s head back.”","What? Gongsun Qing didn’t know if that was a yes or a no.","Feng Wu walked in front and Chaoge followed.","She kept darting glances at Feng Wu, trying to figure out what the latter was thinking. Unfortunately, when Feng Wu wanted to hide something, no one could see through her.","They arrived at the main hall to find everyone there.","Feng Wu had calculated the time in advance.","She didn’t want to kneel on the ground to celebrate the old lady’s birthday, so she only went there when the celebration was over.","And her timing was perfect.","However, she seemed to attract attention wherever she went. As soon as she walked in, someone cried out, “Speak of the devil. Feng Wu is here.”","Lady Wang was perfectly polite when other people were around. She waved at Feng Wu with a smile. “Xiao Wu, come here and say hello to our host. My lady, this is the naughty fifth daughter of my family.”","What happened in the Feng clan was known only to the Feng and Gu families. The others didn’t know about Feng Wu cutting off Lady Gu’s hand.","Of course, the old Mrs. Gu knew all about it.","Feng Wu looked at her.","Old Mrs. Gu smiled warmly, but there was a cold glint in her eyes.","“Such a pretty girl. Come here and let me look at you.” Old Mrs. Gu had Feng Wu sit down next to her and said, “The longer I look at her, the more I like her.”","She then looked up at Lady Wang. “Is she engaged? We have six boys of her age in the family. She can pick whoever she likes.”","Many ladies were sitting around them along with their daughters and maids.","It was a big crowd.","Feng Wu recognized most of them.","There was Lady Dugu, Mrs. Zuo, and Lady Northern Feng, whom Feng Wu was very familiar with. The few people that she didn’t recognize were probably from the Tao family and the Long family, which was the maternal family of Lord Gu’s wife.","Hearing what the old lady said, many ladies lowered their heads and chuckled into their handkerchiefs.","Lady Wang seemed embarrassed as well."]},{"number":2337,"title":"Chapter 2337 - Untitled","paragraphs":["The general mood was rather embarrassing.","Chaoge was furious.","That old lady was even worse than Lady Wang!","They knew perfectly well that Feng Wu was engaged to the crown prince, but that old lady still asked that question. She was deliberately trying to embarrass Feng Wu!","Chaoge said grumpily, “Xiao Wu is already engaged. I’m afraid that your boys have lost the chance.”","The old lady didn’t expect to hear such a blunt reply. She frowned and asked, “Who’s she?”","Lady Wang told her who Chaoge’s father was.","“A Rank 3 official? No wonder she’s so ill-bred,” Mrs. Gu interjected. “I don’t think they’re acquainted with our family.”","She was suggesting that Chaoge wasn’t welcome here.","Feng Wu rose to her feet and chuckled. “If Old Mrs. Gu doesn’t like to have us here, we should be on our way.”","Of course, the Gu family couldn’t let that happen.","The old lady put on a smile and chided Mrs. Gu. “Don’t say that. We’re not that kind of family. If the young people want to visit us, of course, we’ll welcome them.”","Chaoge found the hospitality very suspicious.","However, she couldn’t figure out what the old lady was playing at just yet.","She kept giving Feng Wu warning glances, telling her to be careful.","Feng Wu patted her hand to calm her down.","The old lady seemed to like Feng Wu. She held her hand and kept asking her questions.","She hadn’t heard the news of Feng Wu beating up the four Gu brothers yet.","“Xiao Wu is in Year 3?” the old lady cried out. “I thought she was eighth in Year 2.”","The old lady had sent people to find information on Feng Wu the day Lady Gu’s hand was cut off, which was why she knew Feng Wu’s ranking.","Seeing that the old lady knew such detailed information, Feng Wu glanced at her and was even more wary.","“She’s in Year 3 now.” Lady Northern Feng waved at Feng Wu to beckon her over. She said, “Xiao Wu is my goddaughter. Of course, I care about her grades. She got into Year 3 just the other day.”","Mrs. Gu was hostile toward Feng Wu. Lady Northern Feng was obviously defending Feng Wu, but Mrs. Gu still said, “That’s very impressive, rising to Year 3 at such a young age. However, she needs to work on her temper. Arrogance and pride will only affect her cultivation.”","Lady Northern Feng said, “Don’t worry about it. Year 3 isn’t that hard for Xiao Wu at all. She can afford to take a break every now and then.”","Mrs. Gu said, “Lady Northern Feng, that’s not the right way to raise a child. She’s only just entered Year 3, and I’m sure that she’s in the bottom half on the billboard. If she doesn’t work on increasing her rank, it’ll affect her confidence.”","The old lady nodded. “That’s true.”","Lady Northern Feng gave them a strange look.. After some hesitation, she asked, “Do you not know?”"]},{"number":2338,"title":"Chapter 2338 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Gu asked, “About what?”","Lady Northern Feng said, “Do you not know that Feng Wu is first on the billboard now?”","Pffft!","Many people almost choked on their tea.","“First?!” Mrs. Gu cried out. “She can’t be! Gu Xingyuan has always been first.”","The old lady nodded.","Lady Northern Feng said proudly, “That’s past history now. Xiao Wu skipped Year 2 and entered Year 3. Not only that, she’s also ready to enter Year 4 at any time. Isn’t that amazing?”","Mrs. Gu said, “Gu Xingyuan is a Level 3 Spiritual Lord. How can this girl surpass him?”","A Level 3 Spiritual Lord? Mrs. Dugu and Mrs. Zuo exchanged looks before they sipped their tea quietly.","A Level 3 Spiritual Lord really didn’t mean much.","As far as they knew, Feng Wu had already been a Level 7 Spiritual Lord before she returned to the imperial capital. Mrs. Zuo remembered it clearly because she had seen it in the crystal ball.","Master Zuo went to hunt Feng Wu down, but even he failed to kill her. Mrs. Zuo remembered it with much regret.","However, Mrs. Gu knew nothing of that. She was so proud of Gu Xingyuan and couldn’t accept the fact that Feng Wu had replaced him on the billboard.","“Fetch Xingyuan, and let’s ask him.” Mrs. Gu smiled at Lady Northern Feng.","Lady Northern Feng shrugged.","Chief Zixuan had forbidden everyone from spreading the news. Although no one knew why she had given that order, they had still done as they were told.","Therefore, even Mrs. Gu and the old lady didn’t know what happened.","Soon, Gu Xingyuan and Gu Xingmeng arrived together.","Mrs. Gu held their hands and asked directly, “Xingyuan, I need to ask you something. Tell everyone here what your ranking is in Year 3.”","Gu Xingyuan’s face turned scarlet red when he heard the question.","He looked around and felt even more ashamed when he saw that everyone was looking at him.","He then saw Feng Wu’s eyes.","What a pair of eyes.","She gave a half-smile.","Gu Xingyuan’s first reaction was that Feng Wu was laughing at him.","He pushed Mrs. Gu away and turned to leave.","“Xingyuan? Xingyuan?” Mrs. Gu was perplexed. “What’s going on? Isn’t he first? Why won’t he say anything?”","Gu Xingmeng was speechless. “Mother! Why did you say that?!”","Mrs. Gu said, “I... I just...”","Gu Xingmeng pointed at Feng Wu. “She’s first now! Why did you ask my brother that question in front of so many people?!”","He gave Feng Wu one last ferocious look before leaving the room.","Everyone was speechless.","Mrs. Gu was the most embarrassed of them all. She had been bragging about Gu Xingyuan as she tried to teach Lady Northern Feng how to raise her goddaughter. As it turned out, Feng Wu was better than her son.","She had no choice but to apologize to Lady Northern Feng. “I didn’t know... Feng Wu is such a genius... She’s the top student in Year 3 already...”"]},{"number":2339,"title":"Chapter 2339 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Mrs. Zuo pursed her lips. These people didn’t know anything.","“Feng Wu only exerted the power of a Level 3 Spiritual Lord when she is in fact a Level 7 Spiritual Lord already. When she reveals her true capability, will they be shocked once more?”","She then thought about her children, Zuo Qingyu and Zuo Qingxian. Feng Wu had achieved so much in the grassland, but she had lost her children forever.","At that thought, she could barely control her hatred of Feng Wu.","Mrs. Gu and Lady Northern Feng showered Feng Wu with praise, but many people didn’t like it, especially Miss Tao.","She frowned and said, “Yes, she’s talented, but she’s a disgrace and has no sense of what’s moral! I have no respect for her whatsoever.”","Chaoge had long found Miss Tao an annoying character. Hearing that, she said angrily, “What’s that supposed to mean?”","Miss Tao snorted. “You know perfectly well what I mean.”","Chaoge said, “Use standard English. I don’t understand sarcasm.”","Miss Tao was used to getting things her way. She rose to her feet and said, “Feng Wu was acting familiar with Prince Jun Linshen in the garden just now! Everyone saw it! We’re not blind!”","Whoosh!","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Only the teenagers had been in the garden just now, but here in the main hall, there were only female guests consisting of the noble ladies and their daughters.","Jun Linshen wasn’t here.","Chaoge rose to her feet as well, looking as intimidating as Miss Tao.","“There’s no ‘acting familiar with Prince Jun Linshen’! The prince flirted with Feng Wu!”","Miss Tao said, “See? You’ve admitted it yourself. There’s something going on between her and the prince!”","Chaoge was furious. That wasn’t what she meant!","“Xiao Wu, how many times do I have to tell you? A girl has to be aware of her actions. You can’t do things that will mislead other people,” Lady Wang said in a seemingly helpless tone. “I know there’s nothing going on between you and the prince, but other people may assume things. Otherwise, why are you the only one they gossip about?”","Feng Wu glanced at her.","That woman was getting better at this. After returning from the grassland, she had stopped attacking Feng Wu directly. Instead, she stayed behind the scenes to egg Lady Gu on.","She was more careful with her choice of words as well. What she said pretty much confirmed what Miss Tao said. It was slander in disguise.","Miss Tao gloated. “The crown prince will never marry you, but I’m going to marry Prince Jun Linshen soon.","“Feng Wu, stay away from my prince. Otherwise, I’ll burn your house to the ground!”","Thump!","Someone smacked the table.","The sudden noise made everyone jump.","They followed the sound and saw that it was Lady Northern Feng.","She was the person with the highest social status here, and right now, she was staring at Miss Tao with cold eyes.."]},{"number":2340,"title":"Chapter 2340 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Miss Tao almost jumped.","“Reputation is very important to girls, and Xiao Wu’s is impeccable! I won’t allow you to slander her!” Lady Northern Feng stared at Miss Tao. “Show me proof or shut up! If I hear you say something like that again, there will be consequences!”","The Tao family was about as prestigious as Northern Feng Mansion. However, Lady Northern Feng had been brought up by the empress dowager and was naturally more respected.","Miss Tao was almost in tears. She stood there and didn’t know what to do.","Her mother patted her and was about to rise to her feet, when the old lady cried out, “Where’s my Dragon Phoenix Bracelet? I put it here just then!”","Immediately, everyone looked at her.","Mrs. Gu quickly walked up to her and tried to calm her down. “Mother, don’t worry. I’m sure we can find it.”","“Dragon Phoenix Bracelet? Is it the one we were appreciating just then?” asked Mrs. Zuo. “It’s a good bracelet, but...”","Old Mrs. Gu snapped, “It’s not precious because it looks nice! That bracelet is a family heirloom!”","A family heirloom? How? Wasn’t it just a bracelet?","Everyone looked confused.","The old lady had always been level-headed, but her hands were shaking now.","Mrs. Zuo and the other ladies looked at one another and wondered if the bracelet was really as important as the old lady said.","Old Mrs. Gu grabbed her daughter-in-law’s hand, so hard that her nails dug into her flesh.","“Look for it! Now!”","Seeing how worried the old lady was, the others were even more concerned.","The Long family of Dragon Valley was associated with the Gu family by marriage, and it was also where Mrs. Gu came from. Old Mrs. Long was also here to celebrate old Mrs. Gu’s birthday.","The two old ladies were friends, so old Mrs. Long asked, “Please tell us more. That Dragon Phoenix Bracelet looks just like any other bracelet.”","Old Mrs. Gu looked like she was about to cry. “It may look like an ordinary bracelet, but there’s a secret hidden inside.”","Old Mrs. Long asked, “Is it a space...”","Old Mrs. Gu smiled wryly. “That’s right. It’s supposed to contain a storage space, but we haven’t been able to open it so far. It’s handed down in the family until one of us can open it.","“It contains a secret skill of the Gu family! We can’t afford to lose it to an outsider!” Old Mrs. Gu’s face was covered with sweat. “Find it now!”","The others didn’t think much of it at first, but then, old Mrs. Gu told them about the storage space and the secret skill.","Everyone grew excited.","“We need to search for it!” said Mrs. Zuo.","Old Mrs. Long nodded as well. “That’s right. It’s too precious!”","Mrs. Zuo asked old Mrs.. Gu, “You had it on your wrist, didn’t you?”"]},{"number":2341,"title":"Chapter 2341 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Old Mrs. Gu was having trouble breathing, and Mrs. Gu tended to her.","She nodded when she heard the question. “Yes, I did. I was wearing it, then my daughter-in-law wanted to look at it, so I took it off and gave it to her. Then —”","“Then we passed it around,” said Mrs. Zuo. “I handed it to Mrs. Dugu.”","Mrs. Dugu said, “I handed it to old Mrs. Long.”","Old Mrs. Long said, “I handed it to Lady Northern Feng.”","Mrs. Tao asked old Mrs. Gu, “I was the last one to handle it before passing it back to you. Do you remember that?”","Old Mrs. Gu looked surprised. “Really? Right, I remember now.”","Mrs. Tao said, “Miss Feng Wu was the last to come into the room, and the bracelet was right on the table next to you.”","Mrs. Zuo nodded. “That’s true. I saw it, too.”","Mrs. Dugu hadn’t seen it, but she now realized what was going on, so she nodded as well. “That’s right. I saw it, too. The bracelet was right there on the table.”","Mrs. Zuo said in a seemingly casual tone, “Then how can it be missing? Not many people have been walking around in the room.”","Mrs. Dugu said, “That’s true. Miss Feng Wu was one of the few people who was walking around.”","Chaoge snapped. “What’s that supposed to mean?!”","Mrs. Zuo glanced at Feng Wu and said, “I suppose we can all close our eyes. If someone took it, they can use this chance to put it back.”","Old Mrs. Gu nodded. “That’s a good idea. Someone fetch some handkerchiefs and cover our eyes. If someone has taken the bracelet by mistake, just put it back on the table. No one will blame them.”","“We’ll all cover our eyes.” Mrs. Zuo glanced at Feng Wu.","Chaoge tugged at Feng Wu.","It was so obvious that they were insinuating it was her!","Even so, Feng Wu remained unperturbed. She smiled at Chaoge and said, “Don’t worry. A clean hand needs no washing.”","Mrs. Zuo snorted inwardly. “A clean hand? There’s no such thing.”","Nearly everyone in the room was trying to set Feng Wu up, and Mrs. Zuo believed that there was no way that Feng Wu could get away.","Everyone’s eyes were covered.","The handkerchiefs were removed five minutes later.","When old Mrs. Gu saw the empty table, she gasped for air.","“Why is this happening?” she asked in disbelief. “Why won’t they give it back?”","This time, she looked right at Feng Wu.","Everyone in the room noticed it.","Lady Wang frowned. “My lady, this is very serious. We can’t have a thief among us. No one is leaving until we find this person.”","Mrs. Tao nodded as well. “This is abominable conduct, stealing something like this. If we don’t catch this person now, they’ll only do worse things in the future!”","Lady Gu said, “In that case, we should search everyone!”"]},{"number":2342,"title":"Chapter 2342 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“The thief must still be in the room, and they have to have the bracelet on them. Search everyone, and we’ll find the thief.”","Mrs. Tao nodded. “I agree.”","Old Mrs. Gu said, “I’m sorry for causing everyone so much trouble. If you’ve been sitting down, please remain seated. We’ll only search the people who have been walking around.","Only a few people fit that category. They were Feng Wu, Duan Chaoge, Feng Qi, and Tao Qingqing.","Feng Qi volunteered. “Go ahead! I didn’t steal anything! I have nothing to hide!”","Miss Tao didn’t like the idea at first, but hearing what Feng Qi said, she said arrogantly, “I didn’t steal it either, and nothing can change that!”","Immediately, everyone looked at Chaoge and Feng Wu.","“Xiao Wu...” The looks in their eyes gave Chaoge the creeps. “What should we do now?”","Feng Wu smiled. “Let them search.”","Chaoge nodded. “That’s right. Let them search. We didn’t take anything.”","Feng Wu looked at her and smiled in resignation.","The girl was so naive. She would never be able to survive this cruel world on her own.","The person frisking them was Granny Zhu, who was Mrs. Gu’s personal maid.","Chaoge said, “Search me first!”","Feng Wu knew that Chaoge would be safe.","Because she was the Gu family’s target, and they wouldn’t waste any energy on Chaoge.","As expected, nothing was found on Chaoge.","Granny Zhu looked at Feng Wu and Tao Qingqing.","Miss Tao was as proud as a peacock. She pointed at Feng Wu and said, “I don’t mind being searched, but she has to be searched along with me!”","Granny Zhu looked at old Mrs. Gu.","The old lady nodded.","Old Mrs. Gu told Suxiang, Mrs. Gu’s maid, to search Miss Tao.","Granny Zhu would search Feng Wu.","When Granny Zhu frisked Chaoge, she did it very quickly. It only took her a few seconds to finish the job, but it was a different story with Feng Wu.","She started from Feng Wu’s hair and carefully worked her way down.","The longer it took, the more flustered Granny Zhu became.","She couldn’t find anything...","How could that be?","When everyone’s eyes were covered, Granny Zhu had put the bracelet in Feng Wu’s sleeve, but it wasn’t there anymore!","Granny Zhu was almost in tears...","Feng Wu smiled at her. “You’ve been staring at my sleeve. Is there anything wrong with it?”","Granny Zhu was speechless.","Feng Wu took off her outer robe and handed it to her. “There. Take a closer look.”","Granny Zhu took the robe in resignation.","She searched every inch of it but found nothing.","She then searched Feng Wu one more time, but to no avail.","Granny Zhu was speechless.","What was she supposed to tell the old lady?","Old Mrs. Gu was staring at Feng Wu. She was waiting for Granny Zhu to find the bracelet, and she would pretend to pass out. That way, they could blame everything on Feng Wu.","However, Granny Zhu never found the bracelet, and the old lady couldn’t carry out her plan."]},{"number":2343,"title":"Chapter 2343 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Just then, Suxiang, who was frisking Tao Qingqing, cried out, “Found it!”","Those words caught everyone’s attention.","She held a small brocade box in her palm. It was just big enough to fit a bracelet.","However, the bracelet had never been in a box, so it couldn’t be what the old lady was looking for...","And the old lady realized what that brocade box was.","Realizing that things were getting out of hand, she gestured at Suxiang, trying to stop her.","But Feng Wu would never let that happen.","A small stone appeared under Suxiang’s feet.","“Ahhh —”","Suxiang tripped and fell, and the box flew out of her hands. It shattered, and the content fell out.","“Gosh. What’s that?”","Soon, the crowd realized that something was wrong because they heard strange breathing sounds coming from the box.","It was the sound of people moaning and groaning.","All the married women in the room immediately knew what it was.","But Feng Qi didn’t, so she picked it up.","She took a look and was almost frightened to death.","“Ahhh!!!”","She screamed and stared at Tao Qingqing in disbelief. “You’re so filthy! I didn’t know that you were this kind of girl!”","Tao Qingqing was utterly confused.","Filthy? Had Feng Qi lost her mind? She rolled her eyes at Feng Qi.","Meanwhile, Lady Gu was dumbfounded.","She had spent a small fortune on this Spiritual Fossil Stone and had gone to a brothel to record the scenes. It was going to be used to set Feng Wu up.","Feng Wu was already being slandered for flirting with Jun Linshen; if the others believed that she was watching such things, her reputation would be ruined forever.","And if they incriminated her for stealing, Feng Wu would be destroyed for good.","However, they had just found the Spiritual Fossil Stone on Tao Qingqing.","Lady Gu was confused, whereas Tao Qingqing’s mother panicked.","Tao Qingqing was dumbfounded when she saw what it was.","“How? How can I have that? It’s not mine! Someone set me up!” Tao Qingqing grabbed her mother’s hand and said anxiously, “It’s not mine! Mother, help me!”","Mrs. Tao was almost in tears.","Tao Qingqing was her only daughter.","She was about to marry Prince Jun Linshen, and if it was believed that she carried something like this on her...","At that thought, Mrs. Tao almost fainted.","“Mother, it’s not mine! Someone else put it there!” Tao Qingqing was scared out of her wits.","Mrs. Tao didn’t have time to calm her down. She only wanted to shut down the recording now because the volume was at full blast.","Her face was scarlet red.","Old Mrs. Gu glared at Suxiang.","The old lady was behind everything, so naturally, she knew what was going on. That stone was supposed to be planted on Feng Wu.","They didn’t need to ruin Tao Qingqing’s reputation!"]},{"number":2344,"title":"Chapter 2344 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Moreover, it would make the Tao family hate their family!","The Gu family had been trying to win the Tao family to their side, but now... Old Mrs. Gu felt like killing herself.","“Get that disgusting thing out of here and smash it! Now!” old Mrs. Gu shouted.","Some maids immediately carried out the order.","At that moment, Feng Qi was the only one who hadn’t been searched.","“What’s this?!” Granny Zhu finally found something on Feng Wu, and she snatched it from her.","It was a piece of paper.","That was the third trap for Feng Wu.","Old Mrs. Gu was finally reassured.","She was smart enough to have backup plans for the bracelet. The first was the stone, and the second was this piece of paper.","Technically, it was a letter that could prove that Feng Wu was a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Even Lady Wang didn’t expect the old lady to be so ruthless.","If Feng Wu was charged with treason, the entire Feng clan would be destroyed.","“Quickly! Show me the letter!”","Old Mrs. Gu couldn’t wait to see it. She struggled to her feet and reached for the paper.","Granny Zhu handed the folded paper to her.","Feng Wu said, “Wait.”","Old Mrs. Gu grabbed the paper and stared at Feng Wu with a frantic look in her eyes. “What? Are you afraid of me seeing it?”","Feng Wu asked, “You haven’t opened it yet. How do you know that it’s a letter?”","Old Mrs. Gu said, “We’ll see after we read it.”","Feng Wu shook her head. “That’s my daily schedule. Please give it back to me.”","Old Mrs. Gu couldn’t wait to unfold the paper. She snorted and said, “What schedule? It’s not a letter that shows you’ve been colluding with our enemies, is it?”","Before Feng Wu could object, she unfolded the paper.","Some distance away, old Mrs. Long frowned.","She felt that old Mrs. Gu was awfully desperate today, which wasn’t like her usual self at all. Moreover, whenever old Mrs. Gu looked at Feng Wu, there was a ferocious look in her eyes.","What was going on?","Why was she targeting a child?","Mrs. Dugu and Mrs. Zuo both saw the excitement in each other’s eyes.","This idea had come from Mrs. Zuo.","They were looking forward to seeing Feng Wu go down, but...","Old Mrs. Gu’s face had darkened, and she remained silent.","Why?","What was going on?","Mrs. Zuo couldn’t stand it anymore. She walked up to old Mrs. Gu as if she knew nothing and murmured, “What letter? I’d like to...”","However, she stiffened before she could finish.","That was because —","It wasn’t a letter at all! It really was a daily schedule!","It was a plan from the time Feng Wu got up in the morning to when she went to bed at night. There was no empty time slot at all.","How diligent!","Mrs. Zuo was dumbfounded. She asked old Mrs. Gu with her eyes where the letter was.","Old Mrs. Gu was as dumbfounded as she was.","Of the two incriminating pieces of “evidence,” the Spiritual Fossil Stone was found on Tao Qingqing. If word got out, Tao Qingqing would have no reputation left.."]},{"number":2345,"title":"Chapter 2345 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The letter that was supposed to prove that Feng Wu was colluding with the enemy was nowhere to be found.","Old Mrs. Gu glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu remained as calm as ever. She smiled and held out her hand. “May I have my schedule back now?”","So, it really was a schedule.","Old Mrs. Long was intrigued. “May I have a look?”","Feng Wu nodded.","The more old Mrs. Long observed Feng Wu, the more she liked her.","She had figured out by now that most of the people in this room were targeting Feng Wu and were hostile toward her. However, the girl remained level-headed and never lost her composure.","How impressive.","Seeing the schedule, old Mrs. Long asked in surprise, “Do you really do all this on a daily basis?”","Feng Wu smiled and nodded.","“How amazing! No wonder you are at the level you’re at, at such a young age. Only a person that can endure hardship can make great achievements,” old Mrs. Long said.","She liked Feng Wu even more.","The other people were all impressed by Feng Wu’s schedule as well.","She practically cultivated nonstop from early in the morning to midnight.","That changed their impression of Feng Wu.","Who wouldn’t like a hard-working person?","“That’s it, then. The search has come up empty.” Old Mrs. Gu was troubled. She needed time to figure out her next move.","“Really? I don’t think so.” Chaoge smirked. “Feng Qi hasn’t been searched yet.”","Feng Qi shouted, “Duan Chaoge, what’s that supposed to mean?”","Chaoge said, “Why do you even ask? The three of us have all been searched thoroughly. Right, Granny Zhu?”","Granny Zhu looked back at the old lady.","Old Mrs. Gu rubbed her temples and nodded.","Granny Zhu gritted her teeth and said, “Yes. I didn’t find anything on Miss Feng Wu.”","Chaoge said, “So, Xiao Wu is innocent, right?”","Old Mrs. Gu wanted to choke Chaoge.","But everyone was watching, and she couldn’t lose her temper.","So she said reluctantly, “That’s right.”","The old lady gritted her teeth when she said those words, which showed how frustrated she was.","Chaoge said, “Good. Since the three of us are all innocent, Feng Qi must have the bracelet!”","Feng Qi said angrily, “Nonsense! Why must I have it?”","Chaoge sneered at her. “The four of us are suspects, and three of us have been searched. Since nothing was found, you must be the culprit! There’s no need denying it!”","Lady Gu said angrily, “Fine! Let Granny Zhu search her! I’d like to see what she can find!”","Granny Zhu would pretend to search Feng Qi."]},{"number":2346,"title":"Chapter 2346 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Chaoge stopped her.","“That won’t do,” said Chaoge. “Feng Qi is the old lady’s granddaughter. Of course, you’re on her side. Even if she stole it, you’ll pretend that nothing happened and blame it on us. No, it can’t be you.”","Old Mrs. Gu frowned. If there weren’t so many people around, she would have had Chaoge killed, but she couldn’t do that while everyone was watching.","Therefore, she could only stare at Chaoge and Feng Wu. “What do you want, then?”","Chaoge snorted. “That’s simple. I’ll do the search.","“I’ll search Feng Qi. That should be fair,” said Chaoge.","Feng Qi smirked. “Why is that fair? What if you put something in my pocket? You’re not frisking me!”","“What about my people?” asked a calm voice.","The crowd looked around and saw that it was Lady Northern Feng.","Lady Northern Feng smiled and pointed at her maid, Granny Tao. She asked old Mrs. Gu, “My lady, how would you feel if I let Granny Tao search Feng Qi?”","Old Mrs. Gu only wanted to make the whole thing go away as soon as possible so that she could move on to the next plan. She said, “Sure. Go ahead.”","Granny Tao walked up to Feng Qi and smiled faintly. “Sorry about this, Miss Feng Qi.”","Feng Qi spread her arms and said, “Just get it over with. I’m starving.”","“Yes,” Granny Tao said calmly.","Just like Granny Zhu did with Feng Wu, she started from Feng Qi’s hair.","Old Mrs. Gu didn’t like it and felt that Lady Northern Feng was deliberately mimicking her.","And she was right.","Granny Tao was indeed mimicking Granny Zhu.","Granny Tao had been with Lady Northern Feng for a very long time, and naturally, she liked Feng Wu. Moreover, with her experience in the imperial palace, she would never be intimidated by the Gu family.","Therefore, she took her time and searched Feng Qi for 15 minutes.","Feng Qi was so angry that her face turned red.","She would have lost her temper if she was being searched by another person. However, Granny Tao was from Northern Feng Mansion, and Lady Northern Feng was known for being unrelenting. Recalling how Tao Qingqing had been scolded by Lady Northern Feng, Feng Qi didn’t dare make a sound.","Lady Gu was frustrated as well. In the end, she couldn’t help but say, “My lady, I think that’s long enough, isn’t it?”","Lady Northern Feng glanced at Granny Tao.","Granny Tao nodded.","Lady Gu let out a breath of relief. “I knew that nothing would be found on her. Xiao Qi is a good girl. How could she steal anything? What a waste of time.”","She even teased Granny Tao a little.","Old Mrs. Gu was relieved as well. “Maybe someone took the bracelet away. Let’s broaden the search.”","Granny Zhu nodded and was about to leave.","“That won’t be necessary.”","Granny Tao looked up at the old lady.","Old Mrs. Gu suddenly had a bad feeling.","She was right!","Granny Tao raised Feng Qi’s right hand, and a bracelet dropped out of her sleeve.. Granny Tao caught it and said, “I frisked Miss Feng Qi for so long because I wanted to make sure that she didn’t have anything else on her.”"]},{"number":2347,"title":"Chapter 2347 - Untitled","paragraphs":["That was to say, she had found the bracelet at the very beginning, but had kept her silence and went on searching for other things.","Lady Gu was dumbfounded.","So was old Mrs. Gu.","Feng Qi was perplexed at first, but she soon denied it. “How can I have it?! It’s impossible! I didn’t take it!”","Granny Tao stared at Granny Zhu and asked, “Did you watch me the whole time when I searched Miss Feng Qi?”","Granny Zhu said, “Yes...”","Granny Tao then looked at Feng Qi. “Then what does Miss Feng Qi mean? Are you saying that I framed you?”","“No, I’m not. But I didn’t take the bracelet! I...” Feng Qi grabbed her mother’s hand and burst into tears. “Mother! It wasn’t me! I’m not the thief!”","Of course, Lady Gu knew that. Moreover, they were supposed to find the bracelet on Feng Wu.","Because she was the one who put it in Feng Wu’s sleeve!","How did Feng Qi end up with it?","Feng Qi was scared out of her wits. “Shouldn’t it be in Feng Wu’s sleeve? Why do I have it? It’s you! You put it there and set me up, didn’t you?!”","Feng Qi glared at Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu only shrugged. “My dear cousin, can you tell me why you know that I was supposed to have the bracelet, and why I would want to frame you?”","Feng Qi scratched her head in a fluster, but she didn’t have any proof.","And Lady Gu knew that as well.","She and old Mrs. Gu looked at each other, and both were frustrated.","They had thought that the three plans would be enough to take Feng Wu down, but none of them worked in the end.","That girl was unbelievable!","Knowing that they had failed, old Mrs. Gu glanced at Feng Qi and said, “You naughty girl. You could have told me that you liked the bracelet, and I would have let you play with it! Taking it like that will make people mistake you for a thief!”","She then scolded Lady Gu. “At her age, you need to be more strict with her. What if she starts taking other people’s things back home?”","The old lady had been talking about catching the thief, but she tried to downplay it now that the bracelet was found on Feng Qi.","Old Mrs. Long frowned.","She didn’t say anything, but that didn’t mean that she didn’t know what was going on.","It was very petty of old Mrs. Gu to behave like this.","Feng Wu, who had kept her silence until then, asked curiously, “Is that bracelet really the one you lost?”","Old Mrs. Gu wanted to say that it wasn’t, but everyone had heard what she said earlier, and she couldn’t admit that she had been lying to all of them.","She could only nod and say, “Yes, that’s the one. She’s such a careless girl.”","While her grandmother and mother wanted her to admit that she had taken the bracelet, Feng Qi didn’t want to do that.","She didn’t want to be seen as a thief!","Because she hadn’t done it.","She grabbed the bracelet and shouted, “I told you already! I didn’t take it! I don’t know why I have it...”? Crack!"]},{"number":2348,"title":"Chapter 2348 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Whoosh!","Everyone looked at her right hand.","Because Feng Qi had just crushed the bracelet in her hand!","The bracelet had shattered into pieces.","“How could that happen?”","“Didn’t the old Mrs. Gu say that it was a family heirloom?”","“Isn’t it supposed to have a storage space inside? Something like that shouldn’t be broken that easily!”","“And if that bracelet is broken, the stuff inside should fall out. Didn’t old Mrs. Gu say that it contains a secret skill? Where is it now?”","Chaoge watched in disbelief.","Gosh!","What did that mean?","“Xiao Wu, who’s lying now?” Chaoge was confused. “Old Mrs. Gu said that the bracelet we found on Feng Qi was the one she lost.","“She also said that it was a family heirloom, hence all the fuss.","“But Feng Qi just crushed it with her bare hand. That’s enough to prove that it’s a fake bracelet...","“I’m so confused. Xiao Wu, is the old lady lying?”","Chaoge was genuinely confused.","Feng Wu had to fight very hard to stop herself from cracking up.","She glanced at old Mrs. Gu.","The old lady looked very embarrassed.","If Chaoge could see it, so could everyone else.","Old Mrs. Long was very disappointed.","She decided that old Mrs. Gu had become a dotard and couldn’t be trusted anymore.","Mrs. Zuo sighed inwardly. The players on her side were simply too stupid. What could she do?","In the end, she still needed to find a way out for old Mrs. Gu.","“My lady, do you usually wear a fake one at home when you walk around?” Mrs. Zuo reacted quickly and gave the old lady a hint.","Old Mrs. Gu was too angry to understand it.","But Mrs. Gu did.","Although she didn’t like it, she still had to make up an excuse for her mother-in-law.","She said, “That’s right. That Dragon Phoenix Bracelet is too precious to be carried around, so I made a duplicate for her to wear on a daily basis. The two are almost identical.","“It’s my mother-in-law’s birthday today, so I’m sure that she was going to wear the genuine one. I guess she mixed up the two pieces and wore the duplicate instead.”","That explanation successfully saved the old lady.","It made sense that the old lady wouldn’t want to destroy the real piece accidentally.","Feng Wu couldn’t help but glance at Mrs. Gu.","Mrs. Gu smiled at Feng Qi. “If Xiao Qi hadn’t destroyed it, we would never have known that it wasn’t the genuine one... Well, it’s getting late...”","After that, Mrs.. Gu wanted to say that it was time to end the banquet."]},{"number":2349,"title":"Chapter 2349 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, old Mrs. Gu didn’t realize what her daughter-in-law was trying to do. She smiled and said, “There’s no rush. Please get some rest. We have a great banquet for you tonight.”","Chaoge’s eyes widened.","Seriously?!","The old lady was so stubborn!","Had it not been for Mrs. Gu, the old lady would have been utterly humiliated. However, she still wouldn’t give up.","Chaoge looked at Feng Wu, who shrugged at her.","Old Mrs. Gu smiled at Feng Wu and rubbed her hair when she walked past her. “Xiao Wu, you haven’t been here for quite some time, and I see that you’re not as familiar with us as before. You’ll get used to it after you stay here for a few days. It was Feng Qi’s fault just then, and she almost incriminated you. As her older cousin, you should talk to her more often. I’ll be much more reassured if the two of you can get along well.”","After that, she left with Granny Zhu.","The crowd scattered as well, and Chaoge was the only one who looked like she had just been struck by lightning.","She had gone very stiff.","She only let out her breath when they were shown to their own room.","“OMG!”","Chaoge let out a breath of relief.","“I can’t believe how shameless that old woman is! She just won’t be defeated!”","Chaoge sat down and started complaining. “I can’t stand her little speech!","“She actually asked you to stay here for a few days, as if you haven’t run into enough danger here!","“And she said that you and Feng Qi should get along with each other. Doesn’t she know how many grudges you have against each other?”","Chaoge moved her chair closer to Feng Wu and said, “Xiao Wu, I just don’t get it.”","Feng Wu said, “What?”","Chaoge said, “It’s so obvious that the old lady is trying to kill you, and so is Lady Gu. Lady Wang is probably on their side as well. Mrs. Dugu and Mrs. Zuo are up to no good either. This place is so evil. Can’t we leave now?”","Feng Wu chuckled. “Why?”","Chaoge said, “Because...”","Feng Wu said, “Did I lose the first round back there?”","Chaoge shook her head.","It had been very dangerous, but as it turned out, that Spiritual Fossil Stone had been found on Tao Qingqing. With so many people in the room, word would get out eventually, and Tao Qingqing’s reputation...","“Tao Qingqing called you frivolous, but she was caught with that stone. That’s karma,” said Chaoge.","Feng Wu said, “Karma had nothing to do with it.”","Chaoge said, “What do you mean?”","Feng Wu said, “It was me.”","Chaoge had speculated that Feng Wu had done something. She burst out laughing after Feng Wu admitted it.","“I knew that it couldn’t be just a coincidence! Xiao Wu, you’re wicked! You put the bracelet on Feng Qi as well, didn’t you?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right. I was worried that the old lady wouldn’t admit it, so I crushed the bracelet beforehand, but I made it look fine on the outside..”"]},{"number":2350,"title":"Chapter 2350 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Chaoge said, “Given Feng Qi’s bad temper, she can never stand it when she’s wrong. So, she tightened her grip, and the bracelet cracked!","“You really were involved in everything, weren’t you?” Chaoge patted Feng Wu’s shoulder. “You’re brilliant!”","Qiuling came in with some tea.","Chaoge finally stopped laughing and asked Feng Wu, “What do you think their next move will be?”","They were outnumbered here, so they had better be careful.","Feng Wu shook her head. “I have no idea.”","Chaoge asked, “What? Are we not leaving?”","Feng Wu said, “The Gu family won’t be able to stop me if I want to go, but I actually want to stay.”","Chaoge asked, “Why?”","Feng Wu said, “If we leave now, the best we can do is humiliate old Mrs. Gu a little. For a shameless person like her, it’s nothing. In that case, all my efforts will go to waste.”","Chaoge said, “So, you’re saying...”","Feng Wu said, “I have something bigger in mind.”","Chaoge was perplexed.","Feng Wu said, “Lord Gu is forcing my mother to marry him. For that, he should be killed!","“Old Mrs. Gu tried to set me up, and I can’t let her live!","“Lady Gu is one of the main culprits, and I won’t forgive her either!","“Many people in the Gu family should disappear forever.” Feng Wu smiled at Chaoge. “This is too good an opportunity to waste.”","“What?!”","Chaoge couldn’t believe her ears.","“Did you just say that you’re going to destroy the entire Gu family?” Chaoge raised her voice.","“Do you want everyone to hear you?” Feng Wu rolled her eyes at her.","Chaoge immediately covered her mouth, but there was still a look of disbelief in her eyes.","Qiuling couldn’t believe it either.","She had always known Feng Wu was very smart, but she had never expected her to try and take down the entire Gu family!","Feng Wu shrugged. “Lady Gu is creating too much trouble, and the Gu family has her back. If that family is gone, she’ll be much easier to deal with.”","Chaoge said, “I know that, but it’s the Gu family we’re talking about here. They’re one of the ten major clans! How are you supposed to bring them down?”","Even Chaoge was intimidated by the idea. “Xiao Wu, how about we slow down a little?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “As far as I know, the Gu family has already formed an alliance with the Zuo family. If I let it happen, things will turn against me. I have to get rid of the Gu family now.”","Feng Wu had gotten the information from Xuan Yi when she went to the intelligence department earlier.","Chaoge said, “Then what are you going to do?”","Feng Wu chuckled. “It may seem difficult, but with the right method, it can be quite easy.”","Chaoge said, “I don’t understand...”","Feng Wu clenched her fists.","What would happen next was going to be very exciting.","She looked forward to that night.","After dinner —","There was a knock on the door.","“They’re here!” Chaoge looked like a cat with its hackles raised.","Feng Wu patted her shoulder. “It hasn’t started yet.. Calm down and answer the door.”"]},{"number":2351,"title":"Chapter 2351 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The door opened.","As it turned out, it was Twelve.","She was the girl Gu Shuyi had scolded earlier, and Gongsun Qing had taken pity on her. Right now, Gongsun Qing was with her as well.","“Xiao Wu —”","Gongsun Qing was about to speak, when Feng Wu shushed her with a gesture.","Gongsun Qing looked inside and saw that Qiuling was cultivating.","Feng Wu said, “Qiuling is cultivating. Let’s not disturb her. We can talk outside.”","Gongsun Qing nodded. “Of course.”","When they were outside, Feng Wu asked, “What can I do for you?”","Gongsun Qing smiled bitterly. “It’s still about Twelve. Xiao Wu, I know that cultivation is a private thing and that each person has their own method, but I feel really sorry for Twelve...”","Seeing Twelve slowly walk away, Gongsun Qing and Feng Wu followed her.","They chatted as they walked.","Gongsun Qing looked at the tiny figure in front of them before she said to Feng Wu, “Do you know why I care so much about her?”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Gongsun Qing said, “Her mother died while saving me, which is a story probably too long for you to listen to. In one word, I owe her my life.”","She then looked into Feng Wu’s eyes and said, “I can give her everything from weapons to resources, but you’re the only one who can do something about her condition. Xiao Wu, can you help her? Just name your terms, and I’ll...”","Before she could finish, they heard a splash.","Both Feng Wu and Gongsun Qing turned around.","They saw Twelve in the river, and she was struggling.","“Help me...”","An invisible current seemed to carry her downstream.","Gongsun Qing ran after Twelve without hesitation.","Thump!","Gongsun Qing jumped into the water.","She had thought that she could easily get Twelve out, but when she got to her, she felt an invisible hand dragging them down.","Both she and Twelve were in danger.","“Help...”","Seeing Gongsun Qing bobbing up and down in the water, Feng Wu shook her head and jumped into the water.","Gongsun Qing was still a Year 1 student and couldn’t do anything about the undercurrent, but Feng Wu was already a Spiritual Lord, which was quite rare in the Junwu Empire.","Feng Wu grabbed one person in each hand and jumped out of the water.","Gongsun Qing coughed violently.","Luckily, Feng Wu got her out before she drowned.","“Are you alright?” Feng Wu asked.","Gongsun Qing said, “I’m fine... How is Twelve?”","It was the middle of winter, and it was freezing outside.","“She’s barely breathing. I need to treat her first.” Feng Wu shook her head. “I need somewhere warm. We can’t stay here. She’ll freeze to death.”","“Look! There’s a house!” Gongsun Qing pointed at a cabin a few hundred meters away in the woods. “There’s light inside. Someone should be living there. We can get some hot water!”","She then turned to Feng Wu. “There’s no kitchen in your courtyard, so hot water will be hard to get. Plus, we’re a long way from there...”","“Let’s go.” Feng Wu picked up Twelve and headed for the cabin.","She knocked on the door, but no one answered.","Gongsun Qing said, “We can’t afford to wait. Let’s smash the door open!”","Feng Wu nodded.","Since she was carrying Twelve, she let Gongsun Qing do the job.","Thump!","Gongsun Qing pounded on the door. It wasn’t tightly locked, and she easily smashed the door open.","“Huh?”","Gongsun Qing looked around and was confused. “The lights are on, but there’s no one here. What’s going on?”","Suddenly, a shadow pounced at her.","The lights all went off.","The room became pitch dark.","Feng Wu heard Gongsun Qing cry out in horror before everything went silent.","As for Feng Wu...","She was attacked at the same time.","Level 9 Spiritual Lords?","Feng Wu smiled a little.","She had thought that Lord Mu would send a Spiritual King after her, but they were only Spiritual Lords.","What she didn’t know was that someone had set a rule beforehand, forbidding any Spiritual King to take part.","Otherwise, it wouldn’t have been just Spiritual Lords.","Feng Wu pretended to be knocked out and fell to the ground.","The two Level 9 Spiritual Lords looked at each other in resignation. Why was their enemy so weak?"]},{"number":2352,"title":"Chapter 2352 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu closed her eyes.","If she struck now, she could take down both Spiritual Lords.","Because when she fought Elder Grain earlier, her sudden burst of energy had enabled her to fight like a Level 1 Spiritual King.","Therefore, she was capable of defeating both Spiritual Lords if she could catch them off guard.","But she didn’t do that.","She had to pretend to be unconscious if she wanted to find out what Lord Mu was up to.","The two Spiritual Lords ignored Gongsun Qing and Twelve, who were lying unconscious on the ground. Feng Wu was their real target.","One of the Spiritual Lords threw Feng Wu over his shoulder, and the other led the way.","They zigzagged through the garden before they jumped into a low building through the window.","“Can we just put her here?” one of them asked.","The other one said, “That’s what we were told to do. Let’s get out of here.”","They turned around and were about to jump out the window.","But Feng Wu struck at that moment.","“Ground Control! Fire Dragon Rod!”","Thump! Thump! Thump!","It worked perfectly.","The two men wouldn’t have lost so easily if they had fought Feng Wu in a normal battle.","But they didn’t expect Feng Wu to wake up, let alone fight back.","And the information they received said that she was only a Level 7 Spiritual Lord.","They were both Level 9 Spiritual Lords and didn’t think that they should take precautions against a Level 7 Spiritual Lord. Therefore, they let their guard down.","Ground Control could keep someone within a circle.","And the Fire Dragon Rod was inescapable.","Feng Wu moved as fast as a streak of lightning.","Although the only light was from the moon outside, it didn’t stop Feng Wu from striking out.","The two Level 9 Spiritual Lords panicked when they were attacked.","They were completely under Feng Wu’s control.","And Feng Wu made good use of this opportunity.","She froze the two men with Ground Control and struck out before they realized what was happening.","Until they fell to the ground...","The two men still didn’t know what had hit them.","Feng Wu didn’t kill them right away.","For one, Level 9 Spiritual Lords weren’t that easy to kill. For another, she still needed them as future witnesses.","After knocking them out, Feng Wu finally had time to look around the room.","It was a small building, and she could see the reflection of a pond outside. The place was well-hidden.","She knew that these people had brought her here for a reason.","She quickly searched the entire building.","She saw a lump on the ground.","It was a person.","She walked closer to see the person’s face.","And she was shocked.","That was because —","Those people had paid a high price to set her up!","The person lying on the ground was none other than Mrs. Gu!","Lord Gu’s wife!","The daughter of the Long family!"]},{"number":2353,"title":"Chapter 2353 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Long family was also one of the ten major clans, and old Mrs. Long was a guest here as well.","Mrs. Gu was lying on the ground, and she had been stabbed in the stomach.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She put a finger under Mrs. Gu’s nose, and her eyes widened.","The lady wasn’t breathing anymore.","She was dead!","This shouldn’t have happened.","Feng Wu remembered that Mrs. Gu had saved old Mrs. Gu from embarrassment earlier in the day.","The old lady should like her.","If this was old Mrs. Gu’s play, Mrs. Gu shouldn’t have been killed. Was there someone else behind this?","Feng Wu was perplexed.","She then realized that someone was trying to frame her for Mrs. Gu’s murder. In that case...","Shortly afterward, she heard footsteps outside.","There were quite a few people.","She frowned and lay down next to Mrs. Gu, pretending to have fainted.","The door opened.","Someone walked in and closed the door.","Feng Wu could feel the person looking her up and down.","In order not to alarm the person, Feng Wu slowed down her breathing and lay completely still.","She felt a hand on her. It moved down from her forehead to her cheeks. She didn’t like the touch at all.","She couldn’t stand it for much longer.","Luckily, the hand stopped before she lost control. The man then murmured, “Feng Wu, you had it coming. After this, you have to marry me.”","That was such a familiar voice.","Hearing the man drink something, Feng Wu opened her eyes a little and saw the face in the moonlight.","It was Jun Linshen!","Was he the person who was setting her up? What was he drinking? It didn’t smell right.","Moreover, why did he say that she had to marry him this time?","Feng Wu’s face darkened.","Meanwhile, the two Level 9 Spiritual Lords had woken up. They had been tied up, gagged, and hidden behind the bed. They now felt that their master was going to be in trouble.","Because this girl was much more capable than a Level 7 Spiritual Lord!","And she had made a lot of preparations...","Jun Linshen was enjoying his role so much that the two Level 9 Spiritual Lords felt utterly embarrassed.","The prince was even talking to himself. He said, “Now, I have to make sure that I’ve covered every angle.”","He ripped a piece of cloth off Mrs. Gu’s clothes, stuffed it in Feng Wu’s hand, and murmured, “Xiao Wu, when you wake up, you’ll see that your world has changed completely.”","He sat down, took Feng Wu’s hand, and went on, “How will it change? Let me tell you.”"]},{"number":2354,"title":"Chapter 2354 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“If you find this world a kind place, when you wake up again, you’ll see that everything has turned against you,” said Jun Linshen.","Feng Wu was screaming in her head, “Let go of my hand!”","Thinking that Feng Wu was unconscious, Jun Linshen happily told her everything. “I didn’t want to target you, but you’re on Jun Linyuan’s side, which makes you my enemy.”","He suddenly chuckled. “When you wake up, you’ll already be my woman. Once you’ve lost your virginity, my proud brother will never have you. He’ll be the first who’ll want to kill you!”","The more he spoke, the happier he became. “What are you going to do then? Everyone will be your enemy, and I’ll be the only one who’s on your side. You’ll have to choose me!”","Jun Linshen gloated and rubbed Feng Wu’s head. “Soon, you’ll be mine!”","Behind the bed, the two men looked at each other in despair.","They were both Jun Linshen’s secret guards.","They wished that they were unconscious.","They wouldn’t feel so embarrassed if they hadn’t seen what Feng Wu had done.","Therefore, they listened to Jun Linshen in utter frustration.","They wanted to warn their master, telling him that Feng Wu could easily outsmart him.","But they couldn’t make a sound.","Feng Wu had tied them up and constrained them so that they couldn’t move a muscle.","She had also put walnuts in their mouths, and it made their tongues go numb.","Jun Linshen had no idea that his two men were worried about him, and was complaining that they had forgotten to put the piece of cloth in Feng Wu’s hand.","If he had known what Feng Wu had done before he arrived, he would be running for his life now.","He touched his face and felt himself turn hotter.","He then reached out for Feng Wu, and frowned. “She’s wearing a lot of clothes. Those two men didn’t do their job properly! I told them to take off her clothes!”","The two men listened in resignation behind the bed.","They heard footsteps outside at that moment.","The door was pushed open.","Before the prince realized it, someone screamed.","“Feng Wu has killed Mrs. Gu!!!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","These people were horrible actors! They started shouting before they could see what was going on inside!","The two men behind the bed looked at each other, and both despaired.","It was so frustrating to see their master make a fool of himself.","Lady Gu and Mrs. Zuo charged in first, followed by Lady Wang.","“Oh my god!” Lady Gu ran to Mrs.. Gu’s side, knocking over tables and chairs on her way."]},{"number":2355,"title":"Chapter 2355 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Sister-in-law, are you alright?!”","Mrs. Zuo said, “Turn on the light! We need to see what happened!”","Feng Wu thought,? If you don’t know what happened, why did you say that I killed Mrs. Gu? Are you a clairvoyant?","Soon, the candles were lit.","Seeing Mrs. Gu lying in a pool of blood with her stomach stabbed, Lady Gu screamed, “Oh my god!!!”","She turned around and met Feng Wu’s gaze.","It felt like she had seen through everything.","Lady Gu’s stomach lurched.","According to the original plan, Feng Wu should be lying unconscious on the ground. Now, however, she looked like someone enjoying a show. Lady Gu suddenly felt like a monkey in the circus.","Why was this happening?","It wasn’t supposed to be like this!","After the initial shock, Lady Gu shouted.","“Feng Wu! You’re a murderer! You killed Mrs. Gu!”","Her face was twisted.","If one looked closely, they could see the hatred and satisfaction in her eyes.","“Feng Wu, what did Mrs. Gu ever do to you? Why did you kill her? You’re going to pay for this!”","Mrs. Zuo opened her eyes wide and seemed to be in shock. She rubbed her forehead and sighed, “Feng Wu, how can you do this? You really are in a lot of trouble this time...”","Because Lady Gu had shouted loudly that Feng Wu had killed Mrs. Gu, more people kept gathering around.","“What’s going on? I heard you shouting from far away.” Lady Wang arrived in a hurry.","And many more people followed.","Old Mrs. Long, Mrs. Tao, Tao Qingqing, and even old Mrs. Gu arrived after her.","Soon, people filled the room.","After word got around, all hell broke loose in the manor.","Soon, half the imperial capital learned that Feng Wu had killed Mrs. Gu.","It would never have spread so fast if someone hadn’t done it on purpose.","Of course, it was still known around the more prestigious families. For instance, Emperor Wu received the news almost right away.","He was having dinner with Consort Ranmil when Qingcao came in to tell them the news.","“What?” Emperor Wu almost dropped his chopsticks.","He stared at Qingcao and asked, “What did you just say?”","Qingcao was Ranmil’s maid, so naturally, they loved to hear such news. However, she couldn’t let it show in front of Emperor Wu.","Qingcao fought back her excitement and spoke in a reverent tone.","“Your Majesty, I have news from Her Majesty the Empress. It’s said that Feng Wu killed Lord Gu’s wife.”","“From Her Majesty? Did she say why?” asked the emperor."]},{"number":2356,"title":"Chapter 2356 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“No.”","Emperor Wu rubbed his forehead. The news was too big to be fake, but it was Mrs. Gu they were talking about.","Both the Gu and Long families were among the ten major clans. Now that they were joined by marriage, even the emperor had to think twice before dealing with them. Luckily, Lord Gu was an obedient subordinate, and the Long family kept a low profile as well.","Why would Feng Wu offend both families at once?","She hasn’t asked me for help yet. Why should I care about her? ?thought Emperor Wu.","On second thought, he realized that with how much Jun Linyuan cared about Feng Wu, he would never sit this one out. If he tried to defend the girl, he could damage the equilibrium among all the families.","At that thought, Emperor Wu couldn’t sit still anymore. He rose to his feet.","He told Gao as he walked, “Send someone to the Gu family and see what’s going on. Be discreet. Is that understood?”","Gao knew that the emperor had to declare his attitude if the others knew that he was asking around. Therefore, he wanted to remain neutral until he found out what happened.","As soon as Emperor Wu left, Ranmil almost jumped to her feet.","She looked at Qingcao in disbelief. “Is it true? Did Feng Wu really kill Mrs. Gu?”","Qingcao nodded. “I heard it from Caiwen, the chief maid of Her Majesty the empress. She said that Feng Wu is definitely going to die this time.”","Ranmil trembled in excitement. “Gosh! I thought I would never defeat Feng Wu, but there she goes. She’s just ruined herself! This is my happiest day!","“Let’s go.” Ranmil headed for the door.","Qingcao asked, “Where are we going?”","Ranmil said, “His Majesty must have gone to Empress Dugu. When Her Majesty the empress dowager hears about it, she’ll want to see Empress Dugu as well. Let’s go to Cining Palace to see the old lady!”","She had never felt so happy since she arrived at the palace.","It was like a sunny day that she had been waiting for for ages.","As expected, Empress Dugu and Emperor Wu were both at the empress dowager’s palace. Even Princess Jun Wuxia was there. They didn’t mind Ranmil joining them.","Caiwen, Empress Dugu’s chief maid, was telling the story. “Mrs. Gu is dead, and the killer is the famous Feng Wu. Lord Gu’s manor is in a mess at the moment, and everyone is asking for more information.”","Gao, the eunuch, had gone to the manor, and would send back information if he found any, but Emperor Wu was still anxious.","“Why did Feng Wu kill Mrs. Gu?” Emperor Wu couldn’t understand it.","Caiwen said, “I heard that Mrs. Gu walked in when Miss Feng Wu was with another man... So...”","What?! Emperor Wu jumped to his feet.","Meanwhile, the Gu manor was in a mess.","All the ladies and their daughters had gathered around.","Old Mrs. Long saw her daughter lying in a pool of blood and the open wound on her stomach. When she heard Lady Gu say that Mrs. Gu was dead...","She immediately passed out.","That started a new round of panic."]},{"number":2357,"title":"Chapter 2357 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","After they carried old Mrs. Long out of the room, they all looked at Feng Wu.","“Look!” Lady Gu pointed at Feng Wu’s hands. “She has...”","She stopped mid-sentence.","Feng Wu should be holding a piece of cloth that was torn off Mrs. Gu’s clothes, but it wasn’t there.","Luckily, Lady Gu stopped before she blurted it out. Otherwise, her plan would be exposed.","“What do I have?” Feng Wu rose to her feet and looked calmly at Lady Gu.","Meanwhile, everyone was watching Feng Wu.","Some were furious, and others were confused.","Lady Gu said, “You killed Mrs. Gu!”","Feng Wu showed everyone her hands. “No, I didn’t.”","Lady Gu said, “Then how did she die? You and she were the only two people here, and she’s lying in a pool of blood now!”","Feng Wu smirked and glanced at the bed.","Behind the bed curtain was Jun Linshen.","Feng Wu walked over to the bed and opened the white curtain.","“Why is Prince Jun Linshen here?!” many people cried out.","Things were getting more and more confusing.","Feng Wu kicked Jun Linshen and said, “Hey, get up!”","The crowd was speechless when they saw how rudely Feng Wu treated the prince.","Even if Jun Linshen wasn’t as popular as Jun Linyuan, he was still a prince. How could Feng Wu kick him?","Jun Linshen’s lashes fluttered, and he opened his eyes.","To be frank, Jun Linshen was a handsome young man. He looked a little delirious when he opened his eyes.","He murmured, “Feng Wu...”","The crowd was shocked.","He sounded drugged!","Prince Jun Linshen and Feng Wu...","Women were very sensitive to such things, especially Tao Qingqing, who was in love with Jun Linshen. She thought she knew what had happened and was furious.","Jun Linshen struggled to sit up. He then grabbed Feng Wu’s hand and said, “You sent me a note, asking me to meet you here. What did you feed me? Why do I feel a little dizzy?”","Ssss —","Everyone drew in their breaths.","Did Feng Wu drug the prince?!","“Why are there so many people here?” Jun Linshen wrapped his robe around his shoulders. Suddenly, his eyes widened.","Because he saw Mrs. Gu, who was lying in a pool of blood.","“Isn’t that Mrs. Gu? What happened to her?” Jun Linshen stared at Feng Wu. “You told me to go to sleep while you went to take care of something. Was that it? Did you go to kill Mrs. Gu?!”","The crowd was astonished.","They hadn’t been convinced that Feng Wu was the killer at first, but after Jun Linshen woke up, everything he said suggested that Feng Wu had killed the lady.","Lady Gu stared at Feng Wu. “What other excuses do you have now?!”","Mrs. Zuo said, “Feng Wu, you’re really having an affair with the prince, and you killed Mrs. Gu to silence her!”","Lady Wang seemed panic-stricken.. She grabbed Feng Wu’s hands and said nervously, “What should we do now? Xiao Wu, just confess your crime.”"]},{"number":2358,"title":"Chapter 2358 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu knew what these people wanted.","But even if she had done it, she still wouldn’t confess, not to mention that she really hadn’t done anything wrong.","Feng Wu’s gaze swept over the crowd.","Lady Gu was furious, Lady Wang was gloating, Mrs. Dugu watched in silence, and old Mrs. Gu couldn’t wait for her to die.","Feng Wu smiled a little. “I didn’t kill Mrs. Gu.”","Lady Gu said, “Yes, you did!”","Feng Wu shrugged. “Why would I do that?”","Lady Gu said, “Because she saw what you did with Prince Jun Linshen!”","Feng Wu looked at her. “What did I do with the prince?”","Lady Gu said, “The prince just admitted it! Stop lying!”","She then turned to Jun Linshen. “Your Royal Highness, why are you here?”","Jun Linshen looked from Lady Gu to Feng Wu and hesitated.","Lady Gu glared at him. “Your Royal Highness, if you don’t come clean, you’ll be a suspect as well.”","After some hesitation, Jun Linshen said, “Xiao Wu asked to meet me here...”","Feng Wu denied it. “No, I didn’t.”","Hearing that, Jun Linshen glared at Feng Wu. “Why would I come here alone?”","As he spoke, he took out a piece of paper and handed it to old Mrs. Gu.","Old Mrs. Gu darted a dirty look at Feng Wu before unfolding the paper.","It was a love letter.","It asked Jun Linshen to come here, and although the handwriting was almost illegible, one could still tell that it was from Feng Wu.","Old Mrs. Gu handed the paper to Mrs. Zuo while she stared at Feng Wu with her cold gaze. “Feng Wu, what do you have to say about this?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “I never asked him to come here.”","Old Mrs. Gu smirked. “Who wrote the letter, then?”","Feng Wu said, “It wasn’t me!”","Granny Zhu reminded old Mrs. Gu, “My lady, we found a schedule on Miss Feng Wu earlier. It has her handwriting on it.”","Old Mrs. Gu nodded. “That’s right. We can compare the two!”","Mrs. Zuo pointed at Mrs. Dugu. “Mrs. Dugu knows handwriting well. Even Her Majesty the empress dowager appreciates her talent. She can have a look for us.”","Old Mrs. Gu said, “Mrs. Dugu, please help us.”","Mrs. Dugu said, “My lady, it’ll be my pleasure. I’m glad that I can help find Mrs. Gu’s killer.”","While Mrs. Dugu compared the handwriting, Lady Gu took out a handkerchief and covered Mrs. Gu’s face.","Everyone waited for Mrs. Dugu’s conclusion.","She didn’t keep the others waiting. In less than five minutes, she was done.","“The two notes are written by the same person,” said Mrs. Dugu solemnly. “Look at these strokes. They have to be from the same hand.”","Old Mrs. Gu glared at Feng Wu. “Here’s your proof!”","Feng Wu was about to say something, when Old Mrs.. Gu waved at some guards. “Take her down and lock her up!”"]},{"number":2359,"title":"Chapter 2359 - Untitled","paragraphs":["After they locked her up, they could do whatever they wanted with her.","“Wait.” When two guards walked toward Feng Wu, she stopped them. “Even if I did write that letter, it can’t prove that I killed Mrs. Gu.”","Lady Gu said, “Although it can’t prove that you’re the killer, it still proves that you’re an unchaste woman! You’re courting His Royal Highness the crown prince and Prince Jun Linshen at the same time! You’re a humiliation to the Feng clan! Do you know how you’ll affect your cousins’ reputation?”","Tao Qingqing finally had her chance. She bellowed, “Feng Wu! I’ve finally caught you! You shameless woman!”","Feng Wu ignored her and only asked Jun Linshen, “My prince, what do you think?”","Jun Linshen looked embarrassed. Finally, he took Tao Qingqing’s hand and said apologetically, “Xiao Wu, I’m so sorry, but Qingqing is the one I want to marry. I won’t accept you no matter what drug you fed me.”","Tao Qingqing was greatly satisfied with the public acknowledgement.","She grabbed Jun Linshen’s hand and cried, “Did she drug you? With what?!”","Jun Linshen rubbed his forehead and seemed frustrated.","Tao Qingqing checked his pulse. She then cried out, “Feng Wu drugged you with an aphrodisiac!”","Whoosh!","Immediately, all eyes were on Feng Wu.","“How could Feng Wu do such a thing?!”","“Did she do the same to the crown prince?”","“She must have. Otherwise, why would His Royal Highness like her?”","“I didn’t know that she was this sort of person. I thought she changed, and I started to like her. How disappointing...”","Tao Qingqing glared at Feng Wu and snorted. “Feng Wu, do you want men so desperately? Do you have to steal other people’s fiancees? You just can’t spend a night alone, can you?”","Hearing all the discussion, Feng Wu smirked. She asked Jun Linshen, “Aren’t you tired?”","Jun Linshen asked, “What are you talking about?”","Feng Wu said, “Aren’t you tired of all the acting?”","Jun Linshen’s stomach lurched.","Feng Wu shook her head. “I was going to show some respect for His Majesty’s sake and not ruin your reputation, but you just won’t stop. I can’t help you anymore.”","Everyone was astonished.","What did that mean?","Shouldn’t Feng Wu be in a fluster, after all that was said about her? But she was threatening the prince now.","Was there something behind it?","Somehow, Jun Linshen panicked a little. He bellowed, “What on earth are you talking about? Take this killer...”","Feng Wu then looked at Mrs. Dugu. “Are you so sure that I was the one who wrote that letter?”","Mrs. Dugu also had a bad feeling. She was alarmed.."]},{"number":2360,"title":"Chapter 2360 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Dugu was a smart woman. She and Feng Wu weren’t archenemies. There was no need for her to drag herself into things.","She gave it some thought and said carefully, “There’s no direct evidence to suggest that you were the one who wrote the letter.”","Old Mrs. Gu glared at Mrs. Dugu.","Mrs. Dugu said, “But it’s certain that the letter was written by the same person who wrote that schedule.”","Feng Wu said, “Are you sure?”","Mrs. Dugu said, “Absolutely!”","Feng Wu chuckled. “But I didn’t write the schedule.”","Feng Wu was incriminated because of the letter.","It was believed that she killed Mrs. Gu because the lady had walked in on her secret meeting with Jun Linshen.","The logic would only work if Feng Wu had really written the letter.","But now, she said calmly, “I didn’t write that schedule. Therefore, I couldn’t have written the letter.”","Jun Linshen snorted. “Of course you would say that. Why should we believe you? Did Qiuling write it, then? You can’t blame everything on your maid.”","Feng Wu smiled. “No, it wasn’t Qiuling.”","Jun Linshen said, “Who was it, then?”","Feng Wu grinned. “Your Royal Highness, be careful what you wish for.”","Jun Linshen glared at Feng Wu and had a bad feeling. He suddenly felt that he had missed something very important.","Feng Wu said, “Take a closer look at that paper.”","The paper?","Jun Linshen picked up the letter and examined it. There was nothing wrong with it.","He then nervously examined the schedule.","Tao Qingqing frowned.","She held Jun Linshen’s hand and tried to take away the letter. “Why are you listening to her? Don’t believe her!”","Jun Linshen pushed her away.","This wasn’t the first time that Jun Linshen had confronted Feng Wu. Apart from Jun Linyuan, she was the person he feared the most.","Every time he thought he was going to win in the past, Feng Wu would humiliate him. Jun Linshen was scared.","The others all thought that Feng Wu was lying, but when they saw how serious Jun Linshen was, they became nervous as well. They all stared at the schedule in Jun Linshen’s hands.","“If you can’t see it...” Feng Wu crossed her hands behind her back and smiled. “Touch it, then.”","Tao Qingqing glared at Jun Linshen.","She thought that Jun Linshen wouldn’t listen to Feng Wu...","But Jun Linshen disappointed her.","He started feeling the paper like Feng Wu said. There was nothing at first.","Suddenly, he froze.","His eyes widened.","Everyone saw the change in his expression.","They wondered what had happened.","Jun Linshen glared at Feng Wu as if he was trying to peel her skin off."]},{"number":2361,"title":"Chapter 2361 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“You...” Jun Linshen wanted to say something but only managed to utter a single word.","“What’s wrong?” Mrs. Dugu was frightened by the look on his face.","“Your Royal Highness, Is there something wrong with the schedule?”","Feng Wu smiled. “When we were in the grassland, His Majesty heard about my daily schedule and said that he would punish me if I couldn’t do everything I said I would. As proof, he wrote down the schedule himself.”","WHAT?!","His Majesty wrote it himself?!","His Majesty?!","“That’s impossible!” Mrs. Dugu pointed at the paper. “Why would His Majesty write something like this? It’s complete nonsense!”","Feng Wu didn’t retort. She only smiled at Jun Linshen until it gave him the creeps.","Since everyone was looking at Feng Wu, when she smiled at Jun Linshen, the others all looked at Jun Linshen in bewilderment as well.","Jun Linshen felt his stomach sink.","He couldn’t answer that question.","Because he couldn’t afford the consequences.","He grabbed the schedule and wanted to tear it up.","Feng Wu beamed at him. “Only someone with a guilty conscience would want to destroy the evidence.”","She was suggesting that Jun Linshen would only incriminate himself if he destroyed the paper.","Jun Linshen glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu chuckled. “Plus, His Majesty will remember that he wrote it. I don’t think he’ll be very happy if he knows that you tore up his work.”","Hearing that, Jun Linshen didn’t know what to do.","Everyone was murmuring among themselves.","“What is that schedule?”","“What secret does it contain?”","“If His Majesty really did write that schedule, then the so-called handwritten letter from Feng Wu...” That meant that someone was trying to frame her!","Everyone looked at Jun Linshen.","Only he knew the truth.","Tao Qingqing grew anxious. She grabbed Jun Linshen and shouted, “Your Royal Highness, just deny it! How could His Majesty have written this?! Just say no, and we’ll believe you!”","Jun Linshen wanted to kill her.","What an idiot!","Couldn’t she see the situation he was in? What she said only made it worse!","Meanwhile, many people were filled with doubts. Even those who had believed Feng Wu to be the murderer began to have second thoughts.","Jun Linshen racked his brain.","If it was proven that the schedule had been written by his father, it would indirectly prove that he had been lying. And if a prince was believed to be a liar...","It was worse than being mediocre!","Hence...","When he made up his mind to tear up the schedule, he suddenly felt a cold gaze on him.","Someone seemed to be watching him from half a city away.","His mind wandered for a brief moment.","When he returned to himself...","“His Royal Highness, the crown prince is here!”","Those words woke him up.","The crowd stirred.","“His Royal Highness is here!”","“I thought His Royal Highness was in seclusion and wouldn’t see anyone. Why is he here?”"]},{"number":2362,"title":"Chapter 2362 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“His Royal Highness accepted the Gu family’s invitation. That’s how important the Gu family is.”","Lord Gu, who had stayed behind the scenes until then, welcomed Jun Linyuan into the room.","As soon as Jun Linyuan walked in, the crowd parted, making way for him.","Jun Linyuan looked very elegant in his fox fur coat.","He had always been an outstanding figure.","Light seemed to follow him wherever he went.","Around him, everyone fell into the background.","He looked like the only star in the sky.","Jun Linyuan was more impressive than he usually was. The moment he walked in, the temperature in the room seemed to drop, and everyone fell silent.","No one even dared to look up at him.","The young man was unapproachable.","Ever since he walked in, Jun Linyuan had kept his unblinking gaze on Feng Wu. There was an eager look in his eyes.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","Somehow, that look made her uneasy.","Jun Linyuan walked up to her and cast a stern look at her.","Feng Wu stumbled back involuntarily.","The crown prince reached out and pulled Feng Wu into his arms.","Feng Wu whimpered when her nose bumped into his chest.","Jun Linyuan bent down and whispered something in her ear.","Feng Wu stiffened when she heard what he said.","Because he said —","“I’ll break your leg if you try to approach another man!”","Feng Wu glared at him.","What was that supposed to mean?","There was no other man. Wait. That wasn’t it. He had no right to say such things to her!","Feng Wu would have retorted on any other day, but Jun Linyuan felt exceedingly unapproachable today.","She felt intimidated.","The crown prince only turned away after staring at Feng Wu for several seconds.","And he became even more intimidating after he turned around.","No one dared to meet his gaze.","He was without a doubt the most talented man of his age.","He was more talented than many teenagers put together.","Even Jun Linshen was chilled to the bone by the energy Jun Linyuan gave off.","He seemed to be cold to Feng Wu, but it was nothing compared with how he treated other people.","Jun Linyuan snatched the schedule from Jun Linshen.","Only then did Jun Linshen jump up in fright.","He glared at Jun Linyuan and wanted to take it back, but he realized in frustration that he didn’t dare to say a word.","The crown prince frowned after he glanced at the schedule. He then asked Jun Linshen, “What’s this print?”","Jun Linshen gritted his teeth.","He had had to search for it for a very long time, but Jun Linyuan saw it at first glance!"]},{"number":2363,"title":"Chapter 2363 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, he didn’t dare question Jun Linyuan openly...","He wanted to play the tough guy, but he had a feeling that if he did that, Jun Linyuan would choke him in front of everyone.","Before Jun Linyuan arrived, Jun Linshen had been the most powerful man in the room, and everyone had to listen to him.","But his status had been reduced significantly after Jun Linyuan arrived. He didn’t dare talk back to his brother no matter what he said.","Jun Linshen said gingerly, “I understand...”","Jun Linyuan grinned and glanced at him. “What do you understand?”","Jun Linshen knew that Jun Linyuan was on Feng Wu’s side.","Now that Jun Linyuan had the schedule, Jun Linshen felt that he should have revealed the truth first... Despite the hatred that filled his heart, he couldn’t let it show.","Jun Linshen remained silent.","Jun Linyuan didn’t press him. He looked back at Feng Wu and whispered in her ear, “I told you I could help you.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","He was so intimidating a minute ago, but what was he doing now?","“Beg me,” Jun Linyuan whispered. “Beg me, and I’ll help you.”","Feng Wu glared at him. What was this man doing?","Jun Linyuan had his back to the crowd, but Feng Wu could see their faces. She could see how much Jun Linyuan terrified them.","The fear was in their bones.","He was like a god of death to them.","Even Lord Gu and old Mrs. Gu had to bow their heads.","That was how important Jun Linyuan was.","No one could challenge him.","But now, he was asking Feng Wu if she needed his help.","Feng Wu glared at him.","What a...","He only asked her that after he made his grand entrance and terrified everyone.","One word from him, and all her problems would be solved, but Feng Wu didn’t want to see his gloating smile.","Feng Wu snorted. “I don’t need your help!”","The crown prince glanced at Feng Wu. “Are you sure?”","Feng Wu pushed him away. “I can handle it myself!”","Jun Linyuan nodded. He glanced at Feng Wu and smiled.","Feng showed up out of nowhere with a chair.","The crown prince sat down, rested his chin on his hand, and looked at Feng Wu in expectation.","From Tao Qingqing’s angle, she could see Jun Linyuan’s smile when he spoke to Feng Wu.","She couldn’t believe what she saw. She rubbed her eyes and found that the crown prince was as handsome as ever.","But there was passion in his eyes when he looked at Feng Wu.","Was the crown prince actually as relentless as he seemed?","She immediately said, “Your Royal Highness, Feng Wu asked Prince Jun Linshen here to spend the night with her. She’s an unchaste woman...”","There was a loud thump before Tao Qingqing could finish."]},{"number":2364,"title":"Chapter 2364 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan punched Tao Qingqing in the chest, and she flew backward.","Thump!","Tao Qingqing knocked over many tables and chairs before she smashed into the wall.","Pffft!","She fell to the ground and spat out a mouthful of blood.","Everyone was astonished.","They didn’t dare to look at the crown prince, so they could only stare at Tao Qingqing.","What a strike!","Lady Gu and Lady Wang looked at each other. Old Mrs. Gu frowned, and Mrs. Zuo had clenched her fists so hard that her fingernails were digging into her palms.","They all had a bad feeling.","Mrs. Zuo had been giving Feng Wu trouble for quite some time, but she had never seen the crown prince like this before.","She tried to convince herself that she was mistaken.","Deep down, however, she knew that the crown prince had feelings for Feng Wu.","Qingluan, you shouldn’t be so confident in yourself. Stop traveling around and come back! ?Mrs. Zuo gritted her teeth and thought to herself. She really was getting anxious.","Tao Qingqing was the most confused of them all.","She never saw it coming.","She was the daughter of the Tao family and was used to an indulgent life. Feng Wu was only a useless daughter of a declining family!","How could the crown prince do this? Tao Qingqing was so frustrated that she wanted to cry, but she then saw Jun Linyuan’s eyes.","What a pair of eyes.","There was no warmth in them.","Under his gaze, Tao Qingqing felt like an ant crawling on the ground. She knew that he wouldn’t hesitate to kill her, because his eyes were filled with contempt.","But he didn’t look at Feng Wu like that.","Tao Qingqing was so scared that she wept in silence.","Jun Linyuan ignored Tao Qingqing after that and kept his unblinking gaze on Feng Wu.","He couldn’t believe how good-looking she was.","He couldn’t look away from her.","But he didn’t know that he was already the center of attention and that people were watching his every move.","Everything happened so fast after Tao Qingqing was smashed away.","Feng Wu ignored her after that because Jun Linyuan had done that too many times already.","Feng wanted to remind her that every time the crown prince did such a thing, it was for her.","Feng Wu took the schedule from Jun Linyuan and looked around. She then found a charcoal crayon on the desk.","She began to smear the charcoal on the paper. Soon, a print appeared.","It was the mark made by a jade seal.","Feng Wu smiled at Jun Linshen. “Are you still not going to admit it?”","Jun Linshen gritted her teeth. “What can this mark prove?”","Feng Wu smiled. “It can prove that the paper came from His Majesty’s desk. Are you going to say that I can’t prove that His Majesty wrote it? Actually, I can.”","Feng Wu pointed at Jun Linyuan. “He was there. He’s my witness.”","Jun Linshen glared at Feng Wu.","Jun Linyuan leaned back in the chair and gave Feng Wu a half-smile.."]},{"number":2365,"title":"Chapter 2365 - Jun Linyuan Is Amazing","paragraphs":["Jun Linyuan decided that if she wanted him to be her witness, she had to beg him.","And he made sure that Feng Wu saw it in his eyes.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She felt that Jun Linyuan was like a child asking for a reward.","She nodded at him, indicating that she would owe him one.","Only then did the crown prince nod at the crowd, admitting that he really had seen it.","That was all Feng Wu needed as her proof.","No matter how hard Jun Linshen stared at her, the crowd still believed the crown prince.","That was the ultimate proof.","Mrs. Dugu immediately paled.","Because she was the one who had concluded that Feng Wu’s schedule and the letter were written by the same person. If His Majesty really had written that schedule...","What about the letter?!","That would mean that His Majesty had written that as well!","That was just ridiculous!","Mrs. Dugu’s face went ghastly pale. She swayed and looked like she was about to faint.","Mrs. Zuo steadied her in time before she fell.","Mrs. Dugu gave her a pleading look.","But Mrs. Zuo was as flustered as she was.","They never expected that Feng Wu would do such a thing, let alone that the schedule had been written by the emperor. Moreover, the crown prince had arrived in time to prove it for Feng Wu.","“Calm down, calm down.” Mrs. Zuo was talking to both Mrs. Dugu and herself.","Old Mrs. Gu, Lady Gu, Lady Wang, Mrs. Dugu, and Mrs. Zuo were in it together. Jun Linshen had joined them as well. They hadn’t believed that Feng Wu would be able to talk her way out of this mess.","Feng Wu looked at each of the ladies in turn before fixing her gaze on Jun Linshen.","“My Prince, are you still so sure that I was the one who invited you here?”","On any normal day, Jun Linshen would have insisted that the letter was from Feng Wu. However, he hesitated under Jun Linyuan’s gaze.","He glanced at Jun Linyuan and smiled. “Even so, it can only prove that Mrs. Dugu made a mistake. It can’t prove that you never wrote the letter.”","Feng Wu suddenly chuckled. “I see that you really are very confident in yourself.”","She rolled her eyes at him. “Do you think you’re more handsome than His Royal Highness?”","Jun Linshen’s face went scarlet red, and he refused to answer.","Jun Linyuan stared at him. “Answer her.”","Jun Linshen was dumbfounded.","But seeing Jun Linyuan’s threatening gaze, he had to answer. “No, I’m not.”","Feng Wu nodded and asked, “What about your talent? Are you more talented than he is?”","Jun Linshen was dumbfounded.","This girl was asking him the most humiliating questions!","He refused to answer.","However, Jun Linyuan shifted in his chair and glanced at Jun Linshen again.","Jun Linshen took a deep breath and gritted his teeth. “No, I’m not.”","Feng Wu chuckled. “Do you think you’re more popular than him, then?”","Jun Linshen was speechless. No one could be more popular than Jun Linyuan!","Feng Wu chuckled again.. “Are you more influential than him?”"]},{"number":2366,"title":"Chapter 2366 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linshen stared at Feng Wu. Of course he couldn’t compare with the crown prince in terms of power.","So, he shook his head again.","Feng Wu glanced at him and said, “If you’re not as handsome, talented, powerful, or popular as Jun Linyuan, why —”","She asked sarcastically, “Why would I choose you over him?”","Boom!","Those words sounded like a thunderclap in everyone’s ears.","She was right.","The crown prince was better than Jun Linshen in every way. Feng Wu wasn’t stupid. Why would she choose Jun Linshen over the crown prince?","Jun Linshen’s face turned even redder.","He felt that he had been slapped over and over again in front of Jun Linyuan.","And Feng Wu didn’t stop there. She said sarcastically, “Even if I wanted to meet someone in the middle of the night, it would be His Royal Highness, and he would be the one I would drug as well. Who on earth do you think you are?”","Retch —","Jun Linshen was so angry that he spat out a mouthful of blood.","He was so angry.","Not all things were voiced. For instance, everybody knew that Jun Linshen wasn’t as good as Jun Linyuan, but no one would say it out loud, at least not in front of Jun Linshen.","But Feng Wu wasn’t just anyone.","She would never try to save face for other people.","She had never liked Jun Linshen, and after he tried to set her up, she would do her best to destroy him.","Therefore, she humiliated him in front of Jun Linyuan.","Tao Qingqing felt so sorry for Jun Linshen.","She was Jun Linshen’s fiancee now, so of course, she was on Jun Linshen’s side. She stepped out and shouted at Feng Wu, “That’s nonsense!”","Hearing that, Mrs. Zuo didn’t feel so full of despair anymore.","They all looked expectantly at Tao Qingqing, hoping that she could turn things around.","Tao Qingqing stared at Feng Wu and smirked. “I admit that you’re right to some extent. Prince Jun Linshen is inferior to His Royal Highness in many aspects, but I can say the same thing of just about every teenager!”","Everyone nodded. She was right. Jun Linyuan was like a god. No one could compare with him.","“No one is as amazing as His Royal Highness.”","“Making such a comparison would only humiliate them!”","“Miss Tao is right.”","...","Jun Linshen felt a little bit better when he heard that.","Tao Qingqing stared at Feng Wu and said, “But I don’t believe the rest of what you said.”","Feng Wu asked, “And why is that?”","Tao Qingqing said, “You said that you wouldn’t choose Prince Jun Linshen over the crown prince. Do you know what you’re suggesting? You’re telling us that the crown prince will choose you!”"]},{"number":2367,"title":"Chapter 2367 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Tao Qingqing looked from Feng Wu to the crown prince, and it was obvious that she wasn’t convinced.","Meanwhile, everyone was watching Feng Wu as well.","They were waiting for her reaction.","Even Jun Linyuan was looking at Feng Wu with his chin resting on his hand.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She felt that she had just dug her own grave.","Everyone was urging her with their eyes, asking her to prove that Jun Linyuan would accept her.","Feng Wu drew in a breath.","She decided to take a risk to prove her innocence.","She turned around and sat on Jun Linyuan’s lap. Before the others could react, she wrapped her arms around his neck.","Everyone was astonished.","They felt like they had been struck by lightning.","They couldn’t believe their eyes. How could this be happening?","OMG!","Wasn’t the crown prince supposed to be a neat freak and couldn’t stand it when women were within a meter of him?","Not only was Feng Wu sitting on the crown prince’s lap, she was also hugging him!","Please push her away!","Please!","All the ladies were staring at Jun Linyuan’s hands, hoping that he would push Feng Wu away.","But the crown prince...","His face remained expressionless, but there was a passionate look in his eyes when he spoke to Feng Wu.","“Are you using me now?” he whispered in her ear.","Feng Wu stiffened a little, but when she heard Jun Linyuan’s provoking tone, she decided that she wouldn’t give in.","She had been a secret agent in her previous life, and had learned all there was to know about seducing men.","She moved closer and breathed into his ear. “Yes, I’m using you. Do I have your consent?”","She was so close that Jun Linyuan stiffened. He still had that arrogant look on his face, but his earlobes had turned red.","It gave him a rather alluring look.","The two of them were so close that in other people’s eyes, they were already kissing.","Before the others could react, Feng Wu had risen to her feet again.","Although it lasted for just a few seconds, it was enough to shock everyone.","Feng Wu rested her hands on her waist and looked around the crowd. As expected, all her enemies looked utterly beaten.","She looked back and forth between Jun Linshen and Tao Qingqing, making them grit their teeth.","In the end, Feng Wu raised her chin and said to Tao Qingqing, “Are you convinced now?”","Tao Qingqing trembled in rage.","She was jealous as well!","Feng Wu gloated. “Now you know that His Royal Highness will pick me.”","Tao Qingqing glared at her.","Feng Wu jabbed a finger in Tao Qingqing’s chest repeatedly, making her stumble back.. “Why would I choose Jun Linshen when I already have His Royal Highness? If you have a brain, use it.”"]},{"number":2368,"title":"Chapter 2368 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu loved this feeling.","Tao Qingqing was speechless.","Feng Wu said, “You can have Jun Linshen all to yourself. He’s your treasure, not mine!”","Tao Qingqing was speechless.","She had never felt so humiliated.","Jun Linshen glared at Tao Qingqing. Had it not been for her, he wouldn’t have to endure Feng Wu’s humiliation for so long.","Mrs. Tao grabbed Tao Qingqing and apologized to Feng Wu.","She apologized for her rude daughter and said that she would discipline her when they went back home.","Feng Wu had never been the unreasonable type. She only targeted Tao Qingqing because the latter had targeted her.","Since Mrs. Tao had apologized and Tao Qingqing looked crestfallen after her defeat, Feng Wu decided to cut her loose.","She turned to Jun Linshen instead. “So, my prince, are you still insisting that I drugged you and tried to seduce you?”","Jun Linshen had thought that Feng Wu would be an easy target, but as it turned out, she was one of the toughest opponents he had ever met. By then, he had accepted his defeat. Hearing the question, he shook his head. “No, of course not. I’m sure it’s just a big misunderstanding.”","Feng Wu then turned to old Mrs. Gu. “So, can we rule out the possibility that I killed Mrs. Gu because she saw me having an affair with the prince?”","The crown prince followed her gaze and stared at old Mrs. Gu as well.","Despite her seeming calm, old Mrs. Gu was deeply shaken.","She had also thought that Feng Wu would be an easy target, but the girl had claws.","She wanted to get rid of the girl as soon as possible, so she smiled wryly and said, “That’s right. It was just a big misunderstanding. I’m sure that Miss Feng Wu had nothing to do with it.”","The old lady now wanted Feng Wu and the crown prince out of her sight!","However, Feng Wu wouldn’t leave.","She pulled over a chair and sat down next to Jun Linyuan. “I’m not going anywhere until I figure out what happened.”","Old Mrs. Gu wanted to throttle Feng Wu.","Why would this girl try to stir things up again when she was ready to drop the whole thing?","Just then, they heard a cold voice.","“No one is going anywhere until we figure out what happened!”","It was old Mrs. Long.","Next to her was a man. It was Long Yanyi, the master of Dragon Valley.","Mrs. Gu was his sister.","Old Mrs. Long only had a daughter and a son, and the siblings were close. Long Yanyi was here today not only to celebrate the old lady’s birthday, but also to see his little sister.","But he never imagined that it would be the last time he saw his sister alive.","Lady Gu’s stomach lurched, and she looked at old Mrs. Gu.","Things were getting out of hand.","If they failed to incriminate Feng Wu, and the Long family found out the truth, the Gu family were doomed!","Lady Gu stared at Feng Wu. “You shouldn’t be going anywhere. We haven’t ruled you out as the suspect yet!”","Feng Wu chuckled.. “Really? Enlighten me, then. What’s my motive?”"]},{"number":2369,"title":"Chapter 2369 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Gu snorted. “Your mother is your motive!”","Feng Wu’s mother was the legendary Lady Ling, who was said to be the most beautiful woman on the continent!","The beautiful lady was Feng Wu’s taboo, just like her beautiful master.","Therefore, Feng Wu was filled with rage when Lady Gu brought up her mother’s name in front of everyone.","Lady Gu knew that if Feng Wu remained alive, the Gu family would be doomed, so she had to destroy Feng Wu.","She glared at Feng Wu and said, “Lady Ling wants to marry Lord Gu!”","Wow —","Everyone gave Feng Wu strange looks.","Seriously?!","Lady Ling and Lord Gu... Really?","“If Lady Ling really is in love with Lord Gu, of course, the lord would want her. She’s so beautiful!","“But Lord Gu has a wife, so he can’t officially marry her.","“Since you’re ambitious enough to marry the crown prince, of course, you can’t stand the idea of your mother becoming a concubine.","“You planned the whole thing.","“You invited Prince Jun Linshen here and made sure that we thought we’d wronged you. After that, we wouldn’t suspect you again.","“But you’re the real killer, and His Royal Highness is on your side!”","Lady Gu then turned to Jun Linyuan. “Your Royal Highness, please open your eyes! She’s lying to you!”","Wow!","What Lady Gu said was so incredible that everyone was baffled.","It was too terrifying to be true.","Did Feng Wu really plan the whole thing?","Things had just taken another turn.","Everyone began to suspect Feng Wu again. They even doubted Jun Linyuan’s decision.","If the crown prince would protect such a girl, they wouldn’t respect him as much.","Lady Gu had made up such an elaborate story that she had convinced even herself.","Only then could she convince the others.","At the same time...","People in the palace were already told what had happened in the manor.","“What?” Emperor Wu had yet to digest the news that Feng Wu had defeated Jun Linshen, but now, the story had changed again.","Lady Ling and Lord Gu?","The empress dowager was furious when she heard that Jun Linyuan was protecting Feng Wu.","Ranmil was angry as well.","Empress Dugu was the most upset of them all.","Compared with Jun Linyuan, Jun Linshen was just a mediocre prince, but Empress Dugu wouldn’t accept the reality, and had been urging her son to compete with the crown prince.","But Feng Wu had humiliated Jun Linshen in front of so many people.","Jun Linshen had been forced to admit that he was inferior to Jun Linyuan, which would be such a blow to his confidence. It pained Empress Dugu to think about it.","She took Emperor Wu’s hand and wept. “Your Majesty, how could Feng Wu say such things to Linshen?”","Emperor Wu thought, “She’s telling the truth, isn’t she?”","However, he knew that it would only make Empress Dugu whine, so he nodded and said, “I’ll tell her off next time she’s here.”"]},{"number":2370,"title":"Chapter 2370 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu had already received news about what happened at Imperial College, and found the girl amazing.","She was as defiant as Jun Linyuan, but all geniuses had tempers.","Emperor Wu was very tolerant toward Feng Wu now, and treated her as he did Jun Linyuan. Deep down, he already considered her his daughter-in-law.","Therefore, he couldn’t stand it when Empress Dugu criticized Feng Wu.","But it just so happened that they were given the news about Lady Ling and Lord Gu.","Empress Dugu was so excited that she almost jumped to her feet.","“Your Majesty, did you hear that?!” She tugged at Emperor Wu’s sleeve. “That Lady Ling did such a despicable thing! I can just imagine what kind of daughter she brought up! They’re both the worst women! Poor Mrs. Gu...”","However, those words made Emperor Wu snap.","“Shut up!” he bellowed. “Lady Ling is the most graceful lady on this continent! She’s beyond any mortal man! She would never set her eyes on a man like Gu Guanjun!”","Emperor Wu was furious.","Of course he was.","Lady Ling was the most beautiful lady on this continent.","It was only natural that Emperor Wu fancied her.","She was like a goddess to him.","But all he dared to do was watch her from afar.","But now...","“D*mn you, Gu Guanjun! Even I can’t bring myself to do anything! How dare you harm her reputation?!”","To Emperor Wu, no woman was as precious as the lady.","Empress Dugu had no idea what Emperor Wu was thinking.","Little did she know that to Emperor Wu, the lady with the mind of a seven-year-old was more valuable than anything.","Empress Dugu went on complaining. “Your Majesty, Feng Wu’s father disappeared when she was little and is probably dead by now. Having lived by herself for so many years, Lady Ling must be lonely, so she seduced Lord Gu...”","“Shut up!” Emperor Wu was furious and bellowed at Empress Dugu. “Did you see it with your own eyes?!”","Baffled, Empress Dugu tried to explain, “I... I mean if...”","Emperor Wu was infuriated. “As a woman, you should know how important a woman’s reputation is, but you’re helping those people spread rumors! I must have been blind when I made you empress!”","That was a very serious thing to say.","Was he going to remove her title as empress?!","Empress Dugu was scared out of her wits. She dropped to her knees and burst into tears. “Your Majesty, I didn’t know what I was talking about... Please forgive me...”","In fact, she didn’t know what she had done wrong. She had criticized other people in front of Emperor Wu before, but he had never lost his temper like this.","Consort Ranmil, on the other hand, understood what it was about.","Because of that, she clenched her fists and couldn’t believe her eyes.","The empress dowager spoke at that moment. “Your Majesty, you’re scaring the empress.”","Emperor Wu kicked Empress Dugu away and headed for the door.","The empress dowager asked, “Your Majesty, where are you going?”","Emperor Wu said angrily, “Gu manor!”"]},{"number":2371,"title":"Chapter 2371 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Gu had begun to make up stories. “Do you think that Lady Ling is a chaste woman? That’s just a mask she wears! In fact...”","Feng Wu would never allow anyone to slander her mother like that.","She stepped out and raised her hand.","Smack!","She slapped Lady Gu hard in the face.","Lady Gu stared at her in disbelief, and so did everyone else.","They had never expected Feng Wu to hit a senior member of the family.","“Feng Wu, you —”","Before Lady Gu could protest, Feng Wu slapped her again.","She used so much force that Lady Gu flew backward.","The crowd was astonished. That was such a bold move.","Some of them wanted to protest, but they gave up the idea when they saw the crown prince’s face.","Instead of shutting up, Lady Gu shouted even louder, as if she had lost her mind.","“You’re angry because I’m telling the truth!” She stared at Feng Wu and guffawed. “I’ll tell everyone even if you kill me!”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","She was about to speak, when there were quick footsteps outside.","“His Majesty has arrived.","“Her Majesty the Empress has arrived.”","WHAT?!","Everyone was astonished!","Old Mrs. Gu and Lord Gu looked at each other in surprise.","His Majesty?","How could this be?","They would already consider it a great blessing if Empress Dugu sent them a gift for the old lady’s birthday, let alone have the empress here in person.","But now, even the emperor was here.","What was going on?","Mrs. Zuo held old Mrs. Gu’s hand and said excitedly, “Empress Dugu must be here for Prince Jun Linshen!”","If the empress was here to support Jun Linshen, then they would be able to stick to their lies.","Mrs. Zuo then whispered, “His Majesty and His Royal Highness don’t really get along well.”","Old Mrs. Gu was reassured.","They had been losing ground because Jun Linyuan supported Feng Wu.","Now that His Majesty was here, the crown prince had to give way. At that thought, old Mrs. Gu and Lord Gu grew excited.","Everyone knelt down to greet the emperor and the empress.","Emperor Wu was obviously angry when he walked in, and the entire crowd could feel it.","“Your Majesty —”","Everyone greeted him.","Wherever the emperor went, the air felt thin. Even the temperature seemed to drop.","He sat down in the host seat and glanced at the crowd.","Jun Linshen was very excited.","He thought that his parents were here to support him because Jun Linyuan had crossed the line.","At that thought, he jumped at Emperor Wu and said, “Father, I didn’t do it!”"]},{"number":2372,"title":"Chapter 2372 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linshen wrapped his arms around Emperor Wu’s leg and shouted, “Your Majesty, I didn’t do it!”","Feng Wu frowned at Emperor Wu.","She remembered Emperor Wu as a biased father who would always take Jun Linshen’s side. Was he going to do it again?","Emperor Wu cast a stern look at Feng Wu and thought, “Aren’t you a fierce girl? They’re humiliating your mother now! Do something!","“Don’t just sit around!”","Seeing that look, Feng Wu rubbed her nose and wondered what the emperor was up to this time.","Emperor Wu had no idea that Feng Wu was mistaken about his attitude. He looked around and said, “Someone, tell me what’s going on here.”","No one responded.","Lady Gu suddenly had an idea.","She decided that she should grab this opportunity and make the first move.","At that thought, she stepped out and said loudly, “Your Majesty, Lady Ling is the one who started the whole thing! Your Majesty probably doesn’t know who that is...”","Both Emperor Wu and Empress Dugu gave her a strange look. How could they not know who she was?","Lady Gu spoke very fast when she was nervous. “Lady Ling seduced Lord Gu, my brother! Feng Wu wants her mother to become the official wife, so she killed Mrs. Gu!”","Emperor Wu gritted his teeth. “Did you say that Lady Ling seduced Gu Guanjun?”","Lady Gu was a little taken aback because she realized that something was off.","The highlight of her analysis was the part where Feng Wu killed Mrs. Gu, but His Majesty only cared about the petty details, which puzzled Lady Gu.","But she didn’t have much time to think, so she nodded. “Yes! Lady Ling seduced Lord Gu!”","Emperor Wu gave Feng Wu a cold glance.","He wondered why Feng Wu was still standing there when that woman was slandering her mother.","Lady Gu cried and said, “Your Majesty, I’m telling the truth, but Feng Wu hit me. Please do something...”","Emperor Wu was satisfied when he saw the bruises on her face and her handless arm.","Lady Gu would probably pass out if she knew what Emperor Wu was thinking.","“Feng Wu, do you have anything to say?” Emperor Wu asked in a neutral tone.","Feng Wu replied by slapping Lady Gu again. “I see that you haven’t learned your lesson. Are you having fun making up stories? I’ll slap you once for every lie you tell!”","She was dauntless!","Everyone looked at her in disbelief.","How dare she?","How could she do that in front of the emperor?","Lady Gu cried as she ran away from Feng Wu. “Your Majesty, Feng Wu is angry because I’m right!”","Seeing that Emperor Wu wouldn’t say anything, Lady Gu screamed at Feng Wu, “How dare you hit me in front of His Majesty? You have no respect for His Majesty at all!”"]},{"number":2373,"title":"Chapter 2373 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu smirked. She then took out the Fire Dragon Rod and struck out at Lady Gu. “Go on shouting, I dare you!”","Most people wouldn’t be able to withstand such force.","Feng Wu aimed at Lady Gu’s forehead.","Luckily for Lady Gu, she evaded in time.","The rod landed on her shoulder instead.","Lady Gu cried out in pain.","The crowd sucked in their breaths. That thump sounded so painful.","However, His Majesty didn’t stop Feng Wu.","Was His Majesty on Feng Wu’s side?","Old Mrs. Gu was furious.","Lord Gu narrowed his eyes.","However, the Long family reacted first.","Long Yanyi stopped the rod and glared at Feng Wu.","“Stop.”","He was the current head of the Long family. Around him, the temperature seemed to drop.","All eyes fell on him.","Emperor Wu watched this with a brooding look in his eyes.","Jun Linyuan sat on his right and Empress Dugu on his left.","Jun Linyuan was watching Feng Wu, and Empress Dugu was watching Emperor Wu.","Empress Dugu had hoped that she had guessed wrong, but when she saw Emperor Wu give Feng Wu tacit consent to beat up Lady Gu, she knew that she couldn’t lie to herself anymore.","Emperor Wu had feelings for Lady Ling. Empress Dugu was both jealous and nervous at that discovery.","Long Yanyi didn’t know any of this. He just kept staring at Feng Wu.","“Did you kill my sister?” he asked.","Feng Wu shook her head. “No.”","Long Yanyi asked, “Then how did she die?”","Feng Wu gave him a strange look and smiled a little. “I’m afraid you’ll have to ask Lord Gu.”","Long Yanyi narrowed his eyes. “What do you mean?”","He didn’t have the patience for this.","Then there was a sound.","Someone sighed.","The crowd turned around and saw that Lord Gu had stepped forward.","All eyes were on him.","Mrs. Gu was his wife, and the whole thing started because of his so-called relationship with Lady Ling. They were waiting for him to tell the truth.","Now that he had stepped out, he was probably going to tell them what they wanted to hear.","Everyone looked at him in expectation.","Lord Gu walked up to Long Yanyi and lowered his head. “I do have to take responsibility for my wife’s death. Master Long, you can do whatever you want with me.”","Long Yanyi clenched his fists.","Lord Gu said, “Lady Ling has feelings for me, but I would never betray my wife, so I only promised her that she could become my concubine. However, I didn’t know that she would...”"]},{"number":2374,"title":"Chapter 2374 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lord Gu gave Feng Wu an odd look.","The emotion it contained was a mixture of rage, hatred, and resignation.","In the end, he took a deep breath and sighed. He sounded very sorry when he spoke to Long Yanyi. “You can take revenge however you like. The Gu family will take full responsibility.”","Ssss —","Everyone drew in their breaths when they heard that.","Although Lord Gu didn’t name the killer, the look he gave Feng Wu revealed the “truth.”","So, did Feng Wu really kill Mrs. Gu for her mother?","Emperor Wu was furious, and the temperature seemed to drop again.","There was a murderous look in his eyes.","Gu Guanjuan’s stomach lurched.","Why...","Empress Dugu gloated at Gu Guanjuan’s predicament.","Long Yanyi gritted his teeth and asked, “So, you’re saying that this girl killed my sister!”","Gu Guanjun sounded pained when he said, “She’s too young to understand what she has done. I’m the reason why this happened! I’ll take full responsibility!”","The crowd was moved by what he said.","Some of them had been doubtful before, thinking that even if Feng Wu was the killer, Lord Gu had to have something to do with it as well. However, they admired Lord Gu after hearing what he said.","Feng Wu looked at Gu Guanjuan and found him to be the most cunning man.","“Are you going to take responsibility?” Feng Wu smiled at him. “Since you’re the murderer, Lord Gu, you should pay with your life.”","The others were all baffled.","Why did she say that?","After everything that had happened, how could she still sound so confident?","Gu Guanjuan was perplexed.","He didn’t expect to hear such words from Feng Wu either.","He looked at her and sighed in disappointment. “You’re too proud. If you can do such a thing at your age, what will you become when you grow up? I was going to protect you because of your promising future, but since you won’t repent, you’re on your own. Feng Wu, admit your crime.”","Long Yanyi reached for Feng Wu’s neck.","He was going to execute her!","As soon as he raised his hand, the crown prince’s eyes glinted coldly.","Thump!","Long Yanyi stumbled back, and the ground under Jun Linyuan’s chair cracked as well.","He glared at Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan was in the younger generation, and Long Yanyi was his senior. Normally, a teenager would never be the match of a middle-aged man.","Moreover, Long Yanyi was the master of Dragon Valley and a talented cultivator. However, after exchanging one blow, he realized that he wasn’t Jun Linyuan’s match!"]},{"number":2375,"title":"Chapter 2375 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Not only wasn’t he Jun Linyuan’s match, he also couldn’t tell what Jun Linyuan’s level was, and that was the scariest part.","If Jun Linyuan could defeat someone of Long Yanyi’s generation, did that mean that he was as powerful as the elders?","By “elders,” Long Yanyi was referring to someone of his father’s generation.","Long Yanyi was amazed by how talented Jun Linyuan was.","However, as the master of Dragon Valley, he would never admit defeat.","Even if he had to lose, he would make sure that he fought to the last moment.","He was about to strike again, when Feng Wu suddenly said, “Are you still going to lie there and do nothing?”","What?","Who was she talking to?","The crowd was baffled when they saw that she was talking to Mrs. Gu, who was supposed to be dead.","Feng Wu sounded like she was talking to a living person. “Are you going to let Dragon Valley be destroyed from seeking revenge on the wrong person?”","Ssss —","Her tone gave the others the creeps.","Was she talking to a ghost now?","“Gu Guanjun, you b*stard!”","There was a scream.","Meanwhile, Mrs. Gu, who had been lying there with a handkerchief on her face, suddenly sat up.","“Holy crap!”","“OMG!”","“Damn!”","“A ghost!”","...","Nearly everyone stumbled back involuntarily, and some people almost fell off the stairs.","It was so scary!","Mrs. Gu ripped off the white cloth, revealing her pale but furious face.","She scrambled to her feet, ran up to Gu Guanjun, and slapped him.","Smack!","Lord Gu turned ghastly pale.","The crowd was astonished.","“Is she a ghost now?”","“Look! There’s her shadow on the floor! I heard that ghosts don’t have shadows!”","“That is to say, Mrs. Gu came back to life? Or was she alive this whole time?”","“But why is she hitting Lord Gu?”","...","“Good question.” Feng Wu clapped. “Didn’t Lord Gu call me a killer? Why is the victim coming after him now?”","Gu Guanjuan stiffened when he heard the question.","Everyone looked at Lord Gu. Although they didn’t say anything, they already had doubts.","Mrs. Gu shook from head to toe in rage. She looked like she was about to burn down the entire manor.","Ever since she woke up, Gu Guanjun was all she could see. The others had all fallen into the background.","Gu Guanjun finally realized what was going on. His pupils contracted, and he was ready to kill her.","He knew that he couldn’t let Mrs. Gu say another word.","However, the crown prince turned his cold gaze on him, and after a brief moment, Gu Guanjuan could neither move nor speak.","He could only watch as Mrs.. Gu shouted at him."]},{"number":2376,"title":"Chapter 2376 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then, Mrs. Gu shouted at Gu Guanjun.","“Gu Guanjun, you b*stard! If this hadn’t happened, I would never have known that you wanted to kill me! My husband tried to kill me!!!”","Rumble!?","Those words were like a thunderclap in everyone’s ears.","WHAT?!","Gosh!","OMG!","...","Apart from old Mrs. Gu and Lady Gu, who knew the truth, the others all paled when they heard this.","Gu Guanjun was the real killer!","How was that even possible?!","Gu Guanjun’s face had gone ghastly pale, and his mind was blank. She had exposed him. What should he do now?","But he didn’t lose his composure. In an instant, he regained his poise and spoke in a slightly agitated voice. “My lady, you’re awake! Is your head injured? I shouldn’t have argued with you. It’s all my fault...”","He tried to take Mrs. Gu’s hand, but she smacked his hand away.","However, he grabbed her hands and wrapped his arm around her waist.","Mrs. Gu couldn’t break free from his grip.","Feng Wu smiled at her.","“Lord Gu, are you trying to cover up your crime by saying that the two of you had an argument and that she injured her head?” Feng Wu then glanced at Long Yanyi. “Master Long, aren’t you looking for the killer? I think Mrs. Gu has the answer.”","Long Yanyi grabbed Lord Gu’s hand.","Lord Gu sensed a streak of energy coming from the tips of Long Yanyi’s fingers.","He didn’t want to let go of Mrs. Gu, so he stared at Long Yanyi and tightened his grip.","He knew that if he let go of his wife, she would tell the whole truth.","But the fact that he wouldn’t let go of Mrs. Gu convinced Long Yanyi that he was the killer.","“Let go!” Lord Gu immediately attacked Lord Gu.","Taken by surprise, Lord Gu stumbled back.","“Brother!” Seeing Long Yanyi, Mrs. Gu finally felt that she was safe. She burst into tears and shouted, “Brother! He wanted to kill me!”","That was the second time she said that.","“Sweetheart, what happened?” Old Mrs. Long wrapped her arms around Mrs. Gu and said, “Didn’t Feng Wu attack you here?”","Mrs. Gu shook her head. “No! That’s not what happened! He attacked me in Moon Pavilion, not here!”","Wow —","All eyes were on her.","Moon Pavilion?","“So, that was the crime scene, was it?” Feng Wu asked Mrs. Gu.","Mrs. Gu said, “It all happened in Moon Pavilion!”","Mrs. Gu pointed at Lord Gu. “He pushed me, and I hit my head on the corner of the table! I wanted to get away from him, but he...","“He grabbed my hair and stabbed me! He wanted me dead!” Mrs.. Gu burst into tears. “I wanted to know why, and he said...”"]},{"number":2377,"title":"Chapter 2377 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“That’s bullsh*t!” Lord Gu glared at Mrs. Gu. “You don’t know what you’re talking about!”","Mrs. Gu smiled sadly. “I asked you why you wanted to kill me, and what did you say? You said that you never wanted to marry me, and that Dragon Valley forced you! Gu Guanjun, do you even have a heart?! You fainted outside Dragon Valley, covered in blood! You were running away from those people, and I saved you!”","All eyes were on Lord Gu, whose face was very dark. He looked like he wanted to cut Mrs. Gu into tiny pieces.","Mrs. Gu said, “You courted me after I saved you, saying that I was the only woman you wanted to marry! I only learned much later that your family messed with the wrong people, and they were trying to kill you! Dragon Valley got you out of trouble in the end, otherwise, the entire Gu family would have been wiped out by now! Dragon Valley is the only reason you’ve been able to live peacefully for so many years!","“I only knew how much debt your family was in after I married you, and I’ve been supporting your family with my dowry ever since! Nearly all of it is gone!”","What?! The Long family glared at Gu Guanjun.","Mrs. Gu went on, “I treated your parents like my own ever since I married you. I gave you many children, and I doted on your sister! Have I ever done anything wrong? You live under Dragon Valley’s protection and have used Dragon Valley’s money, but in the end, you tried to kill me!”","Such accusations!","It made people want to cry.","Lord Gu wanted to retort but didn’t know what to say.","Seeing this, Lady Gu was anxious. She had to do something...","“Sister-in-law, you’re awake! I was so worried!” Lady Gu wanted to find an opportunity to knock Mrs. Gu out, when Mrs. Gu grabbed her arm.","The lady said, “Gu Yunyan, have I ever done anything to you?!”","Lady Gu said, “No, of course not.”","Mrs. Gu said, “If that’s the case, why did you help your brother to kill me?!”","What? Lady Gu was in it, too?!","Everyone stared at Lady Gu.","Lady Gu said, “I...”","Mrs. Gu stepped forward and said, “Do you still remember what you told Gu Guanjun in that room when you thought that I was dead?”","Lady Gu already had a guilty conscience. Hearing those words, she stumbled back and fell to the floor. Her face was ghastly pale, and her fingers trembled.","“What did you say? ‘Brother, don’t worry. I tricked Lady Ling into signing that contract, like you said. Lady Ling is so stupid. She can’t even read. She thought it was an apology letter.’”","“Shut up!” Lady Gu panicked.","The others were dumbfounded when they heard those words.","What? Lady Ling had been tricked into signing the contract?"]},{"number":2378,"title":"Chapter 2378 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t let Lady Gu get in the way.","She took off Lady Gu’s shoes and stuffed them into her mouth, and hit a few of her vital points. That way, Lady Gu couldn’t move a muscle.","Mrs. Gu glared at Lady Gu and went on exposing her.","“And what did you say? ‘Feng Wu won’t be a problem. So what if she tries to speak up for her mother? We have the marriage contract, and Lady Ling can’t change that. If all else fails, we can wait until Feng Wu starts Year 4. She’ll have to live on campus, and we can bring Lady Ling back home.’","“You also said, ‘My sister-in-law is a beauty, but she has the mind of a seven-year-old. She’ll believe everything we tell her. Once you have her, she’ll have to accept the reality. What can Feng Wu do?'”","Mrs. Gu pointed at Lady Gu and shouted, “What did you tell me before that? You said that Lady Ling seduced my husband and wouldn’t let him go! The truth is, she won’t even look at Gu Guanjun!”","“Shut up!” Lord Gu wanted to stop his wife, but...","He couldn’t even lift a finger.","He struggled violently, but the restraints around him felt like iron, and he couldn’t move a finger.","Who did it?","Who was restraining him?","Lord Gu raised his eyes and met a pair of brooding eyes. His heart sank.","The crown prince...","It was the crown prince...","Lady Gu wasn’t as calm as Lord Gu was. When Mrs. Gu pointed at her, she scrambled away from her in fear.","Everyone looked from Mrs. Gu to Feng Wu.","It seemed that they had all been misled. Feng Wu was never the killer!","She had been framed!","“I must have been blind! How could I marry an evil man like you?!” Mrs. Gu was exhausted after she shouted those words. She then fainted and fell to the floor.","Long Yanyi and old Mrs. Long picked her up and burst into tears. Why did this happen to their sister and daughter?!","Old Mrs. Gu’s heart sank.","She had wanted to pretend to faint, but Mrs. Gu beat her to it.","Luckily for her, now that Mrs. Gu was unconscious, she could start talking.","She gave Lord Gu a warning glance.","Lord Gu wanted to say something, but he couldn’t make a sound.","Left with no other choice, old Mrs. Gu stepped out and held old Mrs. Long’s hands. “I think my daughter-in-law must have injured her head because someone drugged her. That’s why she came up with such an outrageous story. If you believe her, you’ll only fall into the culprit’s trap.”","Old Mrs. Long hesitated.","Her daughter had indeed been behaving strangely. Was it possible...","Feng Wu smiled and told old Mrs. Long, “When I discovered Mrs. Gu, she wasn’t breathing anymore. I used some acupuncture needles to revive her.”","Seeing that old Mrs. Long still didn’t look fully convinced, Feng Wu frowned. “Mrs. Gu mentioned Moon Pavilion just then. That is to say, Moon Pavilion is the crime scene, right?”","“That’s right!” Emperor Wu rose to his feet. “I think we should take a look.”","Lord Gu panicked.","Moon Pavilion was indeed where the attack had taken place. He had thought that Mrs. Gu was dead, so he hadn’t cleaned up the place.. The others would easily find out what happened there."]},{"number":2379,"title":"Chapter 2379 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lord Gu kept giving his steward warning glances.","The steward, who was standing behind the crowd, took the hint and promptly left.","Emperor Wu frowned a little and glanced at Qin Yan.","He trusted the man.","The Qin family had two sons, Qin Mo and Qin Yan.","Qin Mo was the head of military intelligence and worked in the shadows.","Qin Yan was Emperor Wu’s personal guard and the most senior of the imperial guards.","He nodded at Emperor Wu and quickly left.","Hardly anyone noticed that Qin Yan was gone, so Lord Gu thought that he might still have a chance.","When he arrived at Moon Pavilion, he saw something unexpected.","Qin Yan was holding Steward Gu down with his foot, and oil was splashed everywhere around them.","He stepped hard, and Steward Gu screeched in pain.","Seeing this, Lord Gu was filled with despair.","“What’s going on?” Emperor Wu frowned.","Qin Yan said, “Your Majesty, I came here to examine Moon Pavilion, but this sneaky old man was pouring oil all over the building. He wanted to burn the place down.”","“How dare he?!” Emperor Wu was furious. He turned around and stared at Gu Guanjun. “Are you trying to fool me?!”","Gu Guanjun’s face had lost all color, and he shook from head to toe.","Emperor Wu told Qin Yan, “Check the room!”","Qin Yan said, “Yes, Your Majesty.”","Qin Yan led some men into Moon Pavilion and soon came back to report to Emperor Wu. “Your Majesty, a table inside has been knocked over. The blood splatter fits Mrs. Gu’s recount. Moon Pavilion is indeed the crime scene.”","Those words signed Lord Gu’s death warrant.","All eyes were on him.","His children stared at him in disbelief.","“Why is this happening?! I can’t believe it!”","“What’s going on? What’s happening to our family?!”","“I don’t believe you...”","None of them could accept what had happened. It was horrible.","The looks the others gave them were even more complicated.","At first, everyone believed that Feng Wu was the killer, but it turned out that she had been wronged, and Lord Gu was the real culprit...","Lord Gu looked at each child in turn before glaring at Feng Wu.","Suddenly, he smiled bitterly.","He laughed like a mad person. “I never thought that I would be defeated by a girl!”","He looked from Jun Linshen to the ladies, before turning his gaze on Feng Wu. “You won!”","After that, his hand shifted in his sleeve.","Poof!","Jun Linyuan knocked the dagger out of his hand.","He wouldn’t let Lord Gu die so easily!","Then something unexpected happened.","“My lady!” Mrs. Zuo shouted.","Everyone was shocked when they saw a dagger in the old lady’s chest, and she herself was holding the handle.","That was to say..."]},{"number":2380,"title":"Chapter 2380 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Old Mrs. Gu had committed suicide!","Gosh!","Everyone sucked in their breaths.","Old Mrs. Gu pushed away from the people who tried to help her. She looked at Emperor Wu and knelt down.","Both old Mrs. Long and Long Yanyi frowned.","Blood was oozing out of old Mrs. Gu’s mouth.","She suddenly turned to Feng Wu and said, “I’ll take full responsibility for everything that happened. Please forgive the Gu family...”","She dropped to the ground and died.","“Grandma!” the Gu brothers cried out.","Feng Wu’s face darkened.","What a sinister woman. She still tried to get back at Feng Wu even after her death.","Feng Wu had already cleared her and her mother’s reputations. The grudge was between the Gu and Long families now.","However, with what the old lady had done, all the members of the Gu family would always see Feng Wu as the person who had humiliated their family and killed their grandmother!","Feng Wu!","Feng Wu smirked. The Gu family was trying to make the Feng family their target because they couldn’t handle the Long family. How naive.","“Feng Wu! I’m gonna kill you!”","Four of the six brothers charged at Feng Wu together.","Mrs. Zuo shook her head. Those stupid boys had no idea what Feng Wu’s level was.","She reminded them, “I think you should take care of your grandmother’s funeral first.”","They shouldn’t just leave the dead body on the ground.","Gu Xingcheng snorted. “Are you on Feng Wu’s side as well?!”","Mrs. Zuo was speechless.","Where did that come from? She wanted Feng Wu dead more than anything in this world!","All four of them had been defeated by Feng Wu before, but they felt that if they fought her together, they could surely turn things around.","Feng Wu smirked. These men didn’t intimidate her!","She took out her Fire Dragon Rod.","Bring it on!","She had been waiting for a fight!","Many people were concerned.","“Isn’t Feng Wu a Level 7 Spiritual Elder? She’ll be killed!”","“The Gu brothers are all very talented!”","“No, she’s not! She’s at least a Level 3 Spiritual Lord!”","“Then it’s going to be a fierce battle!”","...","Emperor Wu was speechless.","Xiao Wu was a Level 7 Spiritual Lord! Those boys would never be her match!","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Feng Wu knocked the boys on their heads.","Emperor Wu was right. Those boys weren’t her match at all.","Thump!","Before the four teenagers could react, they were already rolling around on the ground and howling in pain.","Many people were shocked.","Feng Wu was incredible!","Feng Wu then slammed the rod down on the ground and snorted. “Anyone else?”","The crowd was speechless."]},{"number":2381,"title":"Chapter 2381 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Zuo wanted to leave. She didn’t want to see Feng Wu showing off her talent.","Finally, the others knew how capable Feng Wu was.","“Shit!”","“She’s so talented!”","“If I remember correctly, Gu Xingyuan is the most talented of the four. He’s at least a Level 3 Spiritual Lord.”","“Feng Wu defeated all of them on her own!”","“Feng Wu is at least a Level 4 Spiritual Lord, isn’t she?”","“Maybe she’s a little bit more advanced than that.”","“Are you saying that she’s a Level 5 Spiritual Lord?! OMG! How old is she?!”","“She’s barely fourteen!”","“Gosh! She really is a genius!”","“Compared to her, the Gu brothers are nothing!”","“So what? That doesn’t change the fact that she’s both arrogant and mean!”","Everyone was talking at the same time.","Emperor Wu almost rolled his eyes.","“A Level 4 Spiritual Lord?”","“Are they blind?!”","“Xiao Wu is a Level 7 Spiritual Lord!”","Even Emperor Wu didn’t notice that he felt like a proud father when other people praised Feng Wu.","“I’ll fight her.”","With a cold voice, a teenager dressed in white landed in front of Feng Wu.","He frowned and looked at her in disdain.","“Brother Xingyi!”","The Gu brothers cried out in excitement when they saw their second brother.","“She hit us!”","“She killed Grandma!”","“She humiliated us! You have to avenge us!”","All four boys looked at Gu Xingyi in expectation.","“That’s Gu Xingyi!” someone cried out.","“So what?”","“Do you not know who that is? He’s a Year 4 student at Imperial College. When he was in Year 3, he formed a five-man team and fought the team from Martial Art College. It was a brilliant battle, and he’s been famous ever since!”","“All five men skipped Year 3 and entered Year 4 after that, right? I heard that they’re all good friends.”","“That’s right. And the most talented of the five is...”","“Gu Xingyi was a Level 4 Spiritual Lord back then. I wonder...”","“He’s a Level 6 Spiritual Lord now,” said someone.","“Gosh! What will Feng Wu do?!”","Emperor Wu wanted to yawn.","“So what if he’s a Level 6 Spiritual Lord? Xiao Wu is already a Level 7 Spiritual Lord! How boring!” thought Emperor Wu.","However, only a handful of people knew Feng Wu’s true capability. Most people thought that she wasn’t Gu Xingyi’s match.","Even Gu Xingyi himself thought so.","He narrowed his eyes before turning to Emperor Wu. He bowed and said, “Your Majesty, will you be my witness?”","Emperor Wu asked, “Of what?”"]},{"number":2382,"title":"Chapter 2382 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Xingyi gritted his teeth and said, “Feng Wu humiliated my family, so I’m challenging her to a duel! It’ll be a fight to the death! Your Majesty, will you be my witness?”","Wow —","The crowd grew excited.","A fight to the death?","It had been a while since they had one of those!","Mrs. Zuo found Gu XIngyi’s request idiotic.","Feng Wu is a Level 7 Spiritual Lord, and you’re only Level 6. You’re doomed.","She tried to warn him. “Gu Xingyi, maybe you don’t have to...”","“Thank you, Mrs. Zuo, but if you try to stop me, I’ll think that you’re on Feng Wu’s side,” said Gu Xingyi coldly.","Mrs. Zuo was shocked.","What a fool! She decided to let him be. If he was killed, Feng Wu would be responsible for two deaths in the Gu family, which would be good news for the Zuo family.","After that, no one else tried to stop Gu Xingyi.","Emperor Wu frowned at him. “Do you really want to die?”","Gu Xingyi asked, “Your Majesty, do you have no faith in me at all?”","Emperor Wu thought, “That’s right.”","Seeing that Gu Xingyi was displeased, Emperor Wu said, “Fine. You can have the fight if Feng Wu agrees to it.”","Gu Xingyi finally turned his gaze on Feng Wu. “I’m challenging you to a fight to the death. Will you accept my challenge?”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","She could say no.","After all, he had already earned his fame, and few people had confidence in her. She could turn him down.","Feng Wu said coldly, “You should cherish your life.”","Gu Xingyi said, “I don’t cherish yours.”","Feng Wu shrugged. “So...”","Everyone thought that Feng Wu would be forced to accept the challenge, but they were all wrong.","She smiled and said, “I don’t accept your challenge.”","Gu Xingyi glared at her. “Why?!”","Feng Wu said, “It’s a waste of time.”","Gu Xingyi said, “You —”","Just then, someone cried out in the crowd. “Assassins! Protect His Majesty!”","Emperor Wu looked at Qin Yan.","Qin Yan followed the sound and saw a team of people coming toward them.","The team was led by Feng Xun.","“Feng Xun?” Emperor Wu was perplexed.","“Your Majesty, there are some assassins!” Feng Xun whispered in Emperor Wu’s ear.","“Are you sure?” Emperor Wu’s eyes lit up. He then told Qin Yan, “Go with Feng Xun! Catch the assassins!”","Qin Yan nodded and left with Feng Xun.","Emperor Wu then turned to the crowd and looked at each person in turn.","The temperature seemed to drop, and the air grew chilly.","What was going on...","Everyone was perplexed, especially the members of the Gu family. They realized that the emperor was looking at them in rage.","Rage?","What did Feng Xun tell the emperor?"]},{"number":2383,"title":"Chapter 2383 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","There was no warmth in Emperor Wu’s eyes.","After a short while, they could hear the sound of fighting in the distance.","Gu Xingyuan went pale when he heard the noise.","“Gu Xingyuan, why are you shaking?” Emperor Wu asked in an unperturbed tone.","But his voice only made Gu Xingyuan more anxious.","“I... I’m not shaking...” Gu Xingyuan took a deep breath, forcing himself to calm down.","“That’s a very brave thing to say for someone who’s abetting a foreign spy,” Emperor Wu said casually.","What?!","If old Mrs. Gu had been alive, she would have jumped to her feet.","Abetting an enemy spy?","That was a serious accusation!","It was a crime punishable by death and could incriminate one’s entire clan!","Gu Xingyuan felt that his heart was going to jump out of his throat. He forced himself to calm down as he knelt in front of Emperor Wu. “Your Majesty, I never did such a thing. There’s no spy of the Dongsang Kingdom in my household! Someone must be framing me!”","The other members of the Gu family all gave him strange looks, but Gu Xingyuan didn’t realize what he had said.","“How do you know that I’m talking about a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom? Why can’t they be from somewhere else?” Emperor Wu asked indifferently.","Gu Xingyuan almost blurted out the truth, but he reacted quickly and said, “Your Majesty has been searching the whole city for Dongsang spies, and I still remember it. That’s why I automatically assumed it was a Dongsang spy...”","That could explain his reply. It was just that...","“So, how did you learn that I’m searching for Dongsang spies?”","Gu Xingyuan was so frightened that his voice trembled. “I... I...”","Emperor Wu smacked the table. “You knew I was looking for them, but you still hid one. That’s unforgivable!”","Gu Xingyuan paled. “Your Majesty, I’m not...”","Qin Yan and Feng Xun came back at that moment.","They brought someone with them.","Qin Yan threw the person, who was tied up, on the ground and said, “She tried to fight back, and when we caught her, she tried to kill herself.”","Emperor Wu stared at the woman on the ground.","She was just over twenty and had the most alluring eyes. The outer corners of her eyes slanted upward slightly, giving her the look of a fox.","“Is she a Dongsang Kingdom spy?” Emperor Wu asked with a frown.","“Your Majesty, please don’t tease me. I’m a native of the Junwu Empire. How can I be from the Dongsang Kingdom, let alone their spy?” The woman giggled.","Gu Xingyuan said, “Your Majesty, this is Miss Qingyang, a dancer at Spring Aroma. She’s no spy!”","Many other people chimed in.","“That’s right. Miss Qingyang is a dancer at Spring Aroma. I’ve met her before.”","“She grew up there, and that’s a fact. How can she be a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom?”","They all tried to defend her because they had all visited Spring Aroma.","If Qingyang was proven to be a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom, they might all become suspects.","Emperor Wu looked at Feng Xun."]},{"number":2384,"title":"Chapter 2384 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu looked at Feng Xun in bewilderment.","He had seen the list of the names of Dongsang spies, but Qingyang wasn’t on it.","Feng Xun glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded.","With Feng Wu’s reassurance, Feng Xun was full of confidence.","If she said yes, it had to be true.","Qingyang smiled at Feng Xun and said, “Young Lord Feng, I’m only here because Young Master Gu Xingyuan invited me here to dance for the old lady for her birthday. How did I become a spy? Young Lord Feng, if you can accuse me of being a spy, will you do the same to other people?”","Feng Xun frowned.","“Your Majesty!” The Gu family reacted quickly.","Lord Gu was going to use this opportunity.","He might be able to get away with the attempted murder, but espionage was too serious an accusation for the Gu family to bear. He immediately said, “Your Majesty, Young Lord Feng must have made this up because he’s trying to avenge Feng Wu!”","Emperor Wu glanced at Feng Wu.","If she couldn’t prove that Qingyang was...","But at that moment, a shadow moved toward Qingyang.","It was aimed at her throat.","At that critical moment, Qingyang shifted, but she soon realized what she was doing.","Sh*t!","She was supposed to be the most popular escort of Spring Aroma and shouldn’t have any cultivation skills, but just then, she activated them a little...","Qingyang immediately stood still and hoped that no one had noticed.","But what she didn’t know was —","A small magic vine rose out of Feng Wu’s palm, which she hid in her sleeve. The vine only had two leaves on it, but it was enough for Feng Wu to tell that Qingyang was from the Dongsang Kingdom.","Magic Soul Vine had become quite handy. Who would have thought that what Feng Wu experienced in the tomb would be a blessing in disguise?","She walked up to Qingyang and smiled. “You want some proof, don’t you?”","Qingyang smirked. “You can’t accuse me of being a Dongsang spy when you have no evidence at all!”","“Stop fighting it,” said Feng Wu.","Qingyang was perplexed. What did Feng Wu mean?","But before she could react, Feng Wu raised her hand, and Little Phoenix charged at Qingyang.","Qingyang smirked. She wouldn’t be fooled this time.","She decided that she would keep very still this time.","She didn’t think that Feng Wu would kill her in front of everyone without a shred of evidence.","The others also gave Feng Wu doubtful looks.","How was she going to prove that Qingyang was a Dongsang spy?","The Gu family decided that if Feng Wu couldn’t prove it, they would make sure that Feng Wu was ruined forever!","Lord Gu stared at Feng Wu with eyes filled with hatred.","No matter what happened, after this was over, Feng Wu would become his lifelong enemy. He would do everything to destroy Feng Wu and her loved ones!","However...","No one saw what came next...","Not even Qingyang...","Feng Wu drew out a dagger and stabbed it into Qingyang’s chest. Qingyang didn’t even try to dodge...","Thump!"]},{"number":2385,"title":"Chapter 2385 - Untitled","paragraphs":["There was the sound of metal cutting into flesh.","The entire blade was buried in Qingyang’s chest.","Everyone was astonished.","What was that?","What did they just see?!","Qingyang was the most shocked of them all.","She never expected that Feng Wu would try to kill someone in front of the emperor!","“You...” Qingyang stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. She then looked down at her chest and saw that her clothes were soaked with her blood.","“Feng Wu! How dare you!” Gu Xingyuan shouted.","He was in love with Qingyang, and it had taken him some great effort to invite her here. However, she was going to be killed here.","“I’m going to kill you!” Gu Xingyuan’s eyes were bloodshot red.","The others all stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. Mrs. Zuo cried out, “Feng Wu, how could you do that? You’re killing an innocent person!”","Feng Wu ignored her. She kept her gaze on the pretty girl and smiled. “Do you know why I’m going to kill you?”","Qingyang gritted her teeth and wouldn’t say a word.","“Because I can only find your accomplice after I kill you.” Feng Wu smiled at her.","What did she mean? Everyone else was confused.","But Qingyang knew what she meant.","She glared at Feng Wu.","Gu Xingyuan opened his mouth again, but Emperor Wu gave Qin Yan a warning glance.","Qin Yan stepped out and kicked Gu Xingyuan, knocking him out.","No one else dared to utter a word after that.","It was so quiet that one could hear a pin drop.","Feng Wu told Qingyang, “You’re looking to the southeast now, aren’t you? Do you think looking away will save your friend? The moment I stabbed you, I saw that person clench his fists and stumble back. However, he stepped forward again so that no one would notice.”","Stumble back?","Everyone stared at Feng Wu.","When they saw Qingyang being stabbed, they were so astonished that they froze on the spot. Only a person with a guilty conscience would stumble back.","And only an angry man would clench his fists.","It was very clever for Feng Wu to reach that conclusion.","Wait!","If Feng Wu was right, that meant that Qingyang really was a Dongsang spy!","Many people turned pale.","Qingyang clenched her teeth and glared at Feng Wu. She suddenly giggled. “Miss Feng Wu, are you bluffing? Unfortunately, I’m not a Dongsang...”","“It’s him, isn’t it?”","Feng Wu pointed at a man while keeping her gaze on Qingyang.","When Qingyang saw who Feng Wu was pointing at, her pupils contracted, and her lips trembled.","“Your reaction has exposed him. Thank you, Miss Qingyang.” Feng Wu chuckled.","Everyone was shocked when they saw who Feng Wu was pointing at.","How could it be him?","Something happened at that moment!","“Watch out!”","“Xiao Wu!”","Qingyang suddenly moved.","She wrapped her arms around Feng Wu and gathered her energy together.","“It’s the explosion skill of the Dongsang Kingdom! Run!!!”"]},{"number":2386,"title":"Chapter 2386 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Turning oneself into a human bomb was a specialty of the Dongsang Kingdom, and all its people loved to use it when they were defeated.","The people of the Dongsang Kingdom had a special skill. When they chose to explode, their cultivation level would rise significantly.","For instance, when a junior Spiritual King exploded, they would exert the power of a Level 5 or 6 Spiritual King.","Everyone paled when they saw what Qingyang was going to do.","Qingyang’s energy began to surge like a volcano that was about to erupt.","Once she exploded, the power would even be able to burn houses to the ground. No human body could withstand such power!","Everyone turned pale and stumbled back.","They were sure that they were going to die.","No one had thought that a mere dancer would have such an ability.","There was no doubt that she was a Dongsang spy!","Feng Wu was the most unfortunate one.","Because Qingyang had wrapped her arms around Feng Wu when she decided to turn herself into a bomb.","“Xiao Wu!” Feng Xun’s face went ghastly pale.","If they didn’t do something, there would be nothing left of Xiao Wu.","Feng Xun turned to look at Jun Linyuan.","But Boss Jun was no longer there.","He had been sitting in the chair a moment ago; where was he now?","Rumble —","Qingyang exploded.","“Shit!”","“His Royal Highness!”","“His Royal Highness is up there!”","When the explosion started, everyone lay on their stomachs and covered their heads, but they couldn’t help looking up.","Jun Linyuan had jumped into the air so fast that no one saw how he got there. He pulled Feng Wu into his arms and kicked Qingyang away.","Boom!?","Qingyang exploded in mid-air.","She turned into a ball of fire before falling into the lake behind the manor.","Rumble!","The water erupted as high as over ten meters.","When it fell back down, it smashed a pavilion to pieces.","All the plants within the area were destroyed as well.","It was such a terrifying scene!","Everyone looked shaken.","Gu Xingyuan woke up at that moment. He looked at the silent crowd and saw that his girl wasn’t around. He immediately ran up to Feng Wu, who had just landed, and shouted, “Where is Miss Qingyang? Where did you take her? Give her back!”","Everyone found that an idiotic thing to say.","“Your Majesty, Feng Wu is abusing her power and bullying people weaker than her! She should be arrested! Your Majesty, please punish her!” Gu Xingyuan screamed.","He then realized that something was wrong.","It was too quiet.","And the looks the others gave him were so strange...","Somehow, he felt uneasy.","Everyone looked from Gu Xingyuan to Feng Wu.","Jun Linyuan was still holding Feng Wu after they landed, but there was no expression on his face, and the temperature around him was dropping.","Feng Wu licked her lips, feeling a little guilty.","She realized that Jun Linyuan was very angry.","She tugged at his sleeve."]},{"number":2387,"title":"Chapter 2387 - Your Royal Highness, Dont Be Mad","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu said, “I took the risk because I knew you would save me.”","She looked up at the teenager.","When his face darkened, it gave him an even more majestic look.","“Stop it!” Feng Wu thought.","“Why should I care if he’s attractive? I just don’t want him to tell me off in front of everyone. That would be so humiliating...”","However, the crown prince was glaring at her...","He was angry!","Many people were pleasantly surprised.","They knew how terrifying the crown prince could be when he was angry. He had once destroyed his entire residence when he lost his temper.","They thought that he was going to kill Feng Wu.","Mrs. Dugu, Mrs. Zuo, and the people of the Gu family were so excited that they almost yelled.","Emperor Wu cleared his throat and thought about stopping Jun Linyuan. However, he hesitated because he would be quite embarrassed if Jun Linyuan ignored him.","So he waited...","The crowd grew excited. The crown prince was still staring at Feng Wu and looked like he wanted to slap her.","Right now, no one cared about the second Dongsang spy that Feng Wu had discovered.","All eyes were on Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was genuinely scared every time Jun Linyuan was furious, so she always tried to appease him.","This time was no exception.","Seeing Jun Linyuan’s dark face, she knew that if she didn’t apologize now, there would be consequences. So, she tried to take Jun Linyuan’s hand.","However, as soon as her fingertips touched his fingers —","Thump!","He brushed off her hand!","The crowd’s eyes lit up.","Nice!","They began to whisper among themselves.","“I thought the rumor was that His Royal Highness liked Feng Wu and doted on her.”","“That’s not true! If that was the case, His Royal Highness wouldn’t have brushed off her hand! I bet her hand is swollen now!”","“That’s right. His Royal Highness has never liked Feng Wu.”","“I heard that His Royal Highness likes to kill people when he’s angry. Will he kill Feng Wu?”","“That would be so terrifying!”","...","Many influential families had been invited here today, and most of them had unmarried daughters. Naturally, they all considered Feng Wu their enemy.","Most of the people here wanted to see Feng Wu punished.","That was especially the case with the Gu family.","Feng Wu sighed inwardly when Jun Linyuan threw off her hand. She could walk away now, but the truth was that she had only taken the risk because she knew that Jun Linyuan would save her.","She had to show him her gratitude.","Moreover, she could tell that Jun Linyuan regretted it after he threw off her hand.","At that thought, Feng Wu tugged at his sleeve again with the most innocent look in her eyes."]},{"number":2388,"title":"Chapter 2388 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone looked at Feng Wu in disbelief.","“How can Miss Feng Wu still...”","“Why is she still holding His Royal Highness’s arm? Isn’t she afraid that he’ll throw off her hand?”","“That’s so humiliating...”","Everyone felt so embarrassed for Feng Wu.","The crown prince stared at Feng Wu and looked very displeased.","Feng Wu lowered her head and swayed his wide sleeve back and forth.","From Jun Linyuan’s angle, he could only see her lowered head.","The crown prince glowered. “If you want to die, just say so! Don’t waste my time!”","Feng Wu lowered her head and bit her lower lip.","The crowd grew excited, believing that the crown prince was going to kill Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked up and looked at Jun Linyuan like an abandoned puppy.","That look dissipated most of Jun Linyuan’s anger.","He glared at the girl. “What are you going to tell me now?”","Feng Wu lowered her head and said, “I...”","Jun Linyuan said, “I can’t hear you!”","Feng Wu whimpered, “I’m sorry...”","Jun Linyuan asked, “What are you sorry for?”","Feng Wu said, “I shouldn’t have gotten myself in danger...”","Jun Linyuan grumbled, “Are you going to do it again?!”","Feng Wu looked up. When she saw his cold face, she immediately looked down and said, “No, of course not...”","She kicked around some pebbles and mumbled, “I only did it because you were there.”","Hearing that, the crown prince couldn’t bring himself to be mad at her anymore.","The girl then looked up and smiled at him. It was a very bright smile, but it was obsequious at the same time.","The teenager’s face lit up.","He gave Feng Wu such an affectionate look.","The crowd was baffled.","WHAT?!","Wasn’t he supposed to push Feng Wu away and humiliate her?","Instead of the scene they had expected, they had to watch how much the crown prince fancied Feng Wu.","It took everyone by surprise.","All the Gu brothers were astonished.","The others all looked like they had been struck by lightning.","Mrs. Dugu grabbed Mrs. Zuo and whispered, “Tell Qingluan to come back now!” Otherwise, they would lose everything!","The truth was, Mrs. Zuo was flustered as well.","The way the crown prince looked at Feng Wu made Mrs. Zuo very uneasy.","But she couldn’t let Mrs. Dugu see it.","“How does Qingluan have anything to do with it?” Mrs. Zuo feigned a calm tone.","Mrs. Dugu gave Mrs. Zuo a long look. She knew that Mrs. Zuo could see it as well.","She only said, “If Qingluan doesn’t come back now, that girl will take His Royal Highness from her! You’ll regret it for the rest of your life!”"]},{"number":2389,"title":"Chapter 2389 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Mrs. Zuo smirked. “That girl is nothing compared with Qingluan!”","Mrs. Dugu shook her head inwardly.","If Mrs. Dugu could see it, so could everyone else.","The crown prince was obviously in love with the girl.","Lord Gu couldn’t feel any more frustrated.","He stared at Lady Gu and wanted to tear her to pieces.","If she had told him Feng Wu’s relationship with the crown prince, he would never have made such a huge mistake!","Jun Linshen was almost in tears. He had really thought that Feng Wu was only Jun Linyuan’s maid, but he realized now that he couldn’t be more wrong. She was obviously Jun Linyuan’s favorite woman!","Of course, many people were still trying to convince themselves that the crown prince didn’t mean that...","“Ahem —”","Emperor Wu cleared his throat at that moment and asked, “Xiao Wu, are we still looking for that spy?”","Feng Wu had no idea how her interaction with Jun Linyuan had shocked the others. She was used to talking to Jun Linyuan that way.","She was perplexed when she saw the look in everyone else’s eyes. She came back to her senses when she heard Emperor Wu.","That was right!","She still hadn’t finished the tenth trial yet!","There had been three names left on the list a moment before, but now there were only two. Qingyang really had been a spy from the Dongsang Kingdom.","And another one was...","Feng Wu turned around and looked at old Steward Gu.","Meanwhile, Qin Yan was holding down the old man.","Seeing that Feng Wu was looking his way, Qin Yan explained, “When the explosion happened, he tried to run.”","Qin Yan was a very advanced cultivator and had never lost a battle.","Apart from Emperor Wu, he almost never spoke to anyone. It was very rare for him to speak to Feng Wu.","Qin Yan was holding down old Steward Gu with one foot.","Feng Wu walked up to the old man, crouched down, and smiled at him.","Seeing this, the crown prince pulled her back a little.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She said softly, “Don’t worry. You’re here. What can possibly happen?”","The crown prince rolled his eyes at her. He was worried about her!","Feng Wu turned back to the steward. “Why did you run? You’ve exposed yourself.”","Lord Gu said, “Your Majesty, Steward Gu is a servant who was born into this family. He definitely isn’t a spy!”","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder and said, “Lord Gu, you talk too much. It’ll affect my deductions.”","Emperor Wu looked at his guards.","The guards immediately grabbed Lord Gu’s arms, forced him to kneel and stuffed two walnuts into his mouth.","Lord Gu could neither speak nor move.","“I have no idea what Miss Feng is talking about.” Steward Gu denied all accusations.","Feng Wu smiled. Of course he was a Dongsang spy.. The magical vine in her palm was moving so violently!"]},{"number":2390,"title":"Chapter 2390 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu chuckled. “Do you know how I spotted Qingyang and your friend?”","She moved closer and whispered something in his ear.","The old man’s pupils contracted, and he glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu had just told him that she could read minds.","Whenever she was close enough to a person, she could hear what they were thinking.","“No! I don’t believe you!” The old man activated his energy and tried to block Feng Wu.","“Are you telling yourself not to think about that last friend’s whereabouts?” Feng Wu smiled at him. “I already read your mind. You’re so worried about that person.”","Steward Gu closed his eyes.","He wouldn’t let Feng Wu see any emotions on his face.","Feng Wu waved her hand, and a tiny tiger jumped out of her sleeve.","The cub was slighter bigger than before, but it still looked like a ball of white fur.","Feng Wu patted its head and said, “This old man has a special smell of blood on him. Take a sniff and find the person he has hidden away.”","Steward Gu smirked.","The smell of blood? The person he had hidden away was indeed injured.","But he had washed off the blood on his sleeve!","No one could smell it!","To his surprise, the cub kept sniffing at his sleeve and wouldn’t leave.","The old man’s stomach lurched.","He opened his eyes and saw that it was focusing on the spot where his sleeve had been stained with the blood.","To fend off Feng Wu’s mental power, he had stiffened. He almost lost control when he saw the cub.","Feng Wu patted the cub and said, “Go!”","The cub dashed off and was soon out of sight.","Feng Wu kept her gaze on Steward Gu the entire time.","The old man was obviously relieved when he saw the cub run away.","His stomach lurched when he saw Feng Wu’s gaze.","Feng Wu smiled mysteriously, and it only made Steward Gu more nervous.","He recalled that Feng Wu was able to force Qingyang to take action because Qingyang hadn’t been calm enough. Right now, Feng Wu was studying his face.","He snorted. “You can try all you want, but you won’t read my mind!”","His eyes then darted around.","He looked everywhere, trying to confuse Feng Wu.","The crowd couldn’t help but look at Feng Wu.","“So, everything she said was a bluff. She’s actually observing Steward Gu’s facial expressions.”","“Unfortunately, she can only use that trick once.”","“Steward Gu isn’t stupid. He won’t fall for the same trick twice.”","“Miss Feng Wu thinks too highly of herself.”","...","The truth was, Emperor Wu thought the same as well. Therefore, he wanted to know how Feng Wu was going to find the third person.","The cub came back with a wooden box in its mouth.","It was covered with mud.. Needless to say, the cub had just dug it out."]},{"number":2391,"title":"Chapter 2391 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Someone laughed. “What a silly cub. It was supposed to look for a person, and what did it find?”","“That wooden box is so small it can barely fit a person’s ashes, let alone a person.”","“Why do I feel that Miss Feng Wu is bluffing?”","...","No one had much hope in Feng Wu.","They didn’t believe that she could find all three spies in a row. Moreover, if all three were to be found here, the Gu family would be so unlucky.","However, Steward Gu’s eyes popped when he saw the wooden box.","He glared at Feng Wu, and his eyes were bloodshot red.","Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder.”You spent a lot of time blocking my mind. Even if you turn into a human bomb now, it won’t be very effective. Just give up.”","Steward Gu glared at Feng Wu and wanted to swallow her whole.","She had done it on purpose!","The cub put down the box and looked proudly at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu rubbed its head. “Good job!”","The cub happily rolled around in her arms.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu opened the box.","Inside was a finely made bronze key.","Steward Gu bit his lower lip.","“What door does it open?” Feng Wu asked.","“You’ll never find it!” Steward Gu smiled eerily, and blood oozed out of his mouth.","He had hidden some poison in his mouth!","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Someone said unhappily, “That was so careless of her! With Steward Gu dead, we’ll never find the last spy!”","Feng Wu ignored the complaint. She just grinned at the old man. “Do you think your death can stop me from finding that door? Let me remind you: While you were glancing around, you kept avoiding a single spot.”","Steward Gu wasn’t dead yet, so he heard those words.","He looked horrified.","“That is the place you were avoiding looking at, right?” Feng Wu threw the wooden box at the rockery nearby.","The rockery slid open to reveal a red door behind it.","The Gu brothers all looked at Lord Gu, surprised that there was such a secret chamber in the manor, but Lord Gu frowned because he didn’t know anything about it.","Steward Gu couldn’t believe his eyes.","Feng Wu chuckled. “People of Dongsang are so stupid. How can they fall for the same trick twice? Am I right, captain of the Jupiter Team?”","Steward Gu’s pupils contracted. He stared at Feng Wu until he dropped to the ground and died.","Feng Wu tossed the key to Feng Xun and let him take care of the rest.","Feng Xun opened the door.","Sunlight lit up the dim room, and they saw an injured person sitting against the wall.","The last spy was found.","What happened next was none of Feng Wu’s business.","She bid Emperor Wu farewell, saying that she needed to go home to her beautiful mother."]},{"number":2392,"title":"Chapter 2392 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Of course, Emperor Wu wouldn’t stop her.","Seeing that Feng Wu was gone, the others left as well.","On their way home —","Qiuling, Chaoge, and Feng Wu were in the same carriage.","“Xiao Wu, you’re amazing!” Chaoge grabbed Feng Wu’s hand in excitement. “I knew they would give us trouble, but I didn’t expect it to be on such a scale!”","Qiuling remained silent, but she kept looking at Feng Wu with admiration in her eyes.","No matter what those people threw at Feng Wu, she managed to fight back every single time. She practically destroyed Lord Gu’s family all by herself.","“Miss Wu, what do you think will happen to the Gu family?” Qiuling asked curiously.","Feng Wu smiled. “Lord Gu tried to kill his wife, so the Long family will be after him. However, his biggest problem is those Dongsang spies. His Majesty probably won’t execute the entire family, but Lord Gu will definitely lose his title.”","“Will they still be one of the nine major clans?” Duan Chaoge asked.","Feng Wu shook her head. “I’m not sure. It will depend on if the nine clans join hands.”","Qiuling said, “I saw that Lady Gu was left behind in the Gu family.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Seeing that the Gu family was going to be in trouble, Lady Gu had immediately wanted to go back to the Feng family. Unfortunately, after what she did to Feng Wu, the Feng family would never take her back.","“What about Lady Wang?” Qiuling asked. “I’m sure she was in on it as well.”","Feng Wu smiled. “She’ll have a hard time, too.”","Now that all three elders were on Feng Wu’s side, Lady Wang’s days were numbered.","Before long, they arrived at the Feng manor.","Feng Wu got out and saw that Lady Wang’s carriage was hesitating to move closer.","It seemed that Lady Wang had genuinely been frightened by what happened today.","Feng Wu didn’t have time for Lady Wang at the moment, and decided to let her stay scared for a while.","Lady Wang’s carriage only approached the front gate of the Feng manor after Feng Wu left.","Lady Wang opened the curtain of the carriage and let out a breath of relief when she saw that Feng Wu was really gone. “Gosh, finally!”","Feng Sang asked coldly, “Mother, are you afraid of her?”","Lady Wang almost jumped at the sudden voice. She glared at Feng Sang and said, “Nonsense!”","Feng Sang said, “Our carriage was in the front at first, but you told the driver to slow down, and you wouldn’t move closer to their carriage... Mother, I thought you were going to kill her to avenge Liu, but now...”","“Shut up!” Lady Wang glowered at Feng Sang.","She wondered why her daughter wasn’t afraid.","“Feng Wu is His Majesty’s favorite now. It’s not that easy to get our revenge! We need a good plan!” Lady Wang rushed into the house after that.","Feng Wu went back to Fallen Star Yard.","Granny Zhao came out in a hurry. “Miss Wu, you’re back! Are you alright?”","Qiuling asked, “Granny Zhao, why are you so worried?”","Granny Zhao said, “People have been saying that Miss Wu killed Mrs. Gu! I was worried sick!”","Qiuling chuckled."]},{"number":2393,"title":"Chapter 2393 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Granny Zhao smacked Qiuling on the head. “Stop it! How can you still laugh?!”","Qiuling chuckled. “Miss Wu didn’t kill anyone, so there’s no need to worry. You have no idea what we saw in the Gu manor today. It was such an eye-opener!”","Granny Zhao’s eyes lit up. “Tell me all about it.”","Qiuling said, “You’ll never guess who the culprit was.”","Granny Zhao asked, “Who?","Qiuling told her everything.","Both Qiuling and Chaoge were good storytellers. Granny Zhao and Uncle Qiu’s mouths dropped open as they listened.","In the end, Qiuling smacked the marriage agreement on the table. “The Gu manor will fall, and Lady Gu isn’t coming back! No one will dare pick on us again!”","...","Meanwhile, similar conversations were taking place in nearly all families in the imperial capital.","From the officials to the street vendors.","“What? Feng Wu didn’t attack Mrs. Gu?!","“Lord Gu was the culprit?","“And the Gu manor was hiding a spy?","“What?! There were three of them?!”","...","Only the night before, they had been discussing how Feng Wu had killed Mrs. Gu, but things had turned around completely.","Not only didn’t Miss Feng Wu kill Mrs. Gu, she also helped to catch the spies!","Everyone in the imperial capital was talking about it.","Somehow, no one mentioned the crown prince’s interactions with Feng Wu, probably because the people who had seen it chose to omit the fact. As a result, the common people still had no idea how the crown prince felt about Feng Wu.","But the topic soon changed because —","“Xiao Wu!”","Chaoge had been listening to other people complimenting Feng Wu in a teahouse, but she jumped to her feet when she heard the news.","“Look! There are so many magpies!”","“Are they here to congratulate Miss Feng Wu?”","“No! That’s not it! Look! That’s a phoenix carriage!”","...","“Magpies and a phoenix carriage... Gosh! It’s Miss Zuo Qingluan!”","“That’s right! It must be her! I heard that she was coming back!”","“She has the True Phoenix Blood and is the most talented girl in our empire!”","“Yes, it’s her!”","The crowd was so excited that they all rushed into the streets.","Zuo Qingluan?!","The smile froze on Chaoge’s face.","Of course she knew who that was. Back then, Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan both had the True Phoenix Blood, and they were known as the ‘two genius girls of the imperial capital.’","People used to compare them all the time.","Chaoge jumped out the window on the second floor and ran back to Fallen Star Yard.","“Xiao Wu! I have bad news!” Chaoge ran into the courtyard.","Feng Wu had been cultivating under the grape trellis. Hearing that, she looked at Chaoge in bewilderment.","“What? Is the sky going to cave in?” she asked grumpily.","Chaoge said, “No, but you’re going to have trouble!”","Feng Wu stood up and straightened her skirt. “Why is that?”","Chaoge dragged her toward the front door. “Zuo Qingluan is back!”","Feng Wu paused."]},{"number":2394,"title":"Chapter 2394 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Chaoge almost tripped.","She looked gingerly at Feng Wu. Zuo Qingluan was her archenemy, so was she afraid? She wondered if she had done the wrong thing when she tried to take Feng Wu to see Zuo Qingluan.","Chaoge was feeling uneasy, when Feng Wu said, “Let’s go.”","But Chaoge didn’t want to go anymore, so she said, “Xiao Wu, I don’t think we should go...”","“Why not?” Feng Wu put her hand on Chaoge’s shoulder and smiled. “I’d like to meet my archenemy as well and see how she’s doing. Let’s go.”","The streets were packed.","“Miss Qingluan is heading toward East Avenue! Everyone, get moving!”","“Miss Qingluan is giving out gifts!”","“She’s so generous!”","The common folk followed Zuo Qingluan’s team in great excitement.","Chaoge asked the teenager next to her, “What gifts?”","The teenager said, “Do you not know? Miss Qingluan has come back! Do you see all the magpies?”","Chaoge said, “Yes, I know that!”","The teenager said, “Each magpie has a red envelope in its beak, and they’re dropping them from time to time. That’s why we’re all following her carriage!”","Chaoge said sarcastically, “That’s so generous of Zuo Qingluan. She’s even more lavish than His Majesty!”","The teenager stared at Chaoge. “It’s not like that. Miss Qingluan has been cultivating in seclusion in Firmament Palace for five years. She shouldn’t sneak into the city, should she? She’s not like Feng Wu!”","Chaoge said, “What’s that supposed to mean?”","The teenager was obviously a fan of Zuo Qingluan. Hearing her tone, he glared at her and wouldn’t answer.","“What’s your name?” Chaoge decided to remember his name.","“I’m Xue Ziyi.”","Chaoge said, “What did you say about Feng Wu? What’s wrong with her? She’s great!”","Xue Ziyi said, “Even so, the crown prince is still going to marry Miss Qingluan!”","Chaoge wouldn’t have it. “Nope. The crown prince is going to marry Xiao Wu!”","Xue Ziyi gave Chaoge a contemptuous look before looking away.","Chaoge didn’t like his attitude. “What’s that look in your eyes?”","“Contempt,” Xue Ziyi said directly.","Chaoge grabbed him by the sleeve. “Xiao Wu is so much better than Zuo Qingluan! She’s the one His Royal Highness is going to marry!”","Chaoge didn’t like the idea of Feng Wu being involved with Jun Linyuan, but she didn’t like losing to Zuo Qingluan either.","Xue Ziyi glanced at her and grumbled, “His Royal Highness has to be blind.”","Chaoge said, “You!”","“There, there.” Feng Wu patted her. “Be quiet and watch the show.”","Chaoge was so frustrated.","She thought, “His Royal Highness likes Xiao Wu so much! You’ll see!”","Just then, someone shouted, “The envelopes are raining down again!”"]},{"number":2395,"title":"Chapter 2395 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Catch them! Catch them!”","“This way, please!”","The crowd was in a frantic mood.","Everyone was bumping into everyone, and Feng Wu was almost shoved to the ground. She grabbed Chaoge and jumped onto the roof of a house, where things were quieter.","But the roofs weren’t deserted either.","In fact, to catch the envelopes, many people were climbing up to the roofs as they spoke.","“What’s in the envelopes? Why are they so excited?” Chaoge snapped.","“That Zuo Qingluan just has to let everyone know that she’s back! That’s so pretentious!”","While Chaoge was venting her sarcasm inwardly, a middle-aged woman nearby said, “Kiddo, what are you talking about? Aren’t you excited?”","She was quite lucky. There were already three or four envelopes in her hands.","“There’s everything in these envelopes! Look, this one says 50 copper coins. That’s good.” The woman showed Chaoge the content. “Take it to the shop of the Zuo family on East Avenue, and they’ll cash it out for you.”","“50 copper coins?” Chaoge rolled her eyes. “That’s not very generous.”","The woman didn’t agree. “It’s now my luckiest day. The luckier ones will have vouchers for silver in their envelopes. I hear someone found 100 taels of silver in theirs! I do hope I can find the top prize. It’s supposed to be a house! Here in the imperial capital!”","Chaoge said angrily, “She’s bribing everyone!”","The woman didn’t think much of it. “I wish there were more people like her!”","Chaoge was so angry that she didn’t know what to say.","Meanwhile, up in the air —","Zuo Qingluan was sitting in the phoenix carriage, and next to her was Tongque, her maid.","Tongque held a gilded envelope in her hand, which was none other than the top prize for today.","It was a courtyard worth a small fortune here in the imperial capital.","Tongque was very satisfied with her design of the event. She had sent out word in advance that Miss Qingluan was coming back today and would be giving out gifts. As expected, many people showed up.","Their carriage wasn’t very high up, so Tongque soon saw the people standing on the rooftops.","Although it had been five years —","Tongque immediately recognized Feng Wu and Chaoge.","“Miss Qingluan, look —”","Tongque pointed in the direction of Feng Wu and Chaoge.","Zuo Qingluan had been resting her mind with her eyes closed. She was displeased when Tongque disturbed her, but she still looked in that direction.","From hundreds of meters away, she spotted her archenemy right away.","“Miss Qingluan, that’s Feng Wu, right?” Tongque sounded excited. “She must know that we’re giving out gifts! How hard must her life be? She’s waiting for our handouts!”","The two girls were known as the two genius girls of the imperial capital five years ago.","But now, Zuo Qingluan was high up in the carriage, and Feng Wu was supposed to be a nobody who had lost all her abilities!"]},{"number":2396,"title":"Chapter 2396 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zuo Qingluan’s face darkened a little when Tongque mentioned Feng Wu.","She followed the direction Tongque was pointing in.","A slender girl in a red dress stood on a rooftop. It was impossible to miss her despite the large crowd.","Seeing Zuo Qingluan’s frown, Tongque suddenly had an idea. She threw out the envelope in her hand.","Unlike the other envelopes, this one was gilded and looked spectacular.","It flew right in Feng Wu’s direction.","“It’s her lucky day. That’s a big house that comes with a courtyard,” Tongque said arrogantly as she looked down at Feng Wu.","She decided that people would look down upon Feng Wu as well if she accepted this gift with great excitement.","Zuo Qingluan gave Tongque a sideway glance and shook her head. “She’s a nobody. Why bother?”","Tongque was baffled.","Zuo Qingluan raised her chin, looking as proud as an empress. “She’s as common as everyone else. Paying attention to her is the same as complimenting her.”","Tongque immediately slapped herself and said, “I’m sorry, Miss Qingluan.”","Zuo Qingluan asked contemptuously, “What are you sorry for?”","Tongque said, “You’ve defeated her for good, so she isn’t worth your attention. No, even I shouldn’t pay any attention to her.”","Zuo Qingluan nodded. “If you dislike someone, it means that you still care about them. I, on the other hand, ignore Feng Wu completely.”","Tongque immediately nodded. “Yes, Miss Qingluan.”","Zuo Qingluan kept her head up and never lowered her gaze.","Soon, the phoenix carriage disappeared from sight.","“Why is she leaving so soon? I didn’t even get to take a look at her.” Xue Ziyi’s tone was filled with regret.","The middle-aged woman felt sorry to see Zuo Qingluan leave as well. “No more gifts. What a shame.”","Just then, they saw the gilded envelope.","It was obviously headed for Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at the carriage and could sense Zuo Qingluan’s mocking.","“Xiao Wu?”","Chaoge was surprised when Feng Wu caught the envelope.","Everyone else looked at her enviously.","They all could tell that it was a very special gift.","“Xiao Wu, that’s...” Chaoge realized that the envelope had been given to Feng Wu on purpose, and she was furious. She shouted, “She means to humiliate you! Xiao Wu, you can’t take it!”","She wanted to tear it up.","There were so many people around, and if word got out that Feng Wu had accepted Zuo Qingluan’s house as a gift...","Five years ago, Feng Wu used to be mentioned alongside Zuo Qingluan. Some people still compared the two of them now.","Right now, that envelope could bring her a lot of trouble!","“Is that the special prize?” Xue Ziyi immediately recognized the envelope.","“The special prize? Do you mean the top prize? The house?!” The middle-aged woman was exceptionally loud."]},{"number":2397,"title":"Chapter 2397 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Top prize? A house in the imperial capital?","Land prices were exorbitantly high, and people even wrote poems about it.","A house with a courtyard would be worth a fortune! Everyone had been dreaming about getting it, but now —","Things wouldn’t be so complicated if someone else hadn’t recognized Feng Wu.","“Wait, isn’t she Miss Feng Wu?”","“Gosh, it really is her!”","“If I remember correctly, weren’t Miss Qingluan and Miss Feng Wu once called the genius girls of the imperial capital?”","“That’s right! I remember that, too!”","“But now, Miss Qingluan is riding a phoenix carriage and giving out gifts, and Miss Feng Wu is competing with us for gifts!”","...","The crowd was already on Zuo Qingluan’s side, and now that Feng Wu had received the top prize, they became even more displeased. Their comments became quite mean.","They believed that after everything they said, Feng Wu, if she had any self-respect, should give away that gift.","Chaoge glared at the crowd.","She couldn’t believe what these people would say or do for money!","If Feng Wu gave up the gift, it would look like she had been forced.","But if she ignored them, these people would keep attacking her.","Chaoge scratched her head and didn’t know what to do.","When she wanted to comfort Feng Wu, she saw Feng Wu winking at her.","There was a smile in Feng Wu’s eyes.","How could she still be smiling?! Chaoge was shocked.","So was everyone else.","How could she still be smiling?","Shouldn’t she be fidgeting and flustered?","“Let’s go.” Feng Wu patted Chaoge on the shoulder and quickly led her away, leaving the baffled crowd behind.","“Did she leave just like that?!” The middle-aged woman couldn’t believe it. “Doesn’t she feel ashamed?!”","Xue Ziyi said, “I’ve never seen anyone so shameless!”","Someone sighed. “I don’t think Miss Feng Wu is living very happily in the Feng clan.”","Only the insiders in Imperial College knew how well Feng Wu was doing at school.","And because the Dongsang spies were involved, Emperor Wu had forbidden everyone from talking about what happened in the Gu manor.","Therefore, the common people only knew Feng Wu as she had been when she lost her abilities.","Fallen Star Yard.","Chaoge finally realized what had happened, and she shouted at Feng Wu, “Xiao Wu, you can’t accept it! We need to give it back!”","Feng Wu blinked. “Why?”","Chaoge asked, “Why?! It’s from Zuo Qingluan! You’re her equal, but if you take the envelope, that means that you’re inferior to her!”"]},{"number":2398,"title":"Chapter 2398 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu smiled. “Is that so?”","Chaoge said, “Of course it is!”","Feng Wu nodded.","Chaoge was speechless. “Many people will be there to watch us when you cash out that voucher! It’ll be so humiliating!”","Feng Wu grinned. “But I’m not going to cash it out.”","Chaoge said, “Then what are you going to do with it?”","Feng Wu raised her chin. “I have a plan!”","Just then, she heard a “ding.” After that, she couldn’t hear anything Chaoge said because all her attention turned to the fairy in her head.","“The eleventh trial is here!” the fairy said excitedly.","The eleventh trial? Feng Wu was intrigued.","The tenth trial had been to find everyone on the revival list of the Dongsang Kingdom, and Feng Wu had discovered the last three people in the Gu family. Now that the tenth trial had been completed, the eleventh trial was finally announced.","Feng Wu was very excited.","There were only twelve trials in total.","She was on the eleventh one; that was to say, she only had one more to go after this one. After that, her beautiful master would wake up again, and he said last time that he would be able to stay a little longer this time!","“Xiao Wu, what’s wrong?!” Seeing that Feng Wu was in tears, Chaoge panicked.","But Feng Wu was talking to the fairy in her head and didn’t know how anxious Chaoge had become.","“What’s the eleventh trial? Tell me!”","Feng Wu urged the tiny fairy. “Tell me!”","The fairy looked timidly at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched!","Sh*t!","Whenever the fairy got that look on her face, it meant that the task would be very tricky.","“Just tell me what it is.” Feng Wu tried to appease the fairy. “I’ve completed ten trials so far; how much worse can it be? Just tell me.”","The fairy looked up and said, “Do you want to hear it now?”","Feng Wu said, “Go ahead!”","The fairy said, “Well, this trial has something to do with Zuo Qingluan.”","Feng Wu frowned. “Do I need to kill her?” Zuo Qingluan was supposed to be very capable now, and it wouldn’t be very easy to do that.","The fairy shook her head. “It’s a little trickier than that...”","Feng Wu said, “Say it!”","The fairy cleared her throat and said, “The eleventh trial: Make Zuo Qingluan realize that Jun Linyuan is in love with you.”","WHAT?!","Cough, cough —","Feng Wu almost choked on her spit.","She couldn’t believe her ears.","She asked angrily, “What did you just say? I need to make Zuo Qingluan realize that Jun Linyuan is in love... with me.”","The fairy nodded solemnly.","Feng Wu mumbled, “To do that, Jun Linyuan has to actually be in love with me...”"]},{"number":2399,"title":"Chapter 2399 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu stared at the fairy. “Is he?!”","She answered the question before the fairy could. “Of course not!”","The fairy gave her a “you idiot” look.","Feng Wu said, “There’s something wrong with this task! Jun Linyuan isn’t in love with me, so how am I supposed to make Zuo Qingluan realize it?!”","The fairy nodded.","Feng Wu snapped, “Why are you nodding at me?!”","The fairy disappeared after that.","“Xiao Wu, Xiao Wu!” Seeing the various expressions on Feng Wu’s face, Chaoge was scared out of her wits. She grabbed her shoulders and shook her. “Xiao Wu! Wake up! Stop daydreaming!”","Finally, Feng Wu came back to reality.","“Make Zuo Qingluan realize that Jun Linyuan is in love with me. That’s insane...” Feng Wu murmured.","Chaoge only heard part of it. “What did you say about His Royal Highness?”","Feng Wu rose to her feet. “It’s nothing. Let me think about it...”","Luckily, there wasn’t a deadline, so she thought that she could stall for some time.","“You need to complete it in a month, or the twelfth trial will never be announced...” the fairy said timidly in her head.","Feng Wu wanted to scream.","A month?!","Did that mean that she needed to make Jun Linyuan fall in love with her in a month? That was so difficult!","Letting Zuo Qingluan know about it was the easy part.","She tried to reason with the fairy. “Can we change the requirements a little? Can I make Zuo Qingluan believe it?”","She was confident that she could plant that idea in Zuo Qingluan’s head.","However, the fairy immediately turned her down. “It can’t be altered!”","Feng Wu said, “I want to smack you on the head...”","The fairy cringed and went silent.","Feng Wu walked back and forth in the room, grinding her teeth.","“Xiao Wu?” Chaoge was baffled.","Feng Wu said, “Go ask around. Find out where the crown prince is.”","Chaoge said, “Xiao Wu, you’re not in love with the crown prince, are you?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s not important. Find out where he is first.”","Chaoge glanced at her.","Xiao Wu had always been level-headed, but whenever the crown prince was involved, she would become quite jumpy. She clearly had feelings for him!","“Will Xiao Wu fall in love with the man?” Chaoge didn’t like the idea, but she still went to ask around as Feng Wu instructed.","She went to see Feng Xun because he would definitely know where the crown prince was.","Hearing Chaoge’s description of Feng Wu, Feng Xun said, “I knew that Xiao Wu would come to Boss Jun, and I was right. Boss Jun has some errands to run today, but he’ll be at the Ninth Hall tomorrow. Tell Xiao Wu to find him there.”","At the same time.","The Zuo family.","Zuo Qingluan arrived outside the Zuo manor in her phoenix carriage.","The Zuo family was thrilled, and Mrs.. Zuo ran out of the house, wanting to give Zuo Qingluan a big hug. However, when she was a meter away from her daughter —"]},{"number":2400,"title":"Chapter 2400 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Zuo was stopped by an invisible force and couldn’t move any closer.","Zuo Qingluan gave her a long, hard look.","Tongque knew that look well. It was a look of contempt.","Mrs. Zuo was still holding her arms out, when Zuo Qingluan walked past her and into the house without so much as a glance.","Mrs. Zuo looked like she had been slapped.","“What are you doing, just standing there? Go with her!” Master Zuo reminded her.","Mrs. Zuo felt very sad.","Zuo Qingluan had been cold five years ago, but not to this extent. Feeling hurt, Mrs. Zuo murmured, “But she...”","Master Zuo glared at her. “She’s the sacred lady of Firmament Palace now and second only to the palace master! She’s not the little girl who rolled around in your arms anymore!”","That was a reminder to Mrs. Zuo. Her husband was right. Zuo Qingluan was a Spiritual King now, and everyone in the Junwu Empire knew of her. That thought made Mrs. Zuo feel a little better.","Her plan had been to complain to her daughter as soon as she was back, telling her how Feng Wu had killed her siblings, but now...","Master Zuo said, “You shouldn’t bring it up. Wait until she asks. That’ll work better!”","Mrs. Zuo agreed.","However, no matter how long she waited, Zuo Qingluan never mentioned any of her siblings. Mrs. Zuo was deeply disappointed.","Despite the Zuo family’s hospitality, Zuo Qingluan behaved like a guest in a hotel. She went back to her courtyard and wouldn’t receive any visitors.","Tongque was a maid from Firmament Palace and had little feelings for the Zuo family.","In Phoenix Yard.","Zuo Qingluan frowned as soon as the door was closed.","“It’s too noisy.” Her kinsmen’s ingratiating gazes annoyed Zuo Qingluan.","Tongque knew how little her lady thought of the common people, so she said, “Miss Qingluan, if you don’t like it here, how about we go and stay at Firmament Pavilion?”","Firmament Pavilion was the imperial capital branch of Firmament Palace, and the sacred lady could use the resources there freely.","The only person Zuo Qingluan wanted to see in the imperial capital was...","“Send this letter for me.” Zuo Qingluan had just finished writing a letter.","Tongque saw that her lady had washed her hands and put on some incense before she sat down to write the letter, and it took her a whole hour to finish it.","She was very surprised.","Back in Firmament Palace, nothing seemed to concern their sacred lady, but now, she was so serious about this letter.","Who was it for?","Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t usually bother herself over such petty matters, but today, she folded the letter and put a fragrant rose petal in it.","After sealing the envelope, she told Tongque, “Go to the crown prince’s residence and give the letter to His Royal Highness.”","“His Royal Highness? As in the famous Jun Linyuan?!” Tongque’s eyes lit up."]}]);
